ent":"a young Santhal child classmate showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"I came from the village.","meaning_en":"I came from the village.","meaning_bn":"গ্রাম থেকে এসেছি।","pronunciation":"Inj do atu khoninj hej akana.","meaning_hi":"मैं गांव से आया हूं","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ଗାଁରୁ ଆସିଥିଲି"}},{"id":"","order":11,"type":"text","markdown":"Nowa do ched kana?","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱪᱮᱫ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ?","textLatin":"Nowa do ched kana?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নওয়া দ চেদ কানা?","textHindi":"नोवा द चेद काना?","textOdia":"ନୋୱା ଦ ଚେଦ କାନା?","emotion":"Kindness","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Explore nature","imageDirection":"Olitun kneels in a patch of wild flowers, looking at the colorful petals with curiosity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Gentle smile, soft eyes, hands offering help or gesturing politely with care.","learningMoment":"Olitun putting empathy into action, helping classmates or respecting elders.","meaning":"What is this?","meaning_en":"What is this?","meaning_bn":"এটা কি?","pronunciation":"Nowa do ched kana?","meaning_hi":"यह क्या है?","meaning_or":"ଏହା କ’ଣ?"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Nowa do dare kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ ।","textLatin":"Nowa do dare kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নওয়া দ দারে কানা ।","textHindi":"नोवा द दारे काना ।","textOdia":"ନୋୱା ଦ ଦାରେ କାନା ।","emotion"