aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱤᱧ ᱠᱩᱥᱤᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Inj do Santali ror inj kusiyag-aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ সানতাড়ি রড় ইঞ কুসিয়াঃ আ।।","textHindi":"इञ द सानताड़ि रड़ इञ कुसियागआ।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ସାନତାଡ଼ି ରଡ଼ ଇଞ କୁସିୟାଗଆ।","emotion":"Kindness","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Explore nature","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands beside a traditional home, pointing happily at a colorful detail on the hand-painted wall. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Gentle smile, soft eyes, hands offering help or gesturing politely with care.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate putting empathy into action, helping classmates or respecting elders.","meaning":"I like speaking Santali.","meaning_en":"I like speaking Santali.","meaning_bn":"আমি সাঁওতালি বলতে পছন্দ করি।","pronunciation":"Inj do Santali ror inj kusiyag-aa.","meaning_hi":"मुझे संताली बोलना पसंद है","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ସାନ୍ତାଳୀ କହିବାକୁ ପସନ୍ଦ କରେ |"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do kamiyam?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤᱭᱟᱢ?","textLatin":"Am do kamiyam?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ কামিয়াম?","textHindi":"आम द कामियाम?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ କାମିୟାମ?","emotion":"Curiosity","storyArc":"Making New Friend","growthValue":"Communication","characterGoal":"Make a new friend","imageDirection":"Olitun carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Eyes wide with wonder, body leaning forward, pointing with an inquisitive finger.","learningMoment":"Olitun demonstrating active observation and a love for finding out new things.","meaning":"Do you work?","meaning_en":"Do you work?","meaning_bn":"আপনি কি কাজ করেন?","pronunciation":"Am do kamiyam?","meaning_hi":"क्या आप काम करते हो","meaning_or":"ଆପଣ କାମ କରନ୍ତି କି?"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Hẽ, inj do kamiyanj.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱸ, ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤᱭᱟᱹᱧ।","textLatin":"Hẽ, inj do kamiyanj.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেঁ, ইঞ দ কামিয়াঞ।","textHindi":"हेँ, इञ द कामियाञ।","textOdia":"ହେଁ, ଇଞ ଦ କାମିୟାଞ।","emotion":"Friendship","storyArc":"Exploring Village","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Warm direct eye contact, relaxed shoulders, open arms in a welcoming gesture.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"Yes, I work.","meaning_en":"Yes, I work.","meaning_bn":"হ্যাঁ, আমি কাজ করি।","pronunciation":"Hẽ, inj do kamiyanj.","meaning_hi":"हां, मैं काम करता हूं","meaning_or":"ହଁ, ମୁଁ କାମ କରେ |"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Uni do okare menaya?","textOlChiki":"ᱩᱱᱤ ᱫᱚ ᱚᱠᱟᱨᱮ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱭᱟ?","textLatin":"Uni do okare menaya?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_basics_17/vie