e.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_vocab_idioms_intermediate_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_vocab_idioms_intermediate_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দাকা উতু","textHindi":"दाका उतु","textOdia":"ଦାକା ଉତୁ","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Practice communication","imageDirection":"Olitun points to a chalkboard showing simple diagrams, looking encouragingly toward classmates.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","pronunciation":"Daka utu – Rice and curry / Meal","meaning":"Rice and curry / Meal","meaning_en":"Rice and curry / Meal","meaning_bn":"ভাত ও তরকারি/খাবার","meaning_hi":"चावल और करी/भोजन","meaning_or":"ଚାଉଳ ଏବଂ ତରକାରୀ / ଭୋଜନ |"}},{"id":"blk_text_21","order":21,"type":"text","markdown":"Hor bharsa tumba rasa.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱚᱲ ᱵᱷᱚᱨᱥᱟ ᱛᱩᱢᱵᱟ. ᱨᱟᱥᱟ","textLatin":"Hor bharsa tumba rasa.","meta":{"textBengali":"হড় ভরসা তুমবা. রাসা।","textHindi":"हड़ भरसा तुमबा. रासा","textOdia":"ହଡ଼ ଭରସା ତୁମବା. ରାସା","meaning":"Never depend on anyone—it only gives false hope; do it yourself in time.","meaning_en":"Never depend on anyone—it only gives false hope; do it yourself in time.","pronunciation":"Hor bharsa tumba rasa.","meaning_hi":"कभी किसी पर निर्भर मत रहो-  दूसरों पर ज्यादा भरोसा नहीं करना चाहिए, भरोसा बहुत जल्दी टूट जाता है।","meaning_or":"କେବେବି କାହା ଉପରେ ନିର୍ଭର କର ନାହିଁ- ଅନ୍ୟ ଉପରେ ଅଧିକ ଭରସା କରିବା ଉଚିତ୍ ନୁହେଁ, ଭରସା ବହୁତ ଶୀଘ୍ର ଭାଙ୍ଗିଯାଏ।","meaning_bn":"কখনো কারো উপর নির্ভর কোরো না।","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_vocab_idioms_intermediate_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5"},"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_vocab_idioms_intermediate_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5"},{"id":"blk_text_22","order":22,"type":"text","markdown":"Dukh ge sari pera do.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱩᱠᱷ ᱜᱮ ᱥᱟ.ᱨᱤ ᱯᱮᱲᱟ ᱫᱚ।","textLatin":"Dukh ge sari pera do.","meta":{"textBengali":"দুখ গে সারি পেড়া দ।","textHindi":"दुख गे सारि पेड़ा द।","textOdia":"ଦୁଖ ଗେ ସାରି ପେଡ଼ା ଦ।","pronunciation":"Dukh ge sari pera do.","meaning":"Sorrow is the true companion-Without experiencing sorrow, you can never know joy.","meaning_en":"Sorrow is the true companion-Without experiencing sorrow, you can never know joy.","meaning_bn":"দুঃখ অনুভব না করলে, তুমি কখনোই আনন্দকে চিনতে পারবে না।","meaning_hi":"दुःख ही सच्चा साथी है-बिना दुःख का अनुभव किए, आप कभी सुख को नहीं जान सकते।","meaning_or":"ଦୁଃଖ ହିଁ ପ୍ରକୃତ ସାଥୀ।-ଦୁଃଖ ଅନୁଭବ ନ କଲେ, ତୁମେ କେବେବି ସୁଖକୁ ଜାଣିପାରିବ ନାହିଁ।","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_vocab_idioms_intermediate_22/view?project=699495910038e39622c5"},"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_vocab_idioms_intermediate_22/view?project=699495910038e39622c5"}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
