rkdown":"Am tumdag ru em badaya?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱛᱩᱢᱫᱟᱜ ᱨᱩ ᱮᱢ ᱵᱟᱲᱟᱭᱟ?","textLatin":"Am tumdag ru em badaya?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম তুমদাঃ রু এম বাড়ায়া?","textHindi":"आम तुमदाग रु एम बाड़ाया?","textOdia":"ଆମ ତୁମଦାଗ ରୁ ଏମ ବାଡ଼ାୟା?","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun laughing and running while balancing a spinning toy disk on a stick, feeling joyful. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"Do you know how to play tumdah?","meaning_en":"Do you know how to play tumdah?","meaning_bn":"আপনি কি তুমদাঃ বাজাতে জানেন?","pronunciation":"Am tumdag ru em badaya?","meaning_hi":"क्या तुम्हें टुमदाक बजाना आता है?","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ ଟୁମଦାକ୍ ବଜାଇ ଜାଣିଛ କି?"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Banj badaya.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱟᱹᱧ ᱵᱟᱲᱟᱭᱟ।","textLatin":"Banj badaya.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বাঞ বাড়ায়া।","textHindi":"बाञ बाड़ाया।","textOdia":"ବାଞ ବାଡ଼ାୟା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Helping Others","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Help someone","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands tall in a schoolyard, holding a new notebook and smiling with pride. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"I do not know.","meaning_en":"I do not know.","meaning_bn":"আমি জানি না।","pronunciation":"Banj badaya.","meaning_hi":"मुझे नहीं पता।","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ଜାଣେ ନାହିଁ"}},{"id":"","order":8,"type":"text","markdown":"Daya kate ched anj me.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱭᱟ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱪᱮᱫ ᱟᱹᱧ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Daya kate ched anj me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দায়া কাতে চেদ আঞ মে।","textHindi":"दाया काते चेद आञ मे।","textOdia":"ଦାୟା କାତେ ଚେଦ ଆଞ ମେ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Helping Others","growthValue":"Responsibility","characterGoal":"Help someone","imageDirection":"Olitun proudly holds a hand-painted wooden sign, smiling warmly with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Please teach me.","meaning_en":"Please teach me.","meaning_bn":"দয়া করে আমাকে শেখান।","pronunciation":"Daya kate ched anj me.","meaning_hi":"कृपया मुझे सिखाओ","meaning_or":"ଦୟାକରି ମୋତେ ଶିଖାନ୍ତୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":9,"type":"text","markdown":"Hẽ, gapanj ched ama.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱸ, ᱜᱟᱯᱟᱧ ᱪᱮᱫ ᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Hẽ, gapanj ched ama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেঁ, গাপাঞ চেদ আমা।","textHindi":"हेँ, गापाञ चेद आमा।","textOdia":"ହେଁ, ଗାପାଞ ଚେଦ ଆମା।","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Practice communication","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate points to a chalkboard showing simple diagrams, looking encouragingly toward classmates. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"Yes, I will teach you tomorrow.","meaning_en":"Yes, I will teach you tomorrow.","meaning_bn":"হ্যাঁ, আমি তোমাকে আগামীকাল শেখাবো।","pronunciation":"Hẽ, gapanj ched ama.","meaning_hi":"हाँ, मैं तुम्हें कल पढ़ाऊँगा","meaning_or":"ହଁ, ମୁଁ ଆସନ୍ତାକାଲି ଆପଣଙ୍କୁ ଶିକ୍ଷା ଦେବି |"}},{"id":"","order":10,"type":"text","markdown":"Tehenj do adi raska din kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱨᱟᱹᱥᱠᱟᱹ ᱫᱤᱱ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Tehenj do adi raska din kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"তেহেঞ দ আডি রাসকা দিন কানা।","textHindi":"तेहेञ द आडि रासका दिन काना।","textOdia":"ତେହେଞ ଦ ଆଡି ରାସକା ଦିନ କାନା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Helping Others","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun works carefully on a drawing page spread out on a wooden table, focused and happy. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Today is a very joyful day","meaning_en":"Today is a very joyful day","meaning_bn":"আজ একটি খুব আনন্দের দিন।","pronunciation":"Tehenj do adi raska din kana.","meaning_hi":"आज बहुत ख़ुशी का दिन है","meaning_or":"ଆଜି ଅତ୍ୟନ୍ତ ଆନନ୍ଦଦାୟକ ଦିନ |"}},{"id":"","order":11,"type":"text","markdown":"Ale orag te hijug me.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱞᱮ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱛᱮ ᱦᱤᱡᱩᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Ale orag te hijug me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আলে অড়াঃ তে হিজুঃ মে।","textHindi":"आले अड़ाग ते हिजुग मे।","textOdia":"ଆଲେ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ତେ ହିଜୁଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Responsibility","storyArc":"Building Confidence","growthValue":"Responsibility","characterGoal":"Help someone","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands tall in a schoolyard, holding a new notebook and smiling with pride. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Focused and attentive expression, steady hands working carefully, steady stance.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate taking charge of duties, caring for the environment or community.","meaning":"Come to our house","meaning_en":"Come to our house","meaning_bn":"আমাদের বাড়িতে আসুন।","pronunciation":"Ale orag te hijug me.","meaning_hi":"हमारे घर आओ।","meaning_or":"ଆମ ଘରକୁ ଆସ |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Inj do gapanj hijug aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱜᱟᱯᱟᱧ ᱦᱤᱡᱩᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Inj do gapanj hijug aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ গাপাঞ হিজুঃ আ।","textHindi":"इञ द गापाञ हिजुगआ।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ଗାପାଞ ହିଜୁଗଆ।","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Complete a task","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate proudly holds a hand-painted wooden sign, smiling warmly with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"I will come tomorrow.","meaning_en":"I will come tomorrow.","meaning_bn":"আমি কাল আসব।","pronunciation":"Inj do gapanj hijug aa.","meaning_hi":"मैं कल आउंगा","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ଆସନ୍ତାକାଲି ଆସିବି |"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Amaag Ol Chiki puthi emanj me.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱚᱞ ᱪᱤᱠᱤ ᱯᱩᱛᱷᱤ ᱮᱢᱟᱧ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Amaag Ol Chiki puthi emanj me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাগ অল চিকি পুথি এমাঞ মে।","textHindi":"आमाग अल चिकि पुथि एमाञ मे।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ଅଲ ଚିକି ପୁଥି ଏମାଞ ମେ।","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Helping Others","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate excitedly discovering knowledge inside a large, open picture book that glows with colorful patterns. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"Give me your Ol Chiki book.","meaning_en":"Give me your Ol Chiki book.","meaning_bn":"তোমার অল চিকি বইটা দাও।","pronunciation":"Amaag Ol Chiki puthi emanj me.","meaning_hi":"मुझे अपनी ओल चिकी किताब दो।","meaning_or":"ମୋତେ ତୁମର ଅଲ ଚିକି ବହି ଦିଅ |"}},{"id":"","order":14,"type":"text","markdown":"Nowa do injaag  puthi kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱤᱧᱟᱜ ᱯᱩᱛᱷᱤ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Nowa do injaag  puthi kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নওয়া দ ইঞাঃ পুথি কানা।","textHindi":"नोवा द इञाग पुथि काना।","textOdia":"ନୋୱା ଦ ଇଞାଗ ପୁଥି କାନା।","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Building Confidence","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun excitedly discovering knowledge inside a large, open picture book that glows with colorful patterns. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"This is my book.","meaning_en":"This is my book.","meaning_bn":"এটা আমার বই।","pronunciation":"Nowa do injaag  puthi kana.","meaning_hi":"यह मेरी किताब है","meaning_or":"ଏହା ମୋର ପୁସ୍ତକ |"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do tiryo orong em kusiyaga?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱛᱤᱨᱭᱳ ᱚᱨᱚᱝ ᱮᱢ ᱠᱩᱥᱤᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do tiryo orong em kusiyaga?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ তিরয়ো অরং এম কুসিয়াঃ আ?","textHindi":"आम द तिरयो अरङ एम कुसियागआ?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ତିରୟୋ ଅରଙ ଏମ କୁସିୟାଗଆ?","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Help someone","imageDirection":"Olitun stands tall in a schoolyard, holding a new notebook and smiling with pride. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"Do you like blowing the flute?","meaning_en":"Do you like blowing the flute?","meaning_bn":"আপনি কি বাঁশি বাজানো পছন্দ করেন?","pronunciation":"Am do tiryo orong em kusiyaga?","meaning_hi":"क्या आपको बांसुरी बजाना पसंद है?","meaning_or":"ଆପଣ ବଂଶୀ ବଜାଇବାକୁ ପସନ୍ଦ କରନ୍ତି କି?"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Hẽ, tiryo orong do adi sibil geya.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱸ, ᱛᱤᱨᱭᱳ ᱚᱨᱚᱝ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱥᱤᱵᱤᱞ ᱜᱮᱭᱟ।","textLatin":"Hẽ, tiryo orong do adi sibil geya.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেঁ, তিরয়ো অরং দ আডি সিবিল গেয়া।","textHindi":"हेँ, तिरयो अरङ द आडि सिबिल गेया।","textOdia":"ହେଁ, ତିରୟୋ ଅରଙ ଦ ଆଡି ସିବିଲ ଗେୟା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Helping Others","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Complete a task","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate proudly holds a hand-painted wooden sign, smiling warmly with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Yes, blowing the flute is very sweet.","meaning_en":"Yes, blowing the flute is very sweet.","meaning_bn":"হ্যাঁ, বাঁশি বাজানো খুব মিষ্টি।","pronunciation":"Hẽ, tiryo orong do adi sibil geya.","meaning_hi":"हां, बांसुरी बजाना बहुत मधुर है","meaning_or":"ହଁ, ବଂଶୀ ବଜାଇବା ଅତ୍ୟନ୍ତ ମିଠା ଅଟେ |"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do landayedam chedag?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱞᱟᱸᱫᱟᱭᱮᱫᱟᱢ ᱪᱮᱫᱟᱜ?","textLatin":"Am do landayedam chedag?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ লাঁদায়েদাম চেদাঃ?","textHindi":"आम द लाँदायेदाम चेदाग?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ଲାଁଦାୟେଦାମ ଚେଦାଗ?","emotion":"Responsibility","storyArc":"Building Confidence","growthValue":"Responsibility","characterGoal":"Practice communication","imageDirection":"Olitun points to a chalkboard showing simple diagrams, looking encouragingly toward classmates. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Focused and attentive expression, steady hands working carefully, steady stance.","learningMoment":"Olitun taking charge of duties, caring for the environment or community.","meaning":"Why are you laughing?","meaning_en":"Why are you laughing?","meaning_bn":"হাসছেন কেন?","pronunciation":"Am do landayedam chedag?","meaning_hi":"तुम क्यों हंस रहे हो?","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ କାହିଁକି ହସୁଛ?"}},{"id":"","order":18,"type":"text","markdown":"Inj do raskayenanj, onate.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱨᱟᱹᱥᱠᱟᱹᱭᱤᱱᱟᱧ, ᱚᱱᱟᱛᱮ।","textLatin":"Inj do raskayenanj, onate.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ রাসকায়িনাঞ অনাতে।","textHindi":"इञ द रासकायिनाञ, अनाते।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ରାସକାୟିନାଞ, ଅନାତେ।","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun works carefully on a drawing page spread out on a wooden table, focused and happy. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"I became happy, that''s why.","meaning_en":"I became happy, that''s why.","meaning_bn":"আমি খুশি হয়ে গেলাম, তাই।","pronunciation":"Inj do raskayenanj, onate.","meaning_hi":"मैं खुश हो गया, इसीलिए","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ଖୁସି ହେଲି, ସେଥିପାଇଁ"}},{"id":"","order":19,"type":"text","markdown":"Gate, gapa lang njapama.","textOlChiki":"ᱜᱟᱛᱮ, ᱜᱟᱯᱟ ᱞᱟᱝ ᱧᱟᱯᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Gate, gapa lang njapama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversations_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গাতে, গাপা লাং ঞাপামা।","textHindi":"गाते, गापा लाङ ञापामा।","textOdia":"ଗାତେ, ଗାପା ଲାଙ ଞାପାମା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Helping Others","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Help someone","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate smiling warmly while pointing happily toward the learner, conveying friendship and belonging. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Friend, we will meet tomorrow.","meaning_en":"Friend, we will meet tomorrow.","meaning_bn":"বন্ধু, কাল দেখা হবে।","pronunciation":"Gate, gapa lang njapama.","meaning_hi":"यार हम कल मिलेंगे","meaning_or":"ବନ୍ଧୁ, ଆମେ ଆସନ୍ତାକାଲି ଭେଟିବା |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, category_id, title_ol_chiki, title_latin, lesson_type, order_index, raw_json) VALUES ('lesson_sentences_polite', 'cat_sentences_1778594024495', 'ᱡᱚᱦᱟᱨ ᱟᱨ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱫᱟᱨᱟᱢ', 'Greetings & Politeness', NULL, 0, '{"id":"lesson_sentences_polite","categoryId":"cat_sentences_1778594024495","titleOlChiki":"ᱡᱚᱦᱟᱨ ᱟᱨ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱫᱟᱨᱟᱢ","titleLatin":"Greetings & Politeness","level":"beginner","orderIndex":0,"isActive":true,"estimatedMinutes":5,"description":"","thumbnailUrl":null,"isPremium":false,"audioUrl":null,"blocks":[{"id":"","order":0,"type":"text","markdown":"Am ched leka menama?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱪᱮᱫ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱢᱟ?","textLatin":"Am ched leka menama?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম চেদ লেকা মেনামা?","textHindi":"आम चेद लेका मेनामा?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଚେଦ ଲେକା ମେନାମା?","emotion":"Friendship","storyArc":"Making New Friend","growthValue":"Communication","characterGoal":"Make a new friend","imageDirection":"Olitun walks along a winding path in the beautiful green village, pointing with curiosity toward the horizon. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Warm direct eye contact, relaxed shoulders, open arms in a welcoming gesture.","learningMoment":"Olitun showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"How are you?","meaning_en":"How are you?","meaning_bn":"তুমি কেমন আছো?","pronunciation":"Am ched leka menama?","meaning_hi":"तुम कैसे हो?","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ କେମିତି ଅଛ?"}},{"id":"","order":1,"type":"text","markdown":"In do napay ge menanja.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱜᱮ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱧᱟ।","textLatin":"In do napay ge menanja.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ নাপায় গে মেনাঞা।","textHindi":"इञ द नापाय गे मेनाञा।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ନାପାୟ ଗେ ମେନାଞା।","emotion":"Friendship","storyArc":"Exploring Village","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate sits peacefully under a large shady tree, looking out over the village with a happy smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Warm direct eye contact, relaxed shoulders, open arms in a welcoming gesture.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"I am fine.","meaning_en":"I am fine.","meaning_bn":"আমি ভালো আছি।","pronunciation":"In do napay ge menanja.","meaning_hi":"मैं ठीक हूँ","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ଭଲ ଅଛି"}},{"id":"","order":2,"type":"text","markdown":"Sagun setag!","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱥᱮᱛᱟᱜ!","textLatin":"Sagun setag!","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সাগুন সেতাগ!","textHindi":"सागुन सेताग!","textOdia":"ସାଗୁନ ସେତାଗ!","emotion":"Kindness","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Explore nature","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a traditional home, pointing happily at a colorful detail on the hand-painted wall. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Gentle smile, soft eyes, hands offering help or gesturing politely with care.","learningMoment":"Olitun putting empathy into action, helping classmates or respecting elders.","meaning":"Good morning!","meaning_en":"Good morning!","meaning_bn":"সুপ্রভাত!","pronunciation":"Sagun setag!","meaning_hi":"शुभ प्रभात","meaning_or":"ଶୁଭ ସକାଳ"}},{"id":"","order":3,"type":"text","markdown":"Sagun njida.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱧᱤᱫᱟᱹ।","textLatin":"Sagun njida.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সাগুন ঞিদা।","textHindi":"सागुन ञिदा।","textOdia":"ସାଗୁନ ଞିଦା।","emotion":"Curiosity","storyArc":"Making New Friend","growthValue":"Communication","characterGoal":"Make a new friend","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate kneels in a patch of wild flowers, looking at the colorful petals with curiosity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Eyes wide with wonder, body leaning forward, pointing with an inquisitive finger.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate demonstrating active observation and a love for finding out new things.","meaning":"Good night.","meaning_en":"Good night.","meaning_bn":"শুভ রাত্রি।","pronunciation":"Sagun njida.","meaning_hi":"शुभ रात्रि","meaning_or":"ଶୁଭ ରାତ୍ରି"}},{"id":"","order":4,"type":"text","markdown":"Ika kanj me.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱠᱟᱹ ᱠᱟᱹᱧ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Ika kanj me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইকা কাঞ মে।","textHindi":"इका काञ मे।","textOdia":"ଇକା କାଞ ମେ।","emotion":"Friendship","storyArc":"Exploring Village","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"Olitun walks along a winding path in the beautiful green village, pointing with curiosity toward the horizon. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Warm direct eye contact, relaxed shoulders, open arms in a welcoming gesture.","learningMoment":"Olitun showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"Excuse me / Sorry","meaning_en":"Excuse me / Sorry","meaning_bn":"মাফ করবেন/দুঃখিত।","pronunciation":"Ika kanj me.","meaning_hi":"क्षमा करें / क्षमा करें","meaning_or":"କ୍ଷମା କରିବେ / ଦୁ Sorry ଖିତ"}},{"id":"","order":5,"type":"text","markdown":"Napay te tahen me.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸᱱ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Napay te tahen me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নাপায় তে তাহেঁন মে।","textHindi":"नापाय ते ताहेँन मे।","textOdia":"ନାପାୟ ତେ ତାହେଁନ ମେ।","emotion":"Kindness","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Explore nature","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate sits peacefully under a large shady tree, looking out over the village with a happy smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Gentle smile, soft eyes, hands offering help or gesturing politely with care.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate putting empathy into action, helping classmates or respecting elders.","meaning":"Take care","meaning_en":"Take care","meaning_bn":"ভালো থাকবেন।","pronunciation":"Napay te tahen me.","meaning_hi":"अपना ध्यान रखना।","meaning_or":"ଯତ୍ନ ନିଅ |"}},{"id":"","order":6,"type":"text","markdown":"Daya kate durub me.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱭᱟ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱫᱩᱲᱩᱵ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Daya kate durub me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দায়া কাতে দুড়ুব মে।","textHindi":"दाया काते दुड़ुब मे।","textOdia":"ଦାୟା କାତେ ଦୁଡ଼ୁବ ମେ।","emotion":"Curiosity","storyArc":"Making New Friend","growthValue":"Communication","characterGoal":"Make a new friend","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a traditional home, pointing happily at a colorful detail on the hand-painted wall. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Eyes wide with wonder, body leaning forward, pointing with an inquisitive finger.","learningMoment":"Olitun demonstrating active observation and a love for finding out new things.","meaning":"Please sit down","meaning_en":"Please sit down","meaning_bn":"দয়া করে বসুন।","pronunciation":"Daya kate durub me.","meaning_hi":"कृपया बैठ जाओ","meaning_or":"ଦୟାକରି ବସନ୍ତୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Sagun daram, orag sed bolon me.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱫᱟᱨᱟᱢ, ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱥᱮᱫ ᱵᱚᱞᱚᱱ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Sagun daram, orag sed bolon me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সাগুন দারাম, অড়াগ সেদ বলন মে।","textHindi":"सागुन दाराम, अड़ाग सेद बलन मे।","textOdia":"ସାଗୁନ ଦାରାମ, ଅଡ଼ାଗ ସେଦ ବଲନ ମେ।","emotion":"Friendship","storyArc":"Making New Friend","growthValue":"Communication","characterGoal":"Make a new friend","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate kneels in a patch of wild flowers, looking at the colorful petals with curiosity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Warm direct eye contact, relaxed shoulders, open arms in a welcoming gesture.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"Welcome, come inside the house","meaning_en":"Welcome, come inside the house","meaning_bn":"স্বাগতম, বাড়ির ভিতরে আসুন।","pronunciation":"Sagun daram, orag sed bolon me.","meaning_hi":"स्वागत है, घर के अंदर आइये","meaning_or":"ସ୍ୱାଗତ, ଘର ଭିତରକୁ ଆସ |"}},{"id":"","order":8,"type":"text","markdown":"Am sao njapam kate adinj raskayena.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱥᱟᱣ ᱧᱟᱯᱟᱢ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤᱧ ᱨᱟᱹᱥᱠᱟᱹᱭᱮᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Am sao njapam kate adinj raskayena.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম সাও ঞাপাম কাতে আডিঞ রাসকায়েনা।","textHindi":"आम साव ञापाम काते आडिञ रासकायेना।","textOdia":"ଆମ ସାୱ ଞାପାମ କାତେ ଆଡିଞ ରାସକାୟେନା।","emotion":"Kindness","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Explore nature","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate walks along a winding path in the beautiful green village, pointing with curiosity toward the horizon. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Gentle smile, soft eyes, hands offering help or gesturing politely with care.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate putting empathy into action, helping classmates or respecting elders.","meaning":"I am very happy to meet you.","meaning_en":"I am very happy to meet you.","meaning_bn":"আমি আপনার সাথে দেখা করে খুব খুশি হলাম। ।","pronunciation":"Am sao njapam kate adinj raskayena.","meaning_hi":"मैं आपसे मिलकर बहुत खुश हूं।","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ତୁମକୁ ଭେଟି ବହୁତ ଖୁସି |"}},{"id":"","order":9,"type":"text","markdown":"Adi adi sarhaw.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱥᱟᱨᱦᱟᱣ.","textLatin":"Adi adi sarhaw.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আডি আডি সারহাও।","textHindi":"आडि आडि सारहाव.","textOdia":"ଆଡି ଆଡି ସାରହାୱ.","emotion":"Curiosity","storyArc":"Making New Friend","growthValue":"Communication","characterGoal":"Make a new friend","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate sits peacefully under a large shady tree, looking out over the village with a happy smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Eyes wide with wonder, body leaning forward, pointing with an inquisitive finger.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate demonstrating active observation and a love for finding out new things.","meaning":"Thank you very much.","meaning_en":"Thank you very much.","meaning_bn":"আপনাকে অনেক ধন্যবাদ।","pronunciation":"Adi adi sarhaw.","meaning_hi":"आपका बहुत-बहुत धन्यवाद।","meaning_or":"ଆପଣଙ୍କୁ ବହୁତ ଧନ୍ୟବାଦ।"}},{"id":"","order":10,"type":"text","markdown":"Alom bhabna aa, sanamag napay ge huyuga.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱞᱚᱢ ᱵᱷᱟᱵᱽᱱᱟᱼᱟ, ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱜᱮ ᱦᱩᱭᱩᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Alom bhabna aa, sanamag napay ge huyuga.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আলম ভাবনা আঃ, সানামাঃ নাপায় গে হুয়ুঃ আ।","textHindi":"आलम भाबनाआ, सानामाग नापाय गे हुयुगआ।","textOdia":"ଆଲମ ଭାବନାଆ, ସାନାମାଗ ନାପାୟ ଗେ ହୁୟୁଗଆ।","emotion":"Friendship","storyArc":"Exploring Village","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a traditional home, pointing happily at a colorful detail on the hand-painted wall. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Warm direct eye contact, relaxed shoulders, open arms in a welcoming gesture.","learningMoment":"Olitun showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"Don''t worry, everything will be fine.","meaning_en":"Don''t worry, everything will be fine.","meaning_bn":"চিন্তা করবেন না, সবকিছু ঠিক হয়ে যাবে।","pronunciation":"Alom bhabna aa, sanamag napay ge huyuga.","meaning_hi":"चिंता मत करो, सब ठीक हो जाएगा।","meaning_or":"ବ୍ୟସ୍ତ ହୁଅନ୍ତୁ ନାହିଁ, ସବୁକିଛି ଠିକ ହୋଇଯିବ |"}},{"id":"","order":11,"type":"text","markdown":"Daya kate nowa kamiyanj me.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱭᱟ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱭᱟᱹᱧ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Daya kate nowa kamiyanj me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দায়া কাতে নওয়া কামিয়াঞ মে।","textHindi":"दाया काते नोवा कामि याञ मे।","textOdia":"ଦାୟା କାତେ ନୋୱା କାମି ୟାଞ ମେ।","emotion":"Kindness","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Explore nature","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Gentle smile, soft eyes, hands offering help or gesturing politely with care.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate putting empathy into action, helping classmates or respecting elders.","meaning":"Please help me with this work.","meaning_en":"Please help me with this work.","meaning_bn":"দয়া করে এই কাজে আমাকে সাহায্য করুন।","pronunciation":"Daya kate nowa kamiyanj me.","meaning_hi":"कृपया इस काम में मेरी मदद करें।","meaning_or":"ଦୟାକରି ମୋତେ ଏହି କାର୍ଯ୍ୟରେ ସାହାଯ୍ୟ କରନ୍ତୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Amaag asis dohoy me.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱟᱹᱥᱤᱥ ᱫᱚᱦᱚᱭ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Amaag asis dohoy me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ আসিস দহয় মে।","textHindi":"आमाग आसिस दहय मे।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ଆସିସ ଦହୟ ମେ।","emotion":"Curiosity","storyArc":"Making New Friend","growthValue":"Communication","characterGoal":"Make a new friend","imageDirection":"Olitun playing a traditional hand-drum (tumdak) with an energetic, rhythmic posture and a wide smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Eyes wide with wonder, body leaning forward, pointing with an inquisitive finger.","learningMoment":"Olitun demonstrating active observation and a love for finding out new things.","meaning":"Keep your blessings.","meaning_en":"Keep your blessings.","meaning_bn":"আপনার আশীর্বাদ বজায় রাখুন।","pronunciation":"Amaag asis dohoy me.","meaning_hi":"अपना आशीर्वाद बनाये रखें।","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ଆଶୀର୍ବାଦ ରଖ |"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Inj do aminj sarhaw meya।","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱢᱤᱧ ᱥᱟᱨᱦᱟᱣ ᱢᱮᱭᱟ।","textLatin":"Inj do aminj sarhaw meya।","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ আমিঞ সারহাও মেয়া।","textHindi":"इञ द आमिञ सारहाव मेया।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ଆମିଞ ସାରହାୱ ମେୟା।","emotion":"Friendship","storyArc":"Exploring Village","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate sits peacefully under a large shady tree, looking out over the village with a happy smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Warm direct eye contact, relaxed shoulders, open arms in a welcoming gesture.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"I appreciate you।","meaning_en":"I appreciate you।","meaning_bn":"আমি আপনার প্রশংসা করি।","pronunciation":"Inj do aminj sarhaw meya।","meaning_hi":"मैं तुम्हारी तारीफ करता हूँ।","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ତୁମର ପ୍ରଶଂସା କରୁଛି।"}},{"id":"","order":14,"type":"text","markdown":"Daya kate ror me.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱭᱟ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Daya kate ror me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দায়া কাতে রড় মে।","textHindi":"दाया काते रड़ मे।","textOdia":"ଦାୟା କାତେ ରଡ଼ ମେ।","emotion":"Kindness","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Explore nature","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a traditional home, pointing happily at a colorful detail on the hand-painted wall. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Gentle smile, soft eyes, hands offering help or gesturing politely with care.","learningMoment":"Olitun putting empathy into action, helping classmates or respecting elders.","meaning":"Please speak.","meaning_en":"Please speak.","meaning_bn":"দয়া করে কথা বলুন।","pronunciation":"Daya kate ror me.","meaning_hi":"कृपया बोलें।","meaning_or":"ଦୟାକରି କୁହନ୍ତୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"Napay te senog me.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱥᱮᱱᱚᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Napay te senog me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নাপায় তে সেনঃ মে।","textHindi":"नापाय ते सेनग मे।","textOdia":"ନାପାୟ ତେ ସେନଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Curiosity","storyArc":"Making New Friend","growthValue":"Communication","characterGoal":"Make a new friend","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate kneels in a patch of wild flowers, looking at the colorful petals with curiosity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Eyes wide with wonder, body leaning forward, pointing with an inquisitive finger.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate demonstrating active observation and a love for finding out new things.","meaning":"Go safely.","meaning_en":"Go safely.","meaning_bn":"নিরাপদে যান।","pronunciation":"Napay te senog me.","meaning_hi":"सुरक्षित जाओ।","meaning_or":"ନିରାପଦରେ ଯାଆନ୍ତୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Marang hor ko man ema ko me.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱟᱹᱱ ᱮᱢᱟ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Marang hor ko man ema ko me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_polite_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মারাং হড় ক মান এমা ক মে।","textHindi":"माराङ हड़ क मान एमा क मे।","textOdia":"ମାରାଙ ହଡ଼ କ ମାନ ଏମା କ ମେ।","emotion":"Friendship","storyArc":"Exploring Village","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"Olitun walks along a winding path in the beautiful green village, pointing with curiosity toward the horizon. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Warm direct eye contact, relaxed shoulders, open arms in a welcoming gesture.","learningMoment":"Olitun showing warmth, inclusion, and building a strong social bond.","meaning":"Give respect to the elders.","meaning_en":"Gi