 caring for the environment or community.","meaning":"Where are you two coming from?","meaning_en":"Where are you two coming from?","meaning_bn":"তোমরা দুজন কোথা থেকে আসছ?","pronunciation":"Abin do oka khon bin hijug kana?","meaning_hi":"तुम दोनों कहाँ से आ रहे हो?","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ ଦୁଇଜଣ କେଉଁଠାରୁ ଆସୁଛ?"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"In do bir tenj chalag kana, sahan lagid.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱵᱤᱨ ᱛᱮᱧ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱥᱟᱦᱟᱱ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ।","textLatin":"In do bir tenj chalag kana, sahan lagid.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ বির তেঞ চালাঃ কানা, সাহান লাগিদ।","textHindi":"इञ द बिर तेञ चालाग काना, साहान लागिद।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ବିର ତେଞ ଚାଲାଗ କାନା, ସାହାନ ଲାଗିଦ।","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Help someone","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate looking at a crackling orange campfire, warm light reflecting on a happy, peaceful face. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"I am going to the forest for firewood.","meaning_en":"I am going to the forest for firewood.","meaning_bn":"আমি কাঠের জন্য বনে যাচ্ছি।","pronunciation":"In do bir tenj chalag kana, sahan lagid.","meaning_hi":"मैं जलाऊ लकड़ी के लिए जंगल जा रहा हूँ।","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ କାଠ ପାଇଁ ଜଙ୍ଗଲକୁ ଯାଉଛି |"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Amaag atu re do sapha dag reyag jharna menag aa?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱯᱷᱟ ᱫᱟᱜ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱡᱷᱟᱨᱱᱟ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ?","textLatin":"Amaag atu re do sapha dag reyag jharna menag aa?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ আতু রে দ সাফা দাঃ রেয়াঃ ঝারনা মেনাঃ আ?","textHindi":"आमाग आतु रे द साफा दाग रेयाग झारना मेनागआ?","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ଆତୁ ରେ ଦ ସାଫା ଦାଗ ରେୟାଗ ଝାରନା ମେନାଗଆ?","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Helping Others","growthValue":"Confidence","characterGoal":"Complete a task","imageDirection":"Olitun drinking cool, clean water from a traditional clay pot, looking refreshed and happy. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Is there a clean waterfall in your village?","meaning_en":"Is there a clean waterfall in your village?","meaning_bn":"আপনার গ্রামে একটি পরিষ্কার জলের ঝরনা আছে?","pronunciation":"Amaag atu re do sapha dag reyag jharna menag aa?","meaning_hi":"क्या आपके गाँव में कोई स्वच्छ झरना है?","meaning_or":"ତୁମ ଗାଁରେ ଏକ ପରିଷ୍କାର ଜଳପ୍ରପାତ ଅଛି କି?"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Hẽ, ale atu re adi sibil dag jharna menag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱸ, ᱟᱞᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱥᱤᱵᱤᱞ ᱫᱟᱜ ᱡᱷᱟᱨᱱᱟ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Hẽ, ale atu re adi sibil dag jharna menag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেঁ, আলে আতু রে আডি সিবিল দাঃ ঝারনা মেনাগআ।","textHindi":"हेँ, आले आतु रे आडि सिबिल दाग झारना मेनाग आ।","textOdia":"ହେଁ, ଆଲେ ଆତୁ ରେ ଆଡି ସିବିଲ ଦାଗ ଝାରନା ମେନାଗଆ।","emotion":"Responsibility","storyArc":"Building Confidence","growthValue":"Responsibility","characterGoal":"Practice communication","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate drinking cool, clean water from a traditional clay pot, looking refreshed and happy. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Focused and attentive expression, steady hands working carefully, steady stance.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate taking charge of duties, caring for the environment or community.","meaning":"Yes, there is a very sweet water spring in our village.","pronunciation":"Hẽ, ale atu re adi sibil dag jharna menag aa.","meaning_en":"Yes, there is a very sweet water spring in our village.","meaning_bn":"হ্যাঁ, আমাদের গ্রামে খুব মিষ্টি জলের ঝর্ণা আছে।","meaning_hi":"हाँ, हमारे गाँव में एक बहुत ही मीठे पानी का झरना है।","meaning_or":"ହଁ, ଆମ ଗାଁ ରେ ବହୁତ ସୁନ୍ଦର ଜଳ ପ୍ରପାତ ଅଛି।"}},{"id":"","order":18,"type":"text","markdown":"Inj do daka ar utu jom kate kami tenj chalag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱫᱟᱠᱟ ᱟᱨ ᱩᱛᱩ ᱡᱚᱢ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱛᱮᱧ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Inj do daka ar utu jom kate kami tenj chalag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ দাকা আর উতু জম কাতে কামি তেঞ চালাঃ আ।","textHindi":"इञ द दाका आर उतु जम काते कामि तेञ चाला: आ।","textOdia":"ଇଞ୍ ଦଃ ଦାକା ଉତୁ ଜମ୍ କାତେ କାମି ତେଞ୍ ଚାଲାଗ୍ ଆ।","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"After eating rice and curry, I will go to my work.","pronunciation":"Inj do daka ar utu jom kate kami tenj chalag aa.","meaning_en":"After eating rice and curry, I will go to my work.","meaning_bn":"ভাত-তরকারি খেয়ে আমি কাজে যাবো।","meaning_hi":"चावल-कढ़ी खाकर अपने काम पर जाऊंगा.","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ଭାତ ତରକାରୀ ଖାଇ କାମକୁ ଯିବି।"}},{"id":"","order":19,"type":"text","markdown":"Napay te kami me gate, tehena din sagun sagun kog tam ma.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱢᱮ ᱜᱟᱛᱮ, ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧᱟᱜ ᱫᱤᱱ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱠᱚᱜ ᱛᱟᱢ ᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Napay te kami me gate, tehena din sagun sagun kog tam ma.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_beginner_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নাপায় তে কামি মে গাতে, তেহেঞাঃ দিন সাগুন কঃ  তাম মা।","textHindi":"नापाय ते कामि मे गाते, तेहेञाग दिन सागुन कग ताम मा।","textOdia":"ନାପାୟ ତେ କାମି ମେ ଗାତେ, ତେହେଞାଗ ଦିନ ସାଗୁନ କଗ ତାମ ମା।","emotion":"Confidence","storyArc":"Learning New Things","growthValue":"Learning","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate smiling warmly while pointing happily toward the learner, conveying friendship and belonging. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing tall, head held high, chest slightly out, a bright and self-assured smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate exhibiting self-reliance, readiness to learn, and pride in their capabilities.","meaning":"Work well friend, have an auspicious day.","meaning_en":"Work well friend, have an auspicious day.","meaning_bn":"ভাল করে কাজ করো বন্ধু, তোমার দিনটি শুভ হোক।","pronunciation":"Napay te kami me gate, tehena din sagun sagun kog tam ma.","meaning_hi":"अच्छे से काम करो मित्र, आपका दिन शुभ हो।","meaning_or":"ଭଲ କାମ କରନ୍ତୁ ବନ୍ଧୁ, ଶୁଭ ଦିନ କରନ୍ତୁ |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, category_id, title_ol_chiki, title_latin, lesson_type, order_index, raw_json) VALUES ('lesson_sentences_complex_advanced', 'cat_sentences_1778594024495', 'ᱜᱟᱹᱦᱤᱨ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ', 'Traditional Wisdom & Ecology', NULL, 0, '{"id":"lesson_sentences_complex_advanced","categoryId":"cat_sentences_1778594024495","titleOlChiki":"ᱜᱟᱹᱦᱤᱨ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ","titleLatin":"Traditional Wisdom & Ecology","level":"beginner","orderIndex":0,"isActive":true,"estimatedMinutes":5,"description":"","thumbnailUrl":null,"isPremium":false,"audioUrl":null,"blocks":[{"id":"","order":0,"type":"text","markdown":"Dare ge jiwi kana, onate dare banchaw do abowaag dhorom kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱜᱮ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱚᱱᱟᱛᱮ ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱵᱟᱧᱪᱟᱣ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟᱜ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Dare ge jiwi kana, onate dare banchaw do abowaag dhorom kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দারে গে জিওয়ি কানা, অনাতে দারে বাঞচাওয় দ আবওয়াগ ধরম কানা।","textHindi":"दारे गे जिवि काना, अनाते दारे बाञचाव द आबवाग धरम काना।","textOdia":"ଦାରେ ଗେ ଜିୱି କାନା, ଅନାତେ ଦାରେ ବାଞଚାୱ ଦ ଆବୱାଗ ଧରମ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun holds a ripe, bright red pomegranate, showing its rich color with a proud and happy smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Trees are life, therefore protecting trees is our sacred duty.","pronunciation":"Dare ge jiwi kana, onate dare banchaw do abowaag dhorom kana.","meaning_en":"Trees are life, therefore protecting trees is our sacred duty.","meaning_bn":"গাছই প্রাণ, তাই গাছ বাঁচানো আমাদের পবিত্র ধর্ম।","meaning_hi":"पेड़ ही जीवन हैं, इसलिए पेड़ों की रक्षा हमारा कर्तव्य है।","meaning_or":"ଗଛ ହିଁ ଜୀବନ, ତେଣୁ ଗଛ ବଞ୍ଚାଇବା ଆମର ପବିତ୍ର ଧର୍ମ।"}},{"id":"","order":1,"type":"text","markdown":"Goj hor do baku rora, onate hola katha do hirinj me.","textOlChiki":"ᱜᱚᱡ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱫᱚ ᱵᱟᱹᱠᱩ ᱨᱚᱲᱟ, ᱚᱱᱟᱛᱮ ᱦᱚᱞᱟ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱦᱤᱲᱤᱧ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Goj hor do baku rora, onate hola katha do hirinj me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গজ হড় দ বাকু রড়া, অনাতে হলা কাথা দ হিড়িঞ মে।","textHindi":"गज हड़ द बाकु रड़ा, अनाते हला काथा द हिड़िञ मे।","textOdia":"ଗଜ ହଡ଼ ଦ ବାକୁ ରଡ଼ା, ଅନାତେ ହଲା କାଥା ଦ ହିଡ଼ିଞ ମେ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Dead people do not speak, so forget about yesterday''s matters.","pronunciation":"Goj hor do baku rora, onate hola katha do hirinj me.","meaning_en":"Dead people do not speak, so forget about yesterday''s matters.","meaning_bn":"মৃত মানুষ কথা বলে না, তাই গতকালের কথা ভুলে যাও।","meaning_hi":"मरे हुए लोग नहीं बोलते, इसलिए कल की बातें भूल जाओ।","meaning_or":"ମୃତ ଲୋକ କଥା କହନ୍ତି ନାହିଁ, ତେଣୁ ଗତକାଲିର କଥା ଭୁଲିଯାଅ।"}},{"id":"","order":2,"type":"text","markdown":"Atu hor ge disom hor kana ko, jumid ge abowaag dare kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱜᱮ ᱫᱤᱥᱚᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ ᱠᱚ, ᱡᱩᱢᱤᱫᱽ ᱜᱮ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟᱜ ᱫᱟᱲᱮ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Atu hor ge disom hor kana ko, jumid ge abowaag dare kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আতু হড় গে দিসম হড় কানা ক, জুমিদ গে আবওয়াঃ দাড়ে কানা।","textHindi":"आतु हड़ गे दिसम हड़ काना क, जुमिद गे आबवाग दाड़े काना।","textOdia":"ଆତୁ ହଡ଼ ଗେ ଦିସମ ହଡ଼ କାନା କ, ଜୁମିଦ ଗେ ଆବୱାଗ ଦାଡ଼େ କାନା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"The villagers are the country''s strength; unity is our power.","pronunciation":"Atu hor ge disom hor kana ko, jumid ge abowaag dare kana.","meaning_en":"The villagers are the country''s strength; unity is our power.","meaning_bn":"গ্রামের মানুষই দেশের শক্তি; একতাই আমাদের বল।","meaning_hi":"ग्रामीण ही देश की ताकत हैं; एकता ही हमारी शक्ति है।","meaning_or":"ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀ ହିଁ ଦେଶର ଶକ୍ତି; ଏକତା ହିଁ ଆମର ବଳ।"}},{"id":"","order":3,"type":"text","markdown":"Med  benget kate chalag me, hor re adi dhiri menag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱮᱫ ᱵᱮᱸᱜᱮᱫ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜ ᱢᱮ, ᱦᱚᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱫᱷᱤᱨᱤ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ.","textLatin":"Med  benget kate chalag me, hor re adi dhiri menag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মেদ বেঁগেদ কাতে চালাঃ মে, হর রে আডি ধিরি মেনাঃ আ।","textHindi":"मेद लुटुर बेँगेद काते चालाᱺ मे, हर रे आडि धिरि मेनाग आ.","textOdia":"ମେଦ ବେଁଗେଦ କାତେ ଚାଲାଗ ମେ, ହର ରେ ଆଡି ଧିରି ମେନାଗଆ.","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Keep your eyes open; there are many stones on the road.","pronunciation":"Med benget kate chalag me, hor re adi dhiri menaga","meaning_en":"Keep your eyes open; there are many stones on the road.","meaning_bn":"আপনার চোখ খোলা রাখুন; রাস্তায় অনেক পাথর।","meaning_hi":"अपनी आँखें खुले रखें; सड़क पर बहुत सारे पत्थर हैं.","meaning_or":"ଆଖି ଖୋଲା ରଖ; ରାସ୍ତାରେ ଅନେକ ପଥର ଅଛି।"}},{"id":"","order":4,"type":"text","markdown":"Am jaha lekam rora, am saw hor ho onka ge ko rora.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱸ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱢ ᱨᱚᱲᱟ, ᱟᱢ ᱥᱟᱶ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱦᱚᱸ ᱚᱱᱠᱟ ᱜᱮ ᱠᱚ ᱨᱚᱲᱟ।","textLatin":"Am jaha lekam rora, am saw hor ho onka ge ko rora.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম জাহাঁ লেকাম রড়া, আম সাও হড় হঁ অনকা গে ক রড়া।","textHindi":"आम जाहाँ लेकाम रड़ा, आम साव हड़ हँ अनका गे क रड़ा।","textOdia":"ଆମ ଜାହାଁ ଲେକାମ ରଡ଼ା, ଆମ ସାୱ ହଡ଼ ହଁ ଅନକା ଗେ କ ରଡ଼ା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"As you speak, people will speak with you in the same way.","pronunciation":"Am jaha lekam rora, am saw hor ho onka ge ko rora.","meaning_en":"As you speak, people will speak with you in the same way.","meaning_bn":"আপনি যেভাবে কথা বলবেন, মানুষও আপনার সাথে সেভাবেই কথা বলবে।","meaning_hi":"आप जैसा बोलेंगे, लोग भी आपसे वैसे ही बोलेंगे।","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ ଯେପରି କହୁଛ, ଲୋକମାନେ ତୁମ ସହିତ ସମାନ ଭାବରେ କଥା ହେବେ |"}},{"id":"","order":5,"type":"text","markdown":"Sohrae porob re ale orag te hijug me, adi napay huyug aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱚᱦᱨᱟᱭ ᱯᱚᱨᱚᱵ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱞᱮ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱛᱮ ᱦᱤᱡᱩᱜ ᱢᱮ, ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱦᱩᱭᱩᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Sohrae porob re ale orag te hijug me, adi napay huyug aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সহরায় পরব রে আলে অড়াগ তে হিজুগ মে, আডি নাপায় হুয়ুঃ আ।","textHindi":"सहराय परब रे आले अड़ाग ते हिजुग मे, आडि नापाय हुयुगआ।","textOdia":"ସହରାୟ ପରବ ରେ ଆଲେ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ତେ ହିଜୁଗ ମେ, ଆଡି ନାପାୟ ହୁୟୁଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Come to our home during the Sohrae festival, it will be wonderful.","pronunciation":"Sohrae porob re ale orag te hijug me, adi napay huyug aa.","meaning_en":"Come to our home during the Sohrae festival, it will be wonderful.","meaning_bn":"সহরায় উৎসবের সময় আমাদের বাড়িতে আসুন, চমৎকার হবে।","meaning_hi":"सोहराए पर्व पर हमारे घर आइए, अद्भुत होगा।","meaning_or":"ସୋହରା ପର୍ବ ସମୟରେ ଆମ ଘରକୁ ଆସ, ଏହା ଚମତ୍କାର ହେବ |"}},{"id":"","order":6,"type":"text","markdown":"Guru kolom te ol me, geyan hor re lahag me.","textOlChiki":"ᱜᱩᱨᱩ ᱠᱚᱞᱚᱢ ᱛᱮ ᱚᱞ ᱢᱮ, ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱦᱚᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱞᱟᱦᱟᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Guru kolom te ol me, geyan hor re lahag me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গুরু কলম তে অল মে, গেয়ান হর রে লাহাঃ মে।","textHindi":"गुरु कलम ते अल मे, गेयान हर रे लाहाग मे।","textOdia":"ଗୁରୁ କଲମ ତେ ଅଲ ମେ, ଗେୟାନ ହର ରେ ଲାହାଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate writing clean Ol Chiki characters on a blackboard with chalk, standing tall with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Write with the Guru''s pen, advance on the path of knowledge.","pronunciation":"Guru kolom te ol me, geyan hor re lahag me.","meaning_en":"Write with the Guru''s pen, advance on the path of knowledge.","meaning_bn":"গুরুর কলম দিয়ে লিখুন, জ্ঞানের পথে এগিয়ে চলুন।","meaning_hi":"गुरु की कलम से लिखो, ज्ञान पथ पर आगे बढ़ो।","meaning_or":"ଗୁରୁଙ୍କ କଲମ ସହିତ ଲେଖ, ଜ୍ଞାନ ପଥରେ ଅଗ୍ରଗତି କର |"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Ari chali ar lakchar do abowaag uprum kana, ona do banchaw kag me.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱪᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱟᱨ ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟᱜ ᱩᱯᱨᱩᱢ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱚᱱᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱵᱟᱧᱪᱟᱣ ᱠᱟᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Ari chali ar lakchar do abowaag uprum kana, ona do banchaw kag me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আরি চালি আর লাকচার দ আবওয়াঃ উপরুম কানা, অনা দ বাঞচাও কাঃ মে।","textHindi":"आरि चालि आर लाकचार द आबवाग उपरुम काना, अना द बाञचाव काग मे।","textOdia":"ଆରି ଚାଲି ଆର ଲାକଚାର ଦ ଆବୱାଗ ଉପରୁମ କାନା, ଅନା ଦ ବାଞଚାୱ କାଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Customs and culture are our identity; protect them well.","pronunciation":"Ari chali ar lakchar do abowaag uprum kana, ona do banchaw kag me.","meaning_en":"Customs and culture are our identity; protect them well.","meaning_bn":"প্রথা ও সংস্কৃতি আমাদের পরিচয়; তাদের ভালভাবে রক্ষা করুন।","meaning_hi":"रीति-रिवाज और संस्कृति हमारी पहचान है; उनकी अच्छे से रक्षा करें.","meaning_or":"ରୀତିନୀତି ଏବଂ ସଂସ୍କୃତି ଆମର ପରିଚୟ; ସେମାନଙ୍କୁ ଭଲ ଭାବରେ ରକ୍ଷା କର |"}},{"id":"","order":8,"type":"text","markdown":"Herem ror te sanam horag mone jitkar me.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱲᱮᱢ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱡᱤᱛᱠᱟᱹᱨ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Herem ror te sanam horag mone jitkar me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেড়েম রড় তে সানাম হড় মনে জিতকার মে।","textHindi":"हेड़ेम रड़ ते सानाम हड़ाग मने जितकार मे।","textOdia":"ହେଡ଼େମ ରଡ଼ ତେ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ାଗ ମନେ ଜିତକାର ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Win everyone''s heart with sweet and fluent speech.","meaning_en":"Win everyone''s heart with sweet and fluent speech.","meaning_bn":"মিষ্টি ও সাবলীল কথাবার্তায় সবার মন জয় করুন।","meaning_hi":"मधुर और धाराप्रवाह वाणी से सबका दिल जीतें।","meaning_or":"ମିଠା କଥାରେ ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କ ମନ ଜିତି ନିଅ।","pronunciation":"Herem ror te sanam horag mone jitkar me."}},{"id":"","order":9,"type":"text","markdown":"Sirjoniya do nowa dharti adi chehra te sajaw akadai.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱚᱱᱤᱭᱟᱹ ᱫᱚ ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱫᱷᱟᱹᱨᱛᱤ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱪᱮᱦᱨᱟ ᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱡᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱫᱟᱭ।","textLatin":"Sirjoniya do nowa dharti adi chehra te sajaw akadai.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিরজনিয়া দ নোওয়া ধারতি আডি চেহরা তে সাজাওয় আকাদায়।","textHindi":"सिरजनिया द नोवा धारति आडि चेहरा ते साजाव आकादाय।","textOdia":"ସିରଜନିୟା ଦ ନୋୱା ଧାରତି ଆଡି ଚେହରା ତେ ସାଜାୱ ଆକାଦାୟ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun holding a handful of rich, dark soil, ready to plant seeds, looking hopeful and proud. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"The Creator has decorated this earth beautifully.","pronunciation":"Sirjoniya do nowa dharti adi chehra te sajaw akadai.","meaning_en":"The Creator has decorated this earth beautifully.","meaning_bn":"সৃষ্টিকর্তা এই পৃথিবীকে সুন্দর করে সাজিয়েছেন।","meaning_hi":"विधाता ने इस धरती को बहुत सुंदर ढंग से सजाया है।","meaning_or":"ସୃଷ୍ଟିକର୍ତ୍ତା ଏହି ପୃଥିବୀକୁ ସୁନ୍ଦର ଭାବରେ ସଜାଇଛନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":10,"type":"text","markdown":"Amaag jiwi jala re dhiroj dohoy me, mid din sari ge napay huyug aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱡᱟᱞᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱷᱤᱨᱚᱡᱽ ᱫᱚᱦᱚᱭ ᱢᱮ, ᱢᱤᱫ ᱫᱤᱱ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱜᱮ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱦᱩᱭᱩᱜᱼᱟ","textLatin":"Amaag jiwi jala re dhiroj dohoy me, mid din sari ge napay huyug aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ জিওয়ি জালা রে ধিরজ দহয় মে, মিদ দিন সারি গে নাপায় হুয়ুঃ আ।","textHindi":"आमाग जिवि जाला रे धिरज दहय मे, मिद दिन सारि गे नापाय हुयुगआ।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ୍ ଜୀୱୀ ଜାଲା ରେ ଧୀରଜ୍ ଦହୟ ମେ, ମିଦ୍ ଦିନ୍ ସାରି ଗେ ନାପାୟ୍ ହୁୟୁଗ୍-ଆ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands proudly at a crossroads in the village, pointing toward a path of opportunity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Keep patience in your life struggles; one day it will surely be good.","pronunciation":"Amaag jiwi jala re dhiroj dohoy me, mid din sari ge napay huyug aa.","meaning_en":"Keep patience in your life struggles; one day it will surely be good.","meaning_bn":"আপনার জীবন সংগ্রামে ধৈর্য ধরে রাখুন; একদিন নিশ্চয়ই ভালো হবে।","meaning_hi":"अपने जीवन के संघर्षों में धैर्य रखें; एक दिन जरूर अच्छा होगा.","meaning_or":"ଆମର ଜୀବନ ଜାଲରେ ଧୈର୍ଯ୍ୟ ରଖ, ଦିନେ ନିଶ୍ଚୟ ଭଲ ହେବ।"}},{"id":"","order":11,"type":"text","markdown":"Disom daran kate adi lekan geyan em njam dareyag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱤᱥᱚᱢ ᱫᱟᱨᱟᱱ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱱ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱮᱢ ᱧᱟᱢ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Disom daran kate adi lekan geyan em njam dareyag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দিসম দারান কাতে আডি লেকান গেয়ান এম ঞাম দাড়েয়াঃ আ।","textHindi":"दिसम दारान काते आडि लेकान गेयान एम ञाम दाड़ेयागआ।","textOdia":"ଦିସମ ଦାରାନ କାତେ ଆଡି ଲେକାନ ଗେୟାନ ଏମ ଞାମ ଦାଡ଼େୟାଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"By traveling the country, you can gain many kinds of knowledge.","pronunciation":"Disom daran kate adi lekan geyan em njam dareyag aa.","meaning_en":"By traveling the country, you can gain many kinds of knowledge.","meaning_bn":"দেশ ভ্রমণ করে আপনি অনেক ধরণের জ্ঞান অর্জন করতে পারেন।","meaning_hi":"देश भर में भ्रमण करके आप कई प्रकार का ज्ञान प्राप्त कर सकते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଦେଶ ଭ୍ରମଣ କରି ଆପଣ ଅନେକ ପ୍ରକାରର ଜ୍ଞାନ ହାସଲ କରିପାରିବେ |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Dhorom kami re mone lagaw me, sanam hor man ko emama.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱞᱟᱜᱟᱣ ᱢᱮ, ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱢᱟᱹᱱ ᱠᱚ ᱮᱢᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Dhorom kami re mone lagaw me, sanam hor man ko emama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ধরম কামি রে মনে লাগাও মে, সানাম হড় মান ক এমামা।","textHindi":"धरम कामि रे मने लागाव मे, सानाम हड़ मान क एमामा।","textOdia":"ଧରମ କାମି ରେ ମନେ ଲାଗାୱ ମେ, ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ମାନ କ ଏମାମା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate pointing toward a balanced, hand-carved wooden scale, indicating fairness and justice. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Engage in righteous deeds; everyone will respect you.","pronunciation":"Dhorom kami re mone lagaw me, sanam hor man ko emama.","meaning_en":"Engage in righteous deeds; everyone will respect you.","meaning_bn":"সৎ কাজে নিয়োজিত হও; সবাই তোমাকে সম্মান করবে।","meaning_hi":"नेक कामों में लग जाओ; हर कोई आपका सम्मान करेगा.","meaning_or":"ଧାର୍ମିକ କାର୍ଯ୍ୟରେ ନିୟୋଜିତ ହୁଅ; ସମସ୍ତେ ତୁମକୁ ସମ୍ମାନ କରିବେ |"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Santali sawhet do adi kisarh ar gahir geya.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ ᱥᱟᱶᱦᱮᱫ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱠᱤᱥᱟᱹᱬ ᱟᱨ ᱜᱟᱹᱦᱤᱨ ᱜᱮᱭᱟ।","textLatin":"Santali sawhet do adi kisarh ar gahir geya.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সানতাড়ি সাওয়হেদ দ আডি কিসাড় আর গাহির গেয়া।","textHindi":"सानताड़ि सावहेद द आडि किसाण आर गाहिर गेया।","textOdia":"ସାନତାଡ଼ି ସାୱହେଦ ଦ ଆଡି କିସାଣ ଆର ଗାହିର ଗେୟା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Santali literature is very rich and deep.","pronunciation":"Santali sawhet do adi kisan ar gahir geya.","meaning_en":"Santali literature is very rich and deep.","meaning_bn":"সাঁওতালি সাহিত্য অত্যন্ত সমৃদ্ধ ও গভীর।","meaning_hi":"संताली साहित्य अत्यंत समृद्ध एवं गहन है।","meaning_or":"ସାନ୍ତାଳୀ ସାହିତ୍ୟ ବହୁତ ଧନୀ ଏବଂ ଗଭୀର |"}},{"id":"","order":14,"type":"text","markdown":"Olog parhaw kate amaag atu ar disom reyag nyutum marshal me.","textOlChiki":"ᱚᱞᱚᱜ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱣ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱟᱨ ᱫᱤᱥᱚᱢ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ ᱢᱟᱨᱥᱟᱞ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Olog parhaw kate amaag atu ar disom reyag nyutum marshal me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"অলঃ পাড়হাওয় কাতে আমাঃ আতু আর দিসম রেয়াঃ ঞুতুম মারসাল মে।","textHindi":"अलग पाड़हाव काते आमाग आतु आर दिसम रेयाग ञुतुम मारसाल मे।","textOdia":"ଅଲଗ ପାଡ଼ହାୱ କାତେ ଆମାଗ ଆତୁ ଆର ଦିସମ ରେୟାଗ ଞୁତୁମ ମାରସାଲ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate holding a shiny, polished brass plate that reflects the morning sunlight with brilliant rays. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"By studying well, brighten the name of your village and country.","pronunciation":"Olog parhaw kate amaag atu ar disom reyag nyutum marshal me.","meaning_en":"By studying well, brighten the name of your village and country.","meaning_bn":"ভালো করে লেখাপড়া করে নিজের গ্রাম ও দেশের নাম উজ্জ্বল কর।","meaning_hi":"अच्छे से पढ़ाई कर अपने गांव और देश का नाम रोशन करें।","meaning_or":"ଭଲ ଅଧ୍ୟୟନ କରି, ତୁମର ଗାଁ ଏବଂ ଦେଶର ନାମ ଉଜ୍ଜ୍ୱଳ କର |"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"Sari guru waag seched te abo sanam hor jiwi re sari santi bon njama.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱜᱩᱨᱩ ᱣᱟᱜ ᱥᱮᱪᱮᱫ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱵᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱥᱟᱹᱱᱛᱤ ᱵᱚᱱ ᱧᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Sari guru waag seched te abo sanam hor jiwi re sari santi bon njama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সারি গুরু আঃ সেচেদ তে আব সানাম হড় জিওয়ি রে সারি সানতি বন ঞামা।","textHindi":"सारि गुरु वाग सेचेद ते आब सानाम हड़ जिवि रे सारि सानति बन ञामा।","textOdia":"ସାରି ଗୁରୁ ୱାଗ ସେଚେଦ ତେ ଆବ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ଜିୱି ରେ ସାରି ସାନତି ବନ ଞାମା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"With the true teacher''s education, we all find true peace in our lives.","pronunciation":"Sari guru waag seched te abo sanam hor jiwi re sari santi bon njama.","meaning_en":"With the true teacher''s education, we all find true peace in our lives.","meaning_bn":"প্রকৃত শিক্ষকের শিক্ষায় আমরা সকলেই আমাদের জীবনে প্রকৃত শান্তি খুঁজে পাই।","meaning_hi":"सच्चे शिक्षक की शिक्षा से हम सभी को अपने जीवन में सच्ची शांति मिलती है।","meaning_or":"ପ୍ରକୃତ ଶିକ୍ଷକଙ୍କ ଶିକ୍ଷା ସହିତ, ଆମେ ସମସ୍ତେ ଆମ ଜୀବନରେ ପ୍ରକୃତ ଶାନ୍ତି ପାଇଥାଉ |"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Geyan dorya re dubuj kate am do sari dhorom reyag gahir katham baday njama.","textOlChiki":"ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱫᱚᱨᱭᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱰᱩᱵᱩᱡ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱜᱟᱹᱦᱤᱨ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟᱢ ᱵᱟᱰᱟᱭ ᱧᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Geyan dorya re dubuj kate am do sari dhorom reyag gahir katham baday njama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গেয়ান দরয়া রে ডুবুজ কাতে আম দ সারি ধরম রেয়াঃ গাহির কাথাম বাডায় ঞামা।","textHindi":"गेयान दरया रे डुबुज काते आम द सारि धरम रेयाग गाहिर काथाम बाडाय ञामा।","textOdia":"ଗେୟାନ ଦରୟା ରେ ଡୁବୁଜ କାତେ ଆମ ଦ ସାରି ଧରମ ରେୟାଗ ଗାହିର କାଥାମ ବାଡାୟ ଞାମା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate standing tall on a hill overlooking the village, looking forward with strong resolution. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"By diving into the ocean of knowledge, you will understand the deep truths of the true religion.","pronunciation":"Geyan dorya re dubuj kate am do sari dhorom reyag gahir katham baday njama.","meaning_en":"By diving into the ocean of knowledge, you will understand the deep truths of the true religion.","meaning_bn":"জ্ঞানের সাগরে ডুব দিয়ে সত্য ধর্মের গভীর সত্যগুলো বুঝতে পারবে।","meaning_hi":"ज्ञान के सागर में गोता लगाकर तुम सच्चे धर्म की गूढ़ सच्चाइयों को समझ जाओगे।","meaning_or":"ଜ୍ଞାନ ସାଗରରେ ବୁଡି ଆମେ ସତ୍ୟ ଧର୍ମର ଗଭୀର କଥା ଜାଣି ପାରିଲୁ।"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Ari chali ar lakchar banchaw doho ge sari hor hopon aag marang dhorom kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱪᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱟᱨ ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱵᱟᱧᱪᱟᱣ ᱫᱚᱦᱚ ᱜᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱦᱚᱯᱚᱱ ᱟᱜ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Ari chali ar lakchar banchaw doho ge sari hor hopon aag marang dhorom kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আরি চালি আর লাকচার বাঞচাওয় দহ গে সারি হড় হপন আগ মারাং ধরম কানা।","textHindi":"आरि चालि आर लाकचार बाञचाव दह गे सारि हड़ हपन आग माराङ धरम काना।","textOdia":"ଆରି ଚାଲି ଆର ଲାକଚାର ବାଞଚାୱ ଦହ ଗେ ସାରି ହଡ଼ ହପନ ଆଗ ମାରାଙ ଧରମ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Preserving customs and culture is the great duty of a true Santal.","pronunciation":"Ari chali ar lakchar banchaw doho ge sari hor hopon aag marang dhorom kana.","meaning_en":"Preserving customs and culture is the great duty of a true Santal.","meaning_bn":"প্রথা ও সংস্কৃতি রক্ষা করা একজন প্রকৃত সাঁওতালের মহান কর্তব্য।","meaning_hi":"रीति-रिवाज और संस्कृति की रक्षा करना एक सच्चे संताल का महान कर्तव्य है।","meaning_or":"ରୀତିନୀତି ଏବଂ ସଂସ୍କୃତିର ସଂରକ୍ଷଣ ହେଉଛି ପ୍ରକୃତ ସାନ୍ତାଳର ମହତ୍ କର୍ତ୍ତବ୍ୟ |"}},{"id":"","order":18,"type":"text","markdown":"Sirjon dular ar jumid ge abo sanam hor jiwi re sari sukh e ema bona.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱚᱱ ᱫᱩᱞᱟᱹᱲ ᱟᱨ ᱡᱩᱢᱤᱫᱽ ᱜᱮ ᱟᱵᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱥᱩᱠᱷ ᱮ ᱮᱢᱟ ᱵᱚᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Sirjon dular ar jumid ge abo sanam hor jiwi re sari sukh e ema bona.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_advanced_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিরজন দুলাড় আর জুমিদ গে আব সানাম হড়াঃ জিওয়ি রে সারি সুখ এ এমা বনা।","textHindi":"सिरजन दुलाड़ आर जुमिद गे आब सानाम हुड़ाग जिवि रे सारि सुख ए एमा बना।","textOdia":"ସିରଜନ ଦୁଲାଡ଼ ଆର ଜୁମିଦ ଗେ ଆବ ସାନାମ ହୁଡ଼ାଗ ଜିୱି ରେ ସାରି ସୁଖ ଏ ଏମା ବନା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands proudly at a crossroads in the village, pointing toward a path of opportunity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Love for nature and unity give true happiness in our lives.","pronunciation":"Sirjon dular ar jumid ge abo sanam hor jiwi re sari sukh e ema bona.","meaning_en":"Love for nature and unity give true happiness in our lives.","meaning_bn":"প্রকৃতির প্রতি ভালবাসা এবং ঐক্য আমাদের জীবনে প্রকৃত সুখ দেয়।","meaning_hi":"प्रकृति के प्रति प्रेम और एकता हमारे जीवन में सच्ची खुशी देती है।","meaning_or":"ପ୍ରକୃତି ଏବଂ ଏକତା ପ୍ରତି ପ୍ରେମ ଆମ ଜୀବନରେ ପ୍ରକୃତ ସୁଖ ଦେଇଥାଏ |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, category_id, title_ol_chiki, title_latin, lesson_type, order_index, raw_json) VALUES ('lesson_sentences_conversational_1', 'cat_sentences_1778594024495', 'ᱦᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱢᱩᱦᱤᱛ ᱑', 'Modern Conversational Exchanges I', NULL, 0, '{"id":"lesson_sentences_conversational_1","categoryId":"cat_sentences_1778594024495","titleOlChiki":"ᱦᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱢᱩᱦᱤᱛ ᱑","titleLatin":"Modern Conversational Exchanges I","level":"beginner","orderIndex":0,"isActive":true,"estimatedMinutes":5,"description":"","thumbnailUrl":null,"isPremium":false,"audioUrl":null,"blocks":[{"id":"","order":0,"type":"text","markdown":"Am tehenj ched em jom keda?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱪᱮᱫ ᱮᱢ ᱡᱚᱢ ᱠᱮᱫᱟ?","textLatin":"Am tehenj ched em jom keda?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম তেহেঞ চেদ এম জম কেদা?","textHindi":"आम तेहेञ चेद एम जम केदा?","textOdia":"ଆମ ତେହେଞ ଚେଦ ଏମ ଜମ କେଦା?","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a modern work table with drafting papers and a digital tablet, pointing forward with hope. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"What did you eat today?","pronunciation":"Am tehenj ched em jom keda?","meaning_en":"What did you eat today?","meaning_bn":"তুমি আজ কী খেলে?","meaning_hi":"तुमने आज क्या खाया?","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ ଆଜି କ’ଣ ଖାଇଲ?"}},{"id":"","order":1,"type":"text","markdown":"In do daka ar jel utunj jom keda.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱫᱟᱠᱟ ᱟᱨ ᱡᱮᱞ ᱩᱛᱩᱧ ᱡᱚᱢ ᱠᱮᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"In do daka ar jel utunj jom keda.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ দাকা আর জেল উতুঞ জম কেদা।","textHindi":"इञ द दाका आर जेल उतुञ जम केदा।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ଦାକା ଆର ଜେଲ ଉତୁଞ ଜମ କେଦା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands in a clean, modern learning space, gesturing toward a screen showing village success metrics. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"I ate rice and meat curry.","pronunciation":"In do daka ar jel utunj jom keda.","meaning_en":"I ate rice and meat curry.","meaning_bn":"আমি ভাত আর মাংসের ঝোল খেলাম।","meaning_hi":"मैंने चावल और मीट करी खाई।","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ଭାତ ଓ ମାଂସ ତରକାରୀ ଖାଇଲି।"}},{"id":"","order":2,"type":"text","markdown":"Amij gate kora do okoy kanay?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱤᱡ ᱜᱟᱛᱮ ᱠᱚᱲᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱚᱠᱚᱭ ᱠᱟᱱᱟᱭ?","textLatin":"Amij gate kora do okoy kanay?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমিজ্ গাতে কড়া দ অকয় কানায়?","textHindi":"आमीज गाते कड़ा द अकय कानाय?","textOdia":"ଆମିଜ ଗାତେ କଡ଼ା ଦ ଅକୟ କାନାୟ?","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun smiling warmly while pointing happily toward the learner, conveying friendship and belonging. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Who is your male friend?","pronunciation":"Amij gate kora do okoy kanay?","meaning_en":"Who is your male friend?","meaning_bn":"তোমার  বন্ধুটি কে?","meaning_hi":"तुम्हारा मित्र कौन है?","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ପୁରୁଷ ସାଙ୍ଗଟି କିଏ?"}},{"id":"","order":3,"type":"text","markdown":"Inij gate kora do Sagun kanay.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧᱤᱡ ᱜᱟᱛᱮ ᱠᱚᱲᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱠᱟᱱᱟᱭ।","textLatin":"Inij gate kora do Sagun kanay.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞিজ গাতে কড়া দ সাগুন কানায়।","textHindi":"इञिज गाते कड़ा द सागुन कानाय।","textOdia":"ଇଞିଜ ଗାତେ କଡ଼ା ଦ ସାଗୁନ କାନାୟ।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate smiling warmly while pointing happily toward the learner, conveying friendship and belonging. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"My male friend is Sagun.","pronunciation":"Inij gate kora do Sagun kanay.","meaning_en":"My male friend is Sagun.","meaning_bn":"আমার  বন্ধু হল সাগুন।","meaning_hi":"मेरा पुरुष मित्र सगुन है.","meaning_or":"ମୋର ପୁରୁଷ ବନ୍ଧୁ ହେଉଛନ୍ତି ସାଗୁନ୍ |"}},{"id":"","order":4,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do tehenj itun asra em chalaw lena?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱤᱛᱩᱱ ᱟᱥᱲᱟ ᱮᱢ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱣ ᱞᱮᱱᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do tehenj itun asra em chalaw lena?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ তেহেঞ ইতুন আসড়া এম চালাওয় লেনা?","textHindi":"आम द तेहेञ इतुन आसड़ा एम चालाव लेना?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ତେହେଞ ଇତୁନ ଆସଡ଼ା ଏମ ଚାଲାୱ ଲେନା?","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"Olitun standing proudly in front of a bright, clean school building, gesturing toward the entrance. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"Olitun aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Did you go to school today?","pronunciation":"Am do tehenj itun asra em chalaw lena?","meaning_en":"Did you go to school today?","meaning_bn":"তুমি কি আজ স্কুলে গিয়েছিলে?","meaning_hi":"क्या आप आज स्कूल गए?","meaning_or":"ଆପଣ ଆଜି ସ୍କୁଲ ଯାଇଥିଲେ କି?"}},{"id":"","order":5,"type":"text","markdown":"Bang, tehenj do chhuti din kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱟᱝ, ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱪᱷᱩᱴᱤ ᱫᱤᱱ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Bang, tehenj do chhuti din kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বাং, তেহেঞ দ ছুটি দিন কানা।","textHindi":"बाङ, तेहेञ द छुटि दिन काना।","textOdia":"ବାଙ, ତେହେଞ ଦ ଛୁଟି ଦିନ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands in a clean, modern learning space, gesturing toward a screen showing village success metrics. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"No, today is a holiday.","pronunciation":"Bang, tehenj do chhuti din kana.","meaning_en":"No, today is a holiday.","meaning_bn":"না, আজ ছুটির দিন।","meaning_hi":"नहीं, आज छुट्टी है.","meaning_or":"ନା, ଆଜି ଏକ ଛୁଟିଦିନ |"}},{"id":"","order":6,"type":"text","markdown":"Amaag atu re tinag orag menag aa?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮ ᱛᱤᱱᱟᱹᱜ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ?","textLatin":"Amaag atu re tinag orag menag aa?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ আতু রে তিনাঃ অড়াঃ মেনাঃ আ?","textHindi":"आमाग आतु रे तिनाग अड़ाग मेनागआ?","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ଆତୁ ରେ ତିନାଗ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ମେନାଗଆ?","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun stands under the bright sun, showcasing a creative blueprint of a village development project with pride. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"How many houses are there in your village?","pronunciation":"Amaag atu re tinag orag menag aa?","meaning_en":"How many houses are there in your village?","meaning_bn":"আপনার গ্রামে কয়টি বাড়ি আছে?","meaning_hi":"आपके गाँव में कितने घर हैं?","meaning_or":"ତୁମ ଗାଁରେ କେତେ ଘର ଅଛି?"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Ale atu re do adi sange orag menag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱞᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱥᱟᱸᱜᱮ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Ale atu re do adi sange orag menag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আলে আতু রে দ আডি সাঁগে অড়াঃ মেনাঃ আ।।","textHindi":"आले आतु रे द आडि साँगे अड़ाग मेनागआ।","textOdia":"ଆଲେ ଆତୁ ରେ ଦ ଆଡି ସାଁଗେ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ମେନାଗଆ।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate works together with classmates around a table filled with building blocks and tablets, smiling with ambition. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"There are many houses in our village.","pronunciation":"Ale atu re do adi sange orag menag aa.","meaning_en":"There are many houses in our village.","meaning_bn":"আমাদের গ্রামে অনেক বাড়ি আছে।","meaning_hi":"हमारे गांव में बहुत सारे घर हैं.","meaning_or":"ଆମ ଗାଁରେ ଅନେକ ଘର ଅଛି |"}},{"id":"","order":8,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do in saw em galmarawa?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱤᱧ ᱥᱟᱶ ᱮᱢ ᱜᱟᱞᱢᱟᱨᱟᱣᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do in saw em galmarawa?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ ইঞ সাওয় এম গালমারাওয়া?","textHindi":"आम द इञ साव एम गालमारावा?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ଇଞ ସାୱ ଏମ ଗାଲମାରାୱା?","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a modern work table with drafting papers and a digital tablet, pointing forward with hope. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Will you speak with me?","pronunciation":"Am do in saw em galmarawa?","meaning_en":"Will you speak with me?","meaning_bn":"তুমি কি আমার সাথে কথা বলবে?","meaning_hi":"क्या आप मुझसे बात करेंगे?","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ ମୋ ସହିତ କଥା ହେବ କି?"}},{"id":"","order":9,"type":"text","markdown":"Hẽ, in do am saw ror adinj kusiyag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱸ, ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱢ ᱥᱟᱶ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱟᱹᱰᱤᱧ ᱠᱩᱥᱤᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Hẽ, in do am saw ror adinj kusiyag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেঁ, ইঞ দ আম সাওয় রড় আডিঞ কুসিয়াঃ আ।","textHindi":"हेँ, इञ द आम साव रड़ आडिञ कुसियागआ।","textOdia":"ହେଁ, ଇଞ ଦ ଆମ ସାୱ ରଡ଼ ଆଡିଞ କୁସିୟାଗଆ।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands in a clean, modern learning space, gesturing toward a screen showing village success metrics. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Yes, I really like to talk with you.","pronunciation":"Hẽ, in do am saw ror adinj kusiyag aa.","meaning_en":"Yes, I really like to talk with you.","meaning_bn":"হ্যাঁ, আমি সত্যিই আপনার সাথে কথা বলতে পছন্দ করি.","meaning_hi":"हाँ, मुझे आपसे बात करना बहुत अच्छा लगता है।","meaning_or":"ହଁ, ମୁଁ ତୁମ ସହିତ କଥାବାର୍ତ୍ତା କରିବାକୁ ପ୍ରକୃତରେ ପସନ୍ଦ କରେ |"}},{"id":"","order":10,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do oka kamim kusiyag aa?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱚᱠᱟ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤᱢ ᱠᱩᱥᱤᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do oka kamim kusiyag aa?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ অকা কামিম কুসিয়াঃ আ?","textHindi":"आम द अका कामिम कुसियागआ?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ଅକା କାମିମ କୁସିୟାଗଆ?","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"Olitun carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"Olitun aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Which work do you like?","pronunciation":"Am do oka kamim kusiyag aa?","meaning_en":"Which 