":"text","markdown":"Amaag orag re okoy ko menag kowa?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱨᱮ ᱚᱠᱚᱭ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜ ᱠᱚᱣᱟ?","textLatin":"Amaag orag re okoy ko menag kowa?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ অড়াঃ রে অকয় ক মেনাঃ কওয়া?","textHindi":"आमाग अड़ाग रे अकय क मेनाग कवा?","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ରେ ଅକୟ କ ମେନାଗ କୱା?","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun works together with classmates around a table filled with building blocks and tablets, smiling with ambition. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Who is at your home?","pronunciation":"Amaag orag re okoy ko menag kowa?","meaning_en":"Who is at your home?","meaning_bn":"তোমার বাসায় কে কে আছে?","meaning_hi":"आपके घर पर कौन है?","meaning_or":"ଆପଣଙ୍କ ଘରେ କିଏ ଅଛନ୍ତି?"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Injaag orag re ayo, baba ar misra menag kowa.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧᱟᱜ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱭᱳ, ᱵᱟᱵᱟ ᱟᱨ ᱢᱤᱥᱨᱟ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜ ᱠᱚᱣᱟ।","textLatin":"Injaag orag re ayo, baba ar misra menag kowa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞাঃ অড়াঃ রে আয়ো, বাবা আর মিসরা মেনাঃ কওয়া।","textHindi":"इञाग अड़ाग रे आयो, बाबा आर मिसरा मेनाग कवा।","textOdia":"ଇଞାଗ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ରେ ଆୟୋ, ବାବା ଆର ମିସରା ମେନାଗ କୱା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"A kind, tall Santhal father and Olitun standing side-by-side, sharing a warm moment as they look over a project. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"Olitun aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"In my home are mother, father, and younger sister.","pronunciation":"Injaag orag re ayo, baba ar misra menag kowa.","meaning_en":"In my home are mother, father, and younger sister.","meaning_bn":"আমার বাড়িতে মা, বাবা, ছোট বোন আছে।","meaning_hi":"मेरे घर में मम्मी, पापा और छोटी बहन हैं.","meaning_or":"ମୋ ଘରେ ମା, ବାପା ଏବଂ ସାନ ଭଉଣୀ ଅଛନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do tis em hijuga?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱛᱤᱥ ᱮᱢ ᱦᱤᱡᱩᱜᱼᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do tis em hijuga?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ তিস এম হিজুঃ আ?","textHindi":"आम द तिस एम हिजुगआ?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ତିସ ଏମ ହିଜୁଗଆ?","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun stands in a clean, modern learning space, gesturing toward a screen showing village success metrics. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"When will you come?","pronunciation":"Am do tis em hijuga?","meaning_en":"When will you come?","meaning_bn":"কবে আসবে?","meaning_hi":"आप कब आओगें?","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ କେବେ ଆସିବ?"}},{"id":"","order":18,"type":"text","markdown":"In do gapa setag inj hijug aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱜᱟᱯᱟ ᱥᱮᱛᱟᱜ ᱤᱧ ᱦᱤᱡᱩᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"In do gapa setag inj hijug aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ গাপা সেতাঃ ইঞ হিজুঃ আ।","textHindi":"इञ द गापा सेताग इञ हिजुगआ।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ଗାପା ସେତାଗ ଇଞ ହିଜୁଗଆ।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands under the bright sun, showcasing a creative blueprint of a village development project with pride. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"I will come tomorrow morning.","pronunciation":"In do gapa setag inj hijug aa.","meaning_en":"I will come tomorrow morning.","meaning_bn":"কাল সকালে আসব।","meaning_hi":"मैं कल सुबह आऊंगा.","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ଆସନ୍ତାକାଲି ସକାଳେ ଆସିବି |"}},{"id":"","order":19,"type":"text","markdown":"Amaag sibil ror do in adinj kusiyada.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱥᱤᱵᱤᱞ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱫᱚ ᱤᱧ ᱟᱹᱰᱤᱧ ᱠᱩᱥᱤᱭᱟᱫᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Amaag sibil ror do in adinj kusiyada.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাগ সিবিল রড় দ ইঞ আডিঞ কুসিয়াদা।","textHindi":"आमाग सिबिल रड़ द इञ आडिञ कुसियादआ।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ସିବିଲ ରଡ଼ ଦ ଇଞ ଆଡିଞ କୁସିୟାଦଆ।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate works together with classmates around a table filled with building blocks and tablets, smiling with ambition. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"I really liked your sweet words.","pronunciation":"Amaag sibil ror do in adinj kusiyada.","meaning_en":"I really liked your sweet words.","meaning_bn":"আপনার মিষ্টি কথাগুলো খুব ভালো লাগলো।","meaning_hi":"मुझे आपकी मीठी बातें बहुत पसंद आईं.","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ତୁମର ମିଠା ଶବ୍ଦକୁ ବହୁତ ପସନ୍ଦ କଲି |"}},{"id":"","order":20,"type":"text","markdown":"Napay te tahen me gate, sarhaw.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸᱱ ᱢᱮ ᱜᱟᱛᱮ, ᱥᱟᱨᱦᱟᱣ।","textLatin":"Napay te tahen me gate, sarhaw.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নাপায় তে তাহেঁন মে গাতে, সারহাওয়।","textHindi":"नापाय ते ताहेँन मे गाते, सारहाव।","textOdia":"ନାପାୟ ତେ ତାହେଁନ ମେ ଗାତେ, ସାରହାୱ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun smiling warmly while pointing happily toward the learner, conveying friendship and belonging. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Stay well friend, thank you.","pronunciation":"Napay te tahen me gate, sarhaw.","meaning_en":"Stay well friend, thank you.","meaning_bn":"ভালো থাকবেন বন্ধু, ধন্যবাদ।","meaning_hi":"अच्छे से रहो मित्र, धन्यवाद.","meaning_or":"ଭଲ ବନ୍ଧୁ ରୁହ, ଧନ୍ୟବାଦ |"}},{"id":"","order":21,"type":"text","markdown":"Sagun njida, gapa bon njapama.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱧᱤᱫᱟᱹ, ᱜᱟᱯᱟ ᱵᱚᱱ ᱧᱟᱯᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Sagun njida, gapa bon njapama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_1_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সাগুন ঞিদা, গাপা বন ঞাপামা।","textHindi":"सागुन ञिदा, गापा बन ञापामा।","textOdia":"ସାଗୁନ ଞିଦା, ଗାପା ବନ ଞାପାମା।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands in a clean, modern learning space, gesturing toward a screen showing village success metrics. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Good night, we will meet tomorrow.","pronunciation":"Sagun njida, gapa bon njapama.","meaning_en":"Good night, we will meet tomorrow.","meaning_bn":"শুভ রাত্রি, আমরা আগামীকাল দেখা করব।","meaning_hi":"शुभ रात्रि, हम कल मिलेंगे।","meaning_or":"ଶୁଭ ରାତ୍ରି, ଆମେ ଆସନ୍ତାକାଲି ଭେଟିବା |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, category_id, title_ol_chiki, title_latin, lesson_type, order_index, raw_json) VALUES ('lesson_sentences_conversational_2', 'cat_sentences_1778594024495', 'ᱦᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱢᱩᱦᱤᱛ ᱒', 'Modern Conversational Exchanges II', NULL, 0, '{"id":"lesson_sentences_conversational_2","categoryId":"cat_sentences_1778594024495","titleOlChiki":"ᱦᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱢᱩᱦᱤᱛ ᱒","titleLatin":"Modern Conversational Exchanges II","level":"beginner","orderIndex":0,"isActive":true,"estimatedMinutes":5,"description":"","thumbnailUrl":null,"isPremium":false,"audioUrl":null,"blocks":[{"id":"","order":0,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do ced puthim parhaag kana?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱪᱮᱫ ᱯᱩᱛᱷᱤᱢ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do ced puthim parhaag kana?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun excitedly discovering knowledge inside a large, open picture book that glows with colorful patterns. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"What book are you reading?"}},{"id":"","order":1,"type":"text","markdown":"In do Santali sawhet reyag puthinj parhaag kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ ᱥᱟᱶᱦᱮᱫ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱯᱩᱛᱷᱤᱧ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"In do Santali sawhet reyag puthinj parhaag kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ সানতাড়ি সাওয়হেদ রেয়াঃ পুথিঞ পাড়হাঃ কানা।","textHindi":"इञ द सानताड़ि सावहेद रेयाग पुथिञ पाड़हाग काना।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ସାନତାଡ଼ି ସାୱହେଦ ରେୟାଗ ପୁଥିଞ ପାଡ଼ହାଗ କାନା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate excitedly discovering knowledge inside a large, open picture book that glows with colorful patterns. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"I am reading a book of Santali literature.","pronunciation":"In do Santali sawhet reyag puthinj parhaag kana.","meaning_en":"I am reading a book of Santali literature.","meaning_bn":"আমি সাঁওতালি সাহিত্যের বই পড়ছি।","meaning_hi":"मैं संताली साहित्य की पुस्तक पढ़ रहा हूँ।","meaning_or":"ମୁଁ ସାନ୍ତାଳୀ ସାହିତ୍ୟର ବହି ପଢୁଛି।"}},{"id":"","order":2,"type":"text","markdown":"Nowa puthi re do adi napay katha ol menag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱯᱩᱛᱷᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱚᱞ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Nowa puthi re do adi napay katha ol menag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নোওয়া পুথি রে দ আডি নাপায় কাথা অল মেনাঃ আ।","textHindi":"नोवा पुथि रे द आडि नापाय काथा अल मेनागआ।","textOdia":"ନୋୱା ପୁଥି ରେ ଦ ଆଡି ନାପାୟ କାଥା ଅଲ ମେନାଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun excitedly discovering knowledge inside a large, open picture book that glows with colorful patterns. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Very good things are written in this book.","meaning_en":"Very good things are written in this book.","meaning_bn":"এই বইতে খুব ভালো কথা লেখা আছে।","pronunciation":"Nowa puthi re do adi napay katha ol menag aa.","meaning_hi":"इस किताब में बहुत अच्छी बातें लिखी हैं।","meaning_or":"ଏହି ବହିରେ ବହୁତ ଭଲ କଥା ଲେଖା ଅଛି।"}},{"id":"","order":3,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do Santali Ol Chiki em ol dareyag aa?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ ᱚᱞ ᱪᱤᱠᱤᱢ ᱚᱞ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do Santali Ol Chiki em ol dareyag aa?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ সানতাড়ি অল চিকিম অল দাড়েয়াঃ আ?","textHindi":"आम द सानताड़ि अल चिकिम अल दाड़ेयागआ?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ସାନତାଡ଼ି ଅଲ ଚିକିମ ଅଲ ଦାଡ଼େୟାଗଆ?","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun writing clean Ol Chiki characters on a blackboard with chalk, standing tall with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Can you write Santali Ol Chiki?","pronunciation":"Am do Santali Ol Chikim ol dareyag aa?","meaning_en":"Can you write Santali Ol Chiki?","meaning_bn":"সাঁওতালি ওল চিকি লিখতে পারেন?","meaning_hi":"क्या आप संताली ओल चिकी लिख सकते हैं?","meaning_or":"ଆପଣ ସାନ୍ତାଲି ଓଲ୍ ଚିକି ଲେଖିପାରିବେ କି?"}},{"id":"","order":4,"type":"text","markdown":"Hẽ, in do adi napay Ol Chikinj ol dareyag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱸ, ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱚᱞ ᱪᱤᱠᱤᱧ ᱚᱞ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Hẽ, in do adi napay Ol Chikinj ol dareyag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেঁ, ইঞ দ আডি নাপায় অল চিকিঞ অল দাড়েয়াঃ আ।","textHindi":"हेँ, इञ द आडि नापाय अल चिकिञ अल दाड़ेयागआ।","textOdia":"ହେଁ, ଇଞ ଦ ଆଡି ନାପାୟ ଅଲ ଚିକିଞ ଅଲ ଦାଡ଼େୟାଗଆ।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate writing clean Ol Chiki characters on a blackboard with chalk, standing tall with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Yes, I can write Ol Chiki very well.","pronunciation":"Hẽ, in do adi napay Ol Chikinj ol dareyag aa.","meaning_en":"Yes, I can write Ol Chiki very well.","meaning_bn":"হ্যাঁ, আমি ওল চিকি খুব ভালো লিখতে পারি।","meaning_hi":"हाँ, मैं ओल चिकी बहुत अच्छी तरह लिख सकता हूँ।","meaning_or":"ହଁ, ମୁଁ ଅଲ ଚିକିକୁ ବହୁତ ଭଲ ଲେଖିପାରେ |"}},{"id":"","order":5,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do okoy ched ad meyay?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱚᱠᱚᱭ ᱪᱮᱫ ᱟᱫ ᱢᱮᱭᱟᱭ?","textLatin":"Am do okoy ched ad meyay?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ অকয় চেদ আদ মেয়ায়?","textHindi":"आम द अकय चेद आद मेयाय?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ଅକୟ ଚେଦ ଆଦ ମେୟାୟ?","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun stands in a clean, modern learning space, gesturing toward a screen showing village success metrics. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Who taught you?","pronunciation":"Am do okoy ched ad meyay?","meaning_en":"Who taught you?","meaning_bn":"তোমাকে কে শিখিয়েছে?","meaning_hi":"तुम्हें किसने सिखाया?","meaning_or":"କିଏ ତୁମକୁ ଶିକ୍ଷା ଦେଲା?"}},{"id":"","order":6,"type":"text","markdown":"In do inj baba ar guru kin ched adinja.","textOlChiki":"ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱤᱧ ᱵᱟᱵᱟ ᱟᱨ ᱜᱩᱨᱩ ᱠᱤᱱ ᱪᱮᱫ ᱟᱫᱤᱧᱟ।","textLatin":"In do inj baba ar guru kin ched adinja.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ইঞ দ ইঞ বাবা আর গুরু কিন চেদ আদিঞা।","textHindi":"इञ द इञ बाबा आर गुरु किन चेद आदिञा।","textOdia":"ଇଞ ଦ ଇଞ ବାବା ଆର ଗୁରୁ କିନ ଚେଦ ଆଦିଞା।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"A kind, tall Santhal father and a young Santhal child classmate standing side-by-side, sharing a warm moment as they look over a project. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"My father and teacher taught me.","pronunciation":"In do inj baba ar guru kin ched adinja.","meaning_en":"My father and teacher taught me.","meaning_bn":"আমার বাবা ও শিক্ষক আমাকে শিখিয়েছেন।","meaning_hi":"मेरे पिता और शिक्षक ने मुझे पढ़ाया.","meaning_or":"ମୋ ବାପା ଏବଂ ଶିକ୍ଷକ ମୋତେ ଶିଖାଇଲେ।"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Tehenj do atu re adi marang galmaraw huyug kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱜᱟᱞᱢᱟᱨᱟᱣ ᱦᱩᱭᱩᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Tehenj do atu re adi marang galmaraw huyug kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"তেহেঞ দ আতু রে আডি মারাং গালমারাওয় হুয়ুঃ কানা।","textHindi":"तेहेञ द आतु रे आडि माराङ गालमाराव हुयुग काना।","textOdia":"ତେହେଞ ଦ ଆତୁ ରେ ଆଡି ମାରାଙ ଗାଲମାରାୱ ହୁୟୁଗ କାନା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate works together with classmates around a table filled with building blocks and tablets, smiling with ambition. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Today a very big discussion is happening in the village.","pronunciation":"Tehenj 