 jawra kate kamiya ko.","meaning_en":"Our villagers gather and work together.","meaning_bn":"আমাদের গ্রামবাসীরা একত্রিত হয়ে একসঙ্গে কাজ করে।","meaning_hi":"हमारे ग्रामीण इकट्ठा होते हैं और मिलकर काम करते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଆମ ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀ ଏକାଠି ହୋଇ କାମ କରନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Jumid ge ale atu reyag marang dare kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱡᱩᱢᱤᱫᱽ ᱜᱮ ᱟᱞᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱫᱟᱲᱮ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Jumid ge ale atu reyag marang dare kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"জুমিদ গে আলে আতু রেয়াঃ মারাং দাড়ে কানা।","textHindi":"जुमिद गे आले आतु रेयाग माराङ दाड़े काना।","textOdia":"ଜୁମିଦ ଗେ ଆଲେ ଆତୁ ରେୟାଗ ମାରାଙ ଦାଡ଼େ କାନା।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a modern work table with drafting papers and a digital tablet, pointing forward with hope. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Unity is the great strength of our village.","pronunciation":"Jumid ge ale atu reyag marang dare kana.","meaning_en":"Unity is the great strength of our village.","meaning_bn":"ঐক্যই আমাদের গ্রামের বড় শক্তি।","meaning_hi":"एकता हमारे गांव की बड़ी ताकत है.","meaning_or":"ଏକତା ହେଉଛି ଆମ ଗାଁର ମହାନ ଶକ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do Langde enej em kusiyag aa?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱞᱟᱜᱽᱬᱮ ᱮᱱᱮᱡ ᱮᱢ ᱠᱩᱥᱤᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do Langde enej em kusiyag aa?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/bu