তে চালাওয় আকানায়, চাস কামি লাগিদ।","textHindi":"बाबा द टाःडि ते चालाव आकानाय, चास कामि लागिद।","textOdia":"ବାବା ଦ ଟାଃଡି ତେ ଚାଲାୱ ଆକାନାୟ, ଚାସ କାମି ଲାଗିଦ।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"A kind, tall Santhal father and Olitun standing side-by-side, sharing a warm moment as they look over a project. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Father has gone to the field for farming.","pronunciation":"Baba do tandi te chalaw akanay, chas kami lagid.","meaning_en":"Father has gone to the field for farming.","meaning_bn":"বাবা ক্ষেতে গেছে চাষের জন্য।","meaning_hi":"पिता खेती के लिए खेत पर गये हैं.","meaning_or":"ବାପା ଚାଷ ପାଇଁ କ୍ଷେତକୁ ଯାଇଛନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":19,"type":"text","markdown":"Ale do adi sadhu ar napay jiwi le khandaweda.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱞᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱥᱟᱹᱫᱷᱩ ᱟᱨ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱞᱮ ᱠᱷᱟᱸᱰᱟᱣᱮᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Ale do adi sadhu ar napay jiwi le khandaweda.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আলে দ আডি সাধু আর নাপায় জিওয়ি লে খাঁডাওয়েদা।","textHindi":"आले द आडि साधु आर नापाय जिवि ले खाँडावेदा।","textOdia":"ଆଲେ ଦ ଆଡି ସାଧୁ ଆର ନାପାୟ ଜିୱି ଲେ ଖାଁଡାୱେଦା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate works together with classmates around a table filled with building blocks and tablets, smiling with ambition. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"We live a very simple and peaceful life.","pronunciation":"Ale do adi sadhu ar napay jiwi le khandaweda.","meaning_en":"We live a very simple and peaceful life.","meaning_bn":"আমরা খুব সহজ এবং শান্তিপূর্ণ জীবনযাপন করি।","meaning_hi":"हम बहुत ही सरल और शांतिपूर्ण जीवन जीते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଆମେ ଅତି ସରଳ ଏବଂ ଶାନ୍ତିପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ଜୀବନଯାପନ କରୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":20,"type":"text","markdown":"Sirjon dular ge aleyaak marang dhorom kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱚᱱ ᱫᱩᱞᱟᱹᱲ ᱜᱮ ᱟᱞᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Sirjon dular ge aleyaak marang dhorom kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিরজন দুলাড় গে আলেয়াঃ মারাং ধরম কানা।","textHindi":"सिरजन दुलाड़ गे आलेयाग माराङ धरम काना।","textOdia":"ସିରଜନ ଦୁଲାଡ଼ ଗେ ଆଲେୟାଗ ମାରାଙ ଧରମ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a modern work table with drafting papers and a digital tablet, pointing forward with hope. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Love for nature is our great religion.","pronunciation":"Sirjon dular ge aleyaag marang dhorom kana.","meaning_en":"Love for nature is our great religion.","meaning_bn":"প্রকৃতির প্রতি ভালোবাসাই আমাদের মহান ধর্ম।","meaning_hi":"प्रकृति से प्रेम हमारा महान धर्म है।","meaning_or":"ପ୍ରକୃତି ପ୍ରତି ପ୍ରେମ ହେଉଛି ଆମର ମହାନ ଧର୍ମ |"}},{"id":"","order":21,"type":"text","markdown":"Sari katha ror me, jiwi re sukh em njama.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱢᱮ, ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱩᱠᱷ ᱮᱢ ᱧᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Sari katha ror me, jiwi re sukh em njama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_2_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সারি কাথা রড় মে, জিওয়ি রে সুখ এম ঞামা।","textHindi":"सारि काथा रड़ मे, जिवि रे सुख एम ञामा।","textOdia":"ସାରି କାଥା ରଡ଼ ମେ, ଜିୱି ରେ ସୁଖ ଏମ ଞାମା।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate standing tall on a hill overlooking the village, looking forward with strong resolution. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Speak the truth, you will find happiness in life.","pronunciation":"Sari katha ror me, jiwi re sukh em njama.","meaning_en":"Speak the truth, you will find happiness in life.","meaning_bn":"সত্যি কথা বল, জীবনে সুখ পাবে।","meaning_hi":"सत्य बोलें, जीवन में सुख मिलेगा।","meaning_or":"ସତ କୁହ, ତୁମେ ଜୀବନରେ ସୁଖ ପାଇବ |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, category_id, title_ol_chiki, title_latin, lesson_type, order_index, raw_json) VALUES ('lesson_sentences_conversational_3', 'cat_sentences_1778594024495', 'ᱦᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱢᱩᱦᱤᱛ ᱓', 'Modern Conversational Exchanges III', NULL, 0, '{"id":"lesson_sentences_conversational_3","categoryId":"cat_sentences_1778594024495","titleOlChiki":"ᱦᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱢᱩᱦᱤᱛ ᱓","titleLatin":"Modern Conversational Exchanges III","level":"beginner","orderIndex":0,"isActive":true,"estimatedMinutes":5,"description":"","thumbnailUrl":null,"isPremium":false,"audioUrl":null,"blocks":[{"id":"","order":0,"type":"text","markdown":"Am do tehenj disom daran em chalag kana?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱫᱤᱥᱚᱢ ᱫᱟᱨᱟᱱ ᱮᱢ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ?","textLatin":"Am do tehenj disom daran em chalag kana?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আম দ তেহেঞ দিসম দারান এম চালাঃ কানা?","textHindi":"आम द तेहेञ दिसम दारान एम चालाग काना?","textOdia":"ଆମ ଦ ତେହେଞ ଦିସମ ଦାରାନ ଏମ ଚାଲାଗ କାନା?","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a modern work table with drafting papers and a digital tablet, pointing forward with hope. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Are you going to travel the country today?","pronunciation":"Am do tehenj disom daran em chalag kana?","meaning_en":"Are you going to travel the country today?","meaning_bn":"তুমি কি আজ দেশভ্রমণে যাচ্ছো?","meaning_hi":"क्या तुम आज देश भ्रमण पर जा रहे हो?","meaning_or":"ତୁମେ କ’ଣ ଆଜି ଦେଶ ଭ୍ରମଣରେ ଯାଉଛ?"}},{"id":"","order":1,"type":"text","markdown":"Hẽ, in do nawa atu ar nawa hor njel inj chalag kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱸ, ᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱱᱟᱶᱟ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱟᱨ ᱱᱟᱶᱟ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱧᱮᱞ ᱤᱧ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Hẽ, in do nawa atu ar nawa hor njel inj chalag kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেঁ, ইঞ দ নাওয়া আতু আর নাওয়া হড় ঞেল ইঞ চালাগ কানা।","textHindi":"हेँ, इञ द नावा आतु आर नावा हड़ ञेल इञ चालाग काना।","textOdia":"ହେଁ, ଇଞ ଦ ନାୱା ଆତୁ ଆର ନାୱା ହଡ଼ ଞେଲ ଇଞ ଚାଲାଗ କାନା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands in a clean, modern learning space, gesturing toward a screen showing village success metrics. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Yes, I am going to see new villages and new people.","pronunciation":"Hẽ, in do nawa atu ar nawa hor njel inj chalag kana.","meaning_en":"Yes, I am going to see new villages and new people.","meaning_bn":"হ্যাঁ, আমি নতুন গ্রাম ও নতুন মানুষ দেখতে যাচ্ছি।","meaning_hi":"हाँ, मैं नए गाँव और नए लोगों को देखने जा रहा हूँ।","meaning_or":"ହଁ, ମୁଁ ନୂଆ ଗାଁ ଓ ନୂଆ ଲୋକଙ୍କୁ ଦେଖିବାକୁ ଯାଉଛି।"}},{"id":"","order":2,"type":"text","markdown":"Disom daran kate adi lekan geyan njamog aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱤᱥᱚᱢ ᱫᱟᱨᱟᱱ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱱ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱧᱟᱢᱚᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Disom daran kate adi lekan geyan njamog aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দিসম দারান কাতে আডি লেকান গেয়ান ঞামঃ আ।","textHindi":"दिसम दारान काते आडि लेकान गेयान ञामगआ।","textOdia":"ଦିସମ ଦାରାନ କାତେ ଆଡି ଲେକାନ ଗେୟାନ ଞାମଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun stands under the bright sun, showcasing a creative blueprint of a village development project with pride. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Traveling the country brings many kinds of knowledge.","pronunciation":"Disom daran kate adi lekan geyan njamog aa.","meaning_en":"Traveling the country brings many kinds of knowledge.","meaning_bn":"দেশভ্রমণ করলে অনেক রকম জ্ঞান অর্জন করা যায়।","meaning_hi":"देश भ्रमण करने से कई तरह का ज्ञान मिलता है।","meaning_or":"ଦେଶ ଭ୍ରମଣ କଲେ ଅନେକ ପ୍ରକାର ଜ୍ଞାନ ମିଳେ।"}},{"id":"","order":3,"type":"text","markdown":"Amaag jiwi jala re dhiroj dohoy me, jitkar em njama.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱡᱟᱞᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱷᱤᱨᱚᱡᱽ ᱫᱚᱦᱚᱭ ᱢᱮ, ᱡᱤᱛᱠᱟᱹᱨ ᱮᱢ ᱧᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Amaag jiwi jala re dhiroj dohoy me, jitkar em njama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ জিওয়ি জালা রে ধিরজ দহয় মে, জিতকার এম ঞামা।","textHindi":"आमाग जिवि जाला रे धिरज दहय मे, जितकार एम ञामा।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ଜିୱି ଜାଲା ରେ ଧିରଜ ଦହୟ ମେ, ଜିତକାର ଏମ ଞାମା।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate works together with classmates around a table filled with building blocks and tablets, smiling with ambition. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Keep patience in your life struggles, you will achieve victory.","pronunciation":"Amaag jiwi jala re dhiroj dohoy me, jitkar em njama.","meaning_en":"Keep patience in your life struggles, you will achieve victory.","meaning_bn":"আপনার জীবন সংগ্রামে ধৈর্য ধরে রাখুন, আপনি বিজয় অর্জন করবেন।","meaning_hi":"जीवन के संघर्षों में धैर्य रखें, विजय प्राप्त होगी।","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ଜୀବନ ସଂଘର୍ଷରେ ଧ patience ର୍ଯ୍ୟ ରଖ, ତୁମେ ବିଜୟ ହାସଲ କରିବ |"}},{"id":"","order":4,"type":"text","markdown":"Mone ketej kate kami me, darem njama.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱠᱮᱴᱮᱡ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱢᱮ, ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱢ ᱧᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Mone ketej kate kami me, darem njama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মনে কেটেজ কাতে কামি মে, দাড়েম ঞামা।","textHindi":"मने केटेज काते कामि मे, दाड़ेम ञामा।","textOdia":"ମନେ କେଟେଜ କାତେ କାମି ମେ, ଦାଡ଼େମ ଞାମା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"Olitun carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"Olitun aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Work with a strong mind, you will find strength.","pronunciation":"Mone ketej kate kami me, dare em njama.","meaning_en":"Work with a strong mind, you will find strength.","meaning_bn":"দৃঢ় মন নিয়ে কাজ করুন, আপনি শক্তি পাবেন।","meaning_hi":"मजबूत मन से काम करें, ताकत मिलेगी।","meaning_or":"ଏକ ଦୃ strong ମନ ସହିତ କାମ କର, ତୁମେ ଶକ୍ତି ପାଇବ |"}},{"id":"","order":5,"type":"text","markdown":"Atu rin hor do bir dare leka ketej geya ko.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱤᱱ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱫᱚ ᱵᱤᱨ ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱠᱮᱴᱮᱡ ᱜᱮᱭᱟ ᱠᱚ।","textLatin":"Atu rin hor do bir dare leka ketej geya ko.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আতু রিন হড় দ বির দারে লেকা কেটেজ গেয়া ক।","textHindi":"आतु रिन हड़ द बिर दारे लेका केटेज गेया क।","textOdia":"ଆତୁ ରିନ ହଡ଼ ଦ ବିର ଦାରେ ଲେକା କେଟେଜ ଗେୟା କ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"The village people are as strong as the forest trees.","pronunciation":"Atu rin hor do bir dare leka ketej geya ko.","meaning_en":"The village people are as strong as the forest trees.","meaning_bn":"গ্রামের মানুষ বনের গাছের মতো শক্ত।","meaning_hi":"गाँव के लोग जंगल के पेड़ों की तरह मजबूत होते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଗାଁର ଲୋକମାନେ ଜଙ୍ଗଲ ଗଛ ପରି ଶକ୍ତିଶାଳୀ |"}},{"id":"","order":6,"type":"text","markdown":"Dare sakam te adi lekan ran benawog aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱥᱟᱠᱟᱢ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱱ ᱨᱟᱱ ᱵᱮᱱᱟᱣᱚᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Dare sakam te adi lekan ran benawog aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দারে সাকাম তে আডি লেকান রান বেনাওয়ঃ আ।","textHindi":"दारे साकाम ते आडि लेकान रान बेनावगआ।","textOdia":"ଦାରେ ସାକାମ ତେ ଆଡି ଲେକାନ ରାନ ବେନାୱଗଆ।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Many kinds of medicines are made from tree leaves.","pronunciation":"Dare sakam te adi lekan ran benawog aa.","meaning_en":"Many kinds of medicines are made from tree leaves.","meaning_bn":"গাছের পাতা থেকে অনেক ধরনের ওষুধ তৈরি হয়।","meaning_hi":"पेड़ की पत्तियों से कई तरह की औषधियां बनाई जाती हैं।","meaning_or":"ଗଛ ପତ୍ରରୁ ଅନେକ ପ୍ରକାରର medicines ଷଧ ତିଆରି କରାଯାଏ |"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Bir banchao lagid atu hor ko sapraw akana.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱤᱨ ᱵᱟᱧᱪᱟᱣ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱥᱟᱯᱲᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Bir banchao lagid atu hor ko sapraw akana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বির বাঞচাও লাগিদ আতু হড় ক সাপড়াওয় আকানা।","textHindi":"बिर बाञचाव लागिद आतु हड़ क सापड़ाव आकाना।","textOdia":"ବିର ବାଞଚାୱ ଲାଗିଦ ଆତୁ ହଡ଼ କ ସାପଡ଼ାୱ ଆକାନା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"The villagers are ready to protect the forest.","pronunciation":"Bir banchao lagid atu hor ko sapraw akana.","meaning_en":"The villagers are ready to protect the forest.","meaning_bn":"গ্রামবাসীরা বন রক্ষায় প্রস্তুত।","meaning_hi":"जंगल की सुरक्षा के लिए ग्रामीण तत्पर हैं.","meaning_or":"ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀ ଜଙ୍ଗଲର ସୁରକ୍ଷା ପାଇଁ ପ୍ରସ୍ତୁତ ଅଛନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":8,"type":"text","markdown":"Sohrae porob re ale orag te sagun daram.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱚᱦᱨᱟᱭ ᱯᱚᱨᱚᱵ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱞᱮ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱫᱟᱨᱟᱢ।","textLatin":"Sohrae porob re ale orag te sagun daram.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সহরায় পরব রে আলে অড়াগ তে সাগুন দারাম।","textHindi":"सहराय परब रे आले अड़ाग ते सागुन दाराम।","textOdia":"ସହରାୟ ପରବ ରେ ଆଲେ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ତେ ସାଗୁନ ଦାରାମ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun stands beside a modern work table with drafting papers and a digital tablet, pointing forward with hope. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"You are welcome to our house during the Sohrae festival.","pronunciation":"Sohrae porob re ale orag te sagun daram.","meaning_en":"You are welcome to our house during the Sohrae festival.","meaning_bn":"সোহরায় উৎসবে আমাদের বাড়িতে আপনাকে স্বাগতম।","meaning_hi":"सोहराए त्योहार के दौरान हमारे घर में आपका स्वागत है।","meaning_or":"ସୋହର ପର୍ବରେ ତୁମେ ଆମ ଘରକୁ ସ୍ୱାଗତ |"}},{"id":"","order":9,"type":"text","markdown":"Ale orag re do hasa reyag adi napay bhit citar menag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱞᱮ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱦᱟᱥᱟ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱵᱷᱤᱛ ᱪᱤᱛᱟᱹᱨ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Ale orag re do hasa reyag adi napay bhit citar menag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আলে অড়াঃ রে দ হাসা রেয়াঃ আডি নাপায় ভিত চিতার মেনাঃ আ।।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate holding a handful of rich, dark soil, ready to plant seeds, looking hopeful and proud. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"There are very beautiful clay wall paintings in our home.","meaning_en":"There are very beautiful clay wall paintings in our home.","meaning_bn":"আমাদের বাড়িতে খুব সুন্দর মাটির দেয়ালচিত্র রয়েছে।"}},{"id":"","order":10,"type":"text","markdown":"Ayo do hasa bhit re adi chehra chitar e benaw akada.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱭᱳ ᱫᱚ ᱦᱟᱥᱟ ᱵᱷᱤᱛ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱪᱮᱦᱨᱟ ᱪᱤᱛᱟᱹᱨ ᱮ ᱵᱮᱱᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Ayo do hasa bhit re adi chehra chitar e benaw akada.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আয়ো দ হাসা ভিত রে আডি চেহরা চিতার এ বেনাওয় আকাদা।","textHindi":"आयो द हासा भित रे आडि चेहरा चितार ए बेनाव आकादा।","textOdia":"ଆୟୋ ଦ ହାସା ଭିତ ରେ ଆଡି ଚେହରା ଚିତାର ଏ ବେନାୱ ଆକାଦା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"A gentle Santhal mother smiling warmly as she helps Olitun adjust a neat shoulder bag. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"Olitun aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Mother has drawn very beautiful paintings on the clay wall.","pronunciation":"Ayo do hasa bhit re adi chehra chitar e benaw akada.","meaning_en":"Mother has drawn very beautiful paintings on the clay wall.","meaning_bn":"মাটির দেয়ালে মা খুব সুন্দর ছবি এঁকেছেন।","meaning_hi":"माँ ने मिट्टी की दीवार पर बहुत सुंदर चित्र बनाए हैं।","meaning_or":"ମାଟି କାନ୍ଥରେ ବହୁତ ସୁନ୍ଦର ଚିତ୍ର ଆଙ୍କିଛନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":11,"type":"text","markdown":"Baha porob re sarjom baha te bonga than le sajawa.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱟᱦᱟ ᱯᱚᱨᱚᱵ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱟᱨᱡᱚᱢ ᱵᱟᱦᱟ ᱛᱮ ᱵᱚᱸᱜᱟ ᱛᱷᱟᱱ ᱞᱮ ᱥᱟᱡᱟᱣᱟ।","textLatin":"Baha porob re sarjom baha te bonga than le sajawa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বাহা পরব রে সারজম বাহা তে বঁগা থান লে সাজাওয়া।","textHindi":"बाहा परब रे सारजम बाहा ते बँगा थान ले साजावा।","textOdia":"ବାହା ପରବ ରେ ସାରଜମ ବାହା ତେ ବଁଗା ଥାନ ଲେ ସାଜାୱା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate holding a vibrant wild flower, smelling its scent with a happy, relaxed expression. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"In the Baha festival, we decorate the place of worship with Sal flowers.","pronunciation":"Baha porob re sarjom baha te bonga than le sajawa.","meaning_en":"In the Baha festival, we decorate the place of worship with Sal flowers.","meaning_bn":"বাহা উৎসবে আমরা সাল ফুল দিয়ে পূজার স্থান সাজাই।","meaning_hi":"बाहा पर्व में हम पूजा स्थल को साल के फूलों से सजाते हैं।","meaning_or":"ବାହା ପର୍ବରେ ଆମେ ପୂଜାପାଠ ସ୍ଥାନକୁ ସାଲ ଫୁଲରେ ସଜାଇଥାଉ |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Geyan hor re lahag lagid olog parhaw adi lakti geya.","textOlChiki":"ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱦᱚᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱞᱟᱦᱟᱜ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱚᱞᱚᱜ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱣ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱞᱟᱹᱠᱛᱤ ᱜᱮᱭᱟ।","textLatin":"Geyan hor re lahag lagid olog parhaw adi lakti geya.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গেয়ান হর রে লাহাঃ লাগিদ অলঃ পাড়হাও আডি লাকতি গেয়া।","textHindi":"गेयान हर रे लाहाग लागिद अलग पाड़हाव आडि लाकति गेया।","textOdia":"ଗେୟାନ ହର ରେ ଲାହାଗ ଲାଗିଦ ଅଲଗ ପାଡ଼ହାୱ ଆଡି ଲାକତି ଗେୟା।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun excitedly discovering knowledge inside a large, open picture book that glows with colorful patterns. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"Olitun expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Studying is very necessary to advance on the path of knowledge.","pronunciation":"Geyan hor re lahag lagid olog parhaw adi lakti geya.","meaning_en":"Studying is very necessary to advance on the path of knowledge.","meaning_bn":"জ্ঞানের পথে এগিয়ে যেতে অধ্যয়ন খুবই প্রয়োজন।","meaning_hi":"ज्ञान के पथ पर आगे बढ़ने के लिए पढ़ाई बहुत जरूरी है।","meaning_or":"ଜ୍ଞାନର ମାର୍ଗରେ ଅଗ୍ରଗତି କରିବା ପାଇଁ ଅଧ୍ୟୟନ ଅତ୍ୟନ୍ତ ଆବଶ୍ୟକ |"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Guru kolom te amag nyutum serma re ol me.","textOlChiki":"ᱜᱩᱨᱩ ᱠᱚᱞᱚᱢ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ ᱥᱮᱨᱢᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱚᱞ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Guru kolom te amag nyutum serma re ol me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গুরু কলম তে আমাঃ ঞুতুম সেরমা রে অল মে।","textHindi":"गुरु कलम ते आमाग ञुतुम सेरमा रे अल मे।","textOdia":"ଗୁରୁ କଲମ ତେ ଆମାଗ ଞୁତୁମ ସେରମା ରେ ଅଲ ମେ।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate writing clean Ol Chiki characters on a blackboard with chalk, standing tall with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Write your name in the sky with the Guru''s pen.","pronunciation":"Guru kolom te amag nyutum serma re ol me.","meaning_en":"Write your name in the sky with the Guru''s pen.","meaning_bn":"গুরুর কলম দিয়ে আকাশে তোমার নাম লিখো।","meaning_hi":"गुरु की कलम से आसमान में अपना नाम लिख दो।","meaning_or":"ଗୁରୁଙ୍କ କଲମ ସହିତ ଆକାଶରେ ତୁମର ନାମ ଲେଖ |"}},{"id":"","order":14,"type":"text","markdown":"Ari chali ar lakchar do abowaa g marang uprum kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱪᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱟᱨ ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟᱜ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱩᱯᱨᱩᱢ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Ari chali ar lakchar do abowaa g marang uprum kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আরি চালি আর লাকচার দ আবওয়াগ মারাং উপরুম কানা।","textHindi":"आरि चालि आर लाकचार द आबवाग माराङ उपरुम काना।","textOdia":"ଆରି ଚାଲି ଆର ଲାକଚାର ଦ ଆବୱାଗ ମାରାଙ ଉପରୁମ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun stands under the bright sun, showcasing a creative blueprint of a village development project with pride. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Customs and culture are our great identity.","pronunciation":"Ari chali ar lakchar do abowaa  marang uprum kana.","meaning_en":"Customs and culture are our great identity.","meaning_bn":"প্রথা ও সংস্কৃতি আমাদের বড় পরিচয়।","meaning_hi":"रीति-रिवाज और संस्कृति हमारी बड़ी पहचान है।","meaning_or":"ରୀତିନୀତି ଏବଂ ସଂସ୍କୃତି ଆମର ମହାନ ପରିଚୟ |"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"Herem ror te atu hor mone re jayga benaw me.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱮᱲᱮᱢ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱨᱮ ᱡᱟᱭᱜᱟ ᱵᱮᱱᱟᱣ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Herem ror te atu hor mone re jayga benaw me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হেড়েম রড় তে আতু হড় মনে রে জায়গা বেনাও মে।","textHindi":"हेड़ेम रड़ ते आतु हड़ मने रे जायगा बेनाव मे।","textOdia":"ହେଡ଼େମ ରଡ଼ ତେ ଆତୁ ହଡ଼ ମନେ ରେ ଜାୟଗା ବେନାୱ ମେ।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate works together with classmates around a table filled with building blocks and tablets, smiling with ambition. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Make a place in the hearts of the villagers with sweet speech.","pronunciation":"Herem ror te atu hor mone re jayga benaw me.","meaning_en":"Make a place in the hearts of the villagers with sweet speech.","meaning_bn":"মিষ্টি কথা বলে গ্রামবাসীর হৃদয়ে জায়গা করে নিন।","meaning_hi":"मधुर वाणी से ग्रामीणों के दिलों में जगह बनाएं।","meaning_or":"ମଧୁର ଭାଷଣ ସହିତ ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀଙ୍କ ହୃଦୟରେ ଏକ ସ୍ଥାନ ସୃଷ୍ଟି କରନ୍ତୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Sirjoniya do adi napay te nowa dharti e sirjon akada.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱚᱱᱤᱭᱟᱹ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱫᱷᱟᱹᱨᱛᱤ ᱮ ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱚᱱ ᱟᱠᱟᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Sirjoniya do adi napay te nowa dharti e sirjon akada.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিরজনিয়া দ আডি নাপায় তে নওয়া ধারতি এ সিরজন আকাদা।","textHindi":"सिरजनिया द आडि नापाय ते नोवा धारति ए सिरजन आकादा।","textOdia":"ସିରଜନିୟା ଦ ଆଡି ନାପାୟ ତେ ନୋୱା ଧାରତି ଏ ସିରଜନ ଆକାଦା।","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"Olitun holding a handful of rich, dark soil, ready to plant seeds, looking hopeful and proud. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"Olitun aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"The Creator has created this earth very beautifully.","pronunciation":"Sirjoniya do adi napay te nowa dharti e sirjon akada.","meaning_en":"The Creator has created this earth very beautifully.","meaning_bn":"সৃষ্টিকর্তা এই পৃথিবীকে খুব সুন্দর করে সৃষ্টি করেছেন।","meaning_hi":"विधाता ने इस धरती को बहुत ही खूबसूरती से बनाया है।","meaning_or":"ସୃଷ୍ଟିକର୍ତ୍ତା ଏହି ପୃଥିବୀକୁ ଅତି ସୁନ୍ଦର ଭାବରେ ସୃଷ୍ଟି କରିଛନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Sari mone te kami me, sirjoniya asis e emama.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱛᱮ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱢᱮ, ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱚᱱᱤᱭᱟᱹ ᱟᱹᱥᱤᱥ ᱮ ᱮᱢᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Sari mone te kami me, sirjoniya asis e emama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ সারি মনে তে কামি মে, সিরজনিয়া আসিস এ এমামা।","textHindi":"सारि मने ते कामि मे, सिरजनिया आसिस ए एमामा।","textOdia":"ସାରି ମନେ ତେ କାମି ମେ, ସିରଜନିୟା ଆସିସ ଏ ଏମାମା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Work with your honest heart, the Creator will bless you.","pronunciation":"Sari mone te kami me, sirjoniya asis e emama.","meaning_en":"Work with your honest heart, the Creator will bless you.","meaning_bn":"সৎ মন দিয়ে কাজ করুন, সৃষ্টিকর্তা আপনাকে আশীর্বাদ করবেন।","meaning_hi":"सच्चे मन से काम करो, विधाता तुम्हें आशीर्वाद देगा।","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ସଚ୍ଚୋଟ ହୃଦୟ ସହିତ କାମ କର, ସୃଷ୍ଟିକର୍ତ୍ତା ତୁମକୁ ଆଶୀର୍ବାଦ କରିବେ |"}},{"id":"","order":18,"type":"text","markdown":"Santali sawhet parhaw kate in adi raskanj njam keda.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ ᱥᱟᱶᱦᱮᱫ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱣ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱤᱧ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱨᱟᱹᱥᱠᱟᱹᱧ ᱧᱟᱢ ᱠᱮᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Santali sawhet parhaw kate in adi raskanj njam keda.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সানতাড়ি সাওয়হেদ পাড়হাও কাতে ইঞ আডি রাসকাঞ ঞাম কেদা।","textHindi":"सानताड़ि सावहेद पाड़हाव काते इञ आडि रासकाञ ञाम केदा।","textOdia":"ସାନତାଡ଼ି ସାୱହେଦ ପାଡ଼ହାୱ କାତେ ଇଞ ଆଡି ରାସକାଞ ଞାମ କେଦା।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate excitedly discovering knowledge inside a large, open picture book that glows with colorful patterns. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"I found great joy by reading Santali literature.","pronunciation":"Santali sawhet parhaw kate in adi raskanj njam keda.","meaning_en":"I found great joy by reading Santali literature.","meaning_bn":"সাঁওতালি সাহিত্য পড়ে দারুণ আনন্দ পেয়েছি।","meaning_hi":"संताली साहित्य पढ़कर मुझे बहुत आनंद मिला।","meaning_or":"ସାନ୍ତାଳୀ ସାହିତ୍ୟ ପ by ି ମୁଁ ବହୁତ ଆନନ୍ଦ ପାଇଲି |"}},{"id":"","order":19,"type":"text","markdown":"Abin do tehenj oka te bin chalag kana?","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱵᱤᱱ ᱫᱚ ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱚᱠᱟ ᱛᱮ ᱵᱤᱱ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ?","textLatin":"Abin do tehenj oka te bin chalag kana?","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আবিন দ তেহেঞ অকা তে বিন চালাঃ কানা?","textHindi":"आबिन द तेहेञ अका ते बिन चालाग काना?","textOdia":"ଆବିନ ଦ ତେହେଞ ଅକା ତେ ବିନ ଚାଲାଗ କାନା?","emotion":"Ambition","storyArc":"Technology & Learning","growthValue":"Entrepreneurship","characterGoal":"Learn something new","imageDirection":"Olitun works together with classmates around a table filled with building blocks and tablets, smiling with ambition. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Determined forward-looking gaze, confident stance, finger pointing toward the distant horizon.","learningMoment":"Olitun aiming high, showing aspiration for modern education and career path.","meaning":"Where are you two going today?","pronunciation":"Abin do tehenj oka te bin chalag kana?","meaning_en":"Where are you two going today?","meaning_bn":"আজ কোথায় যাচ্ছেন?","meaning_hi":"आज तुम दोनों कहाँ जा रहे हो?","meaning_or":"ଆଜି ତୁମେ ଦୁଇଜଣ କୁଆଡେ ଯାଉଛ?"}},{"id":"","order":20,"type":"text","markdown":"Alinj do bir te linj chalag kana, sahan lagid.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱞᱤᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱵᱤᱨ ᱛᱮ ᱞᱤᱧ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱥᱟᱦᱟᱱ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ।","textLatin":"Alinj do bir te linj chalag kana, sahan lagid.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আলিঞ দ বির তে লিঞ চালাঃ কানা, সাহান লাগিদ।","textHindi":"आलिञ द बिर ते लिञ चालाग काना, साहान लागिद।","textOdia":"ଆଲିଞ ଦ ବିର ତେ ଲିଞ ଚାଲାଗ କାନା, ସାହାନ ଲାଗିଦ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Future Success","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Build confidence","imageDirection":"Olitun looking at a crackling orange campfire, warm light reflecting on a happy, peaceful face. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"We two are going to the forest for firewood.","pronunciation":"Alinj do bir te linj chalag kana, sahan lagid.","meaning_en":"We two are going to the forest for firewood.","meaning_bn":"আমরা দুজনে কাঠের জন্য বনে যাচ্ছি।","meaning_hi":"हम दोनों जलाऊ लकड़ी के लिए जंगल जा रहे हैं।","meaning_or":"ଆମେ ଦୁହେଁ କାଠ ପାଇଁ ଜଙ୍ଗଲକୁ ଯାଉଛୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":21,"type":"text","markdown":"Napay te chalaw kate ruwar hijug me, johar.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱣ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱨᱩᱣᱟᱹᱲ ᱦᱤᱡᱩᱜ ᱢᱮ, ᱡᱚᱦᱟᱨ।","textLatin":"Napay te chalaw kate ruwar hijug me, johar.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_conversational_3_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নাপায় তে চালাওয় কাতে রুওয়াড় হিজুঃ মে, জহার।","textHindi":"नापाय ते चालाव काते रुवाड़ हिजुग मे, जहार।","textOdia":"ନାପାୟ ତେ ଚାଲାୱ କାତେ ରୁୱାଡ଼ ହିଜୁଗ ମେ, ଜହାର।","emotion":"Hope","storyArc":"Modern World","growthValue":"Technology","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands in a clean, modern learning space, gesturing toward a screen showing village success metrics. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Looking upward and forward, eyes shining bright with positive expectation, smiling gently.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate expressing optimism for progress, new opportunities, and future success.","meaning":"Go safely and return, greetings.","pronunciation":"Napay te chalaw kate ruwar hijug me, johar.","meaning_en":"Go safely and return, greetings.","meaning_bn":"নিরাপদে যান এবং ফিরে যান, শুভেচ্ছা।","meaning_hi":"सुरक्षित जाओ और लौट आओ, नमस्कार.","meaning_or":"ନିରାପଦରେ ଯାଆନ୍ତୁ ଏବଂ ଶୁଭେଚ୍ଛା |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, category_id, title_ol_chiki, title_latin, lesson_type, order_index, raw_json) VALUES ('lesson_sentences_folk_1', 'cat_sentences_1778594024495', 'ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱵᱮᱱᱛᱟ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱑', 'Cultural Proverbs & Wisdom I', NULL, 0, '{"id":"lesson_sentences_folk_1","categoryId":"cat_sentences_1778594024495","titleOlChiki":"ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱵᱮᱱᱛᱟ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱑","titleLatin":"Cultural Proverbs & Wisdom I","level":"beginner","orderIndex":0,"isActive":true,"estimatedMinutes":5,"description":"","thumbnailUrl":null,"isPremium":false,"audioUrl":null,"blocks":[{"id":"","order":0,"type":"text","markdown":"Dare ge dhon kana, onate dare alom mag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱜᱮ ᱫᱷᱚᱱ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱚᱱᱟᱛᱮ ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱟᱞᱚᱢ ᱢᱟᱜᱟ।","textLatin":"Dare ge dhon kana, onate dare alom mag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দারে গে ধন কানা, অনাতে দারে আলম মাগ্ আ।","textHindi":"दारे गे धन काना, अनाते दारे आलम मागा।","textOdia":"ଦାରେ ଗେ ଧନ କାନା, ଅନାତେ ଦାରେ ଆଲମ ମାଗା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Trees are wealth, therefore do not cut trees.","pronunciation":"Dare ge dhon kana, onate dare alom mag aa.","meaning_en":"Trees are wealth, therefore do not cut trees.","meaning_bn":"গাছই সম্পদ, তাই গাছ কেটো না।","meaning_hi":"पेड़ ही धन हैं, इसलिए पेड़ मत काटो।","meaning_or":"ଗଛ ହିଁ ଧନ, ତେଣୁ ଗଛ କାଟ ନାହିଁ।"}},{"id":"","order":1,"type":"text","markdown":"Hor ror buru ror, sari katha do tishon bang bodolog aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱚᱲ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱵᱩᱨᱩ ᱨᱚᱲ, ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱛᱤᱥᱦᱚᱸ ᱵᱟᱝ ᱵᱚᱫᱚᱞᱚᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Hor ror buru ror, sari katha do tishon bang bodolog aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হড় রড় বুরু রড়, সারি কাথা দ তিসহঁ বাং বদলঃ আ।","textHindi":"हड़ रड़ बुरु रड़, सारि काथा द तिसहँ बाङ बदलगआ।","textOdia":"ହଡ଼ ରଡ଼ ବୁରୁ ରଡ଼, ସାରି କାଥା ଦ ତିସହଁ ବାଙ ବଦଲଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate standing tall on a hill overlooking the village, looking forward with strong resolution. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Man''s word is as firm as the hill; the truth never changes.","pronunciation":"Hor ror buru ror, sari katha do tishon bang bodolog aa.","meaning_en":"Man''s word is as firm as the hill; the truth never changes.","meaning_bn":"মানুষের কথা পাহাড়ের মতো অটল; সত্য কখনও বদলায় না।","meaning_hi":"मनुष्य की बात पहाड़ जैसी अटल है; सच कभी नहीं बदलता।","meaning_or":"ମଣିଷର କଥା ପାହାଡ଼ ପରି ଅଟଳ; ସତ୍ୟ କେବେ ବଦଳେ ନାହିଁ।"}},{"id":"","order":2,"type":"text","markdown":"Dag re janam leka, amaak mone do sapha dohoy me","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱜ ᱨᱮ ᱡᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ, ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱯᱷᱟ ᱫᱚᱦᱚᱭ ᱢᱮ","textLatin":"Dag re janam leka, amaak mone do sapha dohoy me","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দাগ রে জানাম লেকা, আমাঃ মনে দ সাফা দহয় মে।","textHindi":"दाग रे जानाम लेका, आमाग मने द साफा दहय मे।","textOdia":"ଦାଗ ରେ ଜାନାମ ଲେକା, ଆମାଗ ମନେ ଦ ସାଫା ଦହୟ ମେ","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun drinking cool, clean water from a traditional clay pot, looking refreshed and happy. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Like being born in water, keep your heart clean.","pronunciation":"Dag re janam leka, amag mone do sapha dohoy me.","meaning_en":"Like being born in water, keep your heart clean.","meaning_bn":"পবিত্র জলের মতো নিজের অন্তর পরিষ্কার রাখো।","meaning_hi":"जल के समान अपना मन स्वच्छ रखो।","meaning_or":"ପବିତ୍ର ଜଳ ଭଳି ନିଜ ମନ ସଫା ରଖ।"}},{"id":"","order":3,"type":"text","markdown":"Hasa hormo do mid din hasa re ge mesag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱟᱥᱟ ᱦᱚᱲᱢᱚ ᱫᱚ ᱢᱤᱫ ᱫᱤᱱ ᱦᱟᱥᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱜᱮ ᱢᱮᱥᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Hasa hormo do mid din hasa re ge mesag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হাসা হড়ম দ মিদ দিন হাসা রে গে মেসাঃ আ।","textHindi":"हासा हड़म द मिद दिन हासा रे गे मेसागआ।","textOdia":"ହାସା ହଡ଼ମ ଦ ମିଦ ଦିନ ହାସା ରେ ଗେ ମେସାଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate holding a handful of rich, dark soil, ready to plant seeds, looking hopeful and proud. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"The clay body will one day mix into the clay.","pronunciation":"Hasa hormo do mid din hasa re ge mesag aa.","meaning_en":"The clay body will one day mix into the clay.","meaning_bn":"মাটির শরীর একদিন মাটিতে মিশে যাবে।","meaning_hi":"मिट्टी का शरीर एक दिन मिट्टी में ही मिल जायेगा।","meaning_or":"ମାଟି ଶରୀର ଦିନେ ମାଟିରେ ମିଶିବ |"}},{"id":"","order":4,"type":"text","markdown":"Sengel jiwi tahen khan, jaha kami ge huy dareyaga","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱮᱸᱜᱮᱞ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱛᱟᱹᱦᱮᱱ ᱠᱷᱟᱱ, ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱸ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱜᱮ ᱦᱩᱭ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ","textLatin":"Sengel jiwi tahen khan, jaha kami ge huy dareyaga","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সেঁগেল জিওয়ি তাহেন খান, জাহাঁ কামি গে হুয় দাড়েয়াঃ আ।","textHindi":"सेँगेल जिवि ताहेन खान, जाहाँ कामि गे हुय दाड़ेयाग आ।","textOdia":"ସେଁଗେଲ ଜିୱି ତାହେନ ଖାନ, ଜାହାଁ କାମି ଗେ ହୁୟ ଦାଡ଼େୟାଗଆ","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"If there is a fiery soul, any work can be accomplished.","pronunciation":"Sengel jiwi tahen khan, jaha kami ge huy dareyag aa.","meaning_en":"If there is a fiery soul, any work can be accomplished.","meaning_bn":"অগ্নিপ্রাণ থাকলে যেকোন কাজ সম্পন্ন করা যায়।","meaning_hi":"यदि अग्निमय आत्मा हो तो कोई भी कार्य सिद्ध हो सकता है।","meaning_or":"ଯଦି ଏକ ଜ୍ୱଳନ୍ତ ପ୍ରାଣ ଅଛି, ଯେକ any ଣସି କାର୍ଯ୍ୟ ସମ୍ପନ୍ନ ହୋଇପାରିବ |"}},{"id":"","order":5,"type":"text","markdown":"Hoy leka dar kate okto alom nostoya.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱚᱭ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱫᱟᱹᱲ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱚᱠᱛᱚ ᱟᱞᱚᱢ ᱱᱚᱥᱴᱚᱭᱟ","textLatin":"Hoy leka dar kate okto alom nostoya.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হয় লেকা দাড় কাতে অকত আলম নসটয়া।","textHindi":"हय लेका दाड़ काते अकत आलम नसटया।","textOdia":"ହୟ ଲେକା ଦାଡ଼ କାତେ ଅକତ ଆଲମ ନସଟୟା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Do not waste time by running like the wind.","pronunciation":"Hoy leka dar kate okto alom nostoya.","meaning_en":"Do not waste time by running like the wind.","meaning_bn":"বাতাসের মত দৌড়ে সময় নষ্ট করবেন না।","meaning_hi":"हवा की तरह दौड़कर समय बर्बाद मत करो।","meaning_or":"ପବନ ପରି ଦ running ଡ଼ି ସମୟ ନଷ୍ଟ କରନ୍ତୁ ନାହିଁ |"}},{"id":"","order":6,"type":"text","markdown":"Bir umul re durub kate atu hor ko jiraw kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱤᱨ ᱩᱢᱩᱞ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱩᱲᱩᱵ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱡᱤᱨᱟᱹᱣ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Bir umul re durub kate atu hor ko jiraw kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বির উমুল রে দুড়ুব কাতে আতু হড় ক জিরাওয় কানা।","textHindi":"बिर उमुल रे दुड़ुब काते आतु हड़ क जिराव काना।","textOdia":"ବିର ଉମୁଲ ରେ ଦୁଡ଼ୁବ କାତେ ଆତୁ ହଡ଼ କ ଜିରାୱ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"The villagers are resting by sitting under the forest''s shade.","pronunciation":"Bir umul re durub kate atu hor ko jiraw kana.","meaning_en":"The villagers are resting by sitting under the forest''s shade.","meaning_bn":"গ্রামবাসীরা বনের ছায়ায় বসে বিশ্রাম নিচ্ছে।","meaning_hi":"ग्रामीण जंगल की छांव में बैठकर आराम कर रहे हैं।","meaning_or":"ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀ ଛାଇ ତଳେ ବସି ବିଶ୍ରାମ ନେଉଛନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Dare sakam te atu ran benaw kate hor ko besog aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱥᱟᱠᱟᱢ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱟᱱ ᱵᱮᱱᱟᱣ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱵᱮᱥᱚᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Dare sakam te atu ran benaw kate hor ko besog aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দারে সাকাম তে আতু রান বেনাওয় কাতে হড় ক বেসঃ আ।","textHindi":"दारे साकाम ते आतु रान बेनाव काते हड़ क बेसग आ।","textOdia":"ଦାରେ ସାକାମ ତେ ଆତୁ ରାନ ବେନାୱ କାତେ ହଡ଼ କ ବେସଗଆ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate holds a ripe, bright red pomegranate, showing its rich color with a proud and happy smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"People get cured by making village medicines from tree leaves.","pronunciation":"Dare sakam te atu ran benaw kate hor ko besog aa.","meaning_en":"People get cured by making village medicines from tree leaves.","meaning_bn":"গাছের পাতা থেকে গ্রাম্য ওষুধ তৈরি করে মানুষ আরোগ্য লাভ করে।","meaning_hi":"पेड़ के पत्तों से ग्रामीण औषधियां बनाकर लोग ठीक हो जाते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଗଛ ପତ୍ରରୁ ଦେଶୀ ଔଷଧ ତିଆରି କରି ଲୋକମାନେ ଭଲ ହେଉଛନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":8,"type":"text","markdown":"Jiwi jali re tahen lagid, abo sanam hor jumid tahen lakti geya.","textOlChiki":"ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱡᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱛᱟᱹᱦᱮᱱ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ, ᱟᱵᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱡᱩᱢᱤᱫᱽ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸᱱ ᱞᱟᱹᱠᱛᱤ ᱜᱮᱭᱟ।","textLatin":"Jiwi jali re tahen lagid, abo sanam hor jumid tahen lakti geya.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"জিওয়ি জালি রে তাহেন লাগিদ, আব সানাম হড় জুমিদ তাহেঁন লাকতি গেয়া।","textHindi":"जिवि जालि रे ताहेन लागिद, आब सानाम हड़ जुमिद ताहेँन लाकति गेया।","textOdia":"ଜିୱି ଜାଲି ରେ ତାହେନ ଲାଗିଦ, ଆବ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ଜୁମିଦ ତାହେଁନ ଲାକତି ଗେୟା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"As if living in the web of life, it is necessary for all of us to remain united.","pronunciation":"Jiwi jali re tahen lagid, abo sanam hor jumid tahen lakti geya.","meaning_en":"As if living in the web of life, it is necessary for all of us to remain united.","meaning_bn":"জীবনের জালে বেঁচে থাকার জন্য, আমাদের সকলের ঐক্যবদ্ধ থাকা প্রয়োজন।","meaning_hi":"जीवन के जाल में रहने के लिए, हम सभी को एकजुट रहना ज़रूरी है।","meaning_or":"ଜୀବନ ଜାଲରେ ରହିବା ପାଇଁ, ଆମ ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କୁ ଏକଜୁଟ ହୋଇ ରହିବା ଜରୁରୀ।"}},{"id":"","order":9,"type":"text","markdown":"Sari serma re ipil ko adi napay ko julug kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱥᱮᱨᱢᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱤᱯᱤᱞ ᱠᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱠᱚ ᱡᱩᱞᱩᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Sari serma re ipil ko adi napay ko julug kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সারি সেরমা রে ইপিল ক আডি নাপায় ক জুলুঃ কানা।","textHindi":"सारि सेरमा रे इपिल क आडि नापाय क जुलुग काना।","textOdia":"ସାରି ସେରମା ରେ ଇପିଲ କ ଆଡି ନାପାୟ କ ଜୁଲୁଗ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate lying on a straw mat under a clear night sky, pointing at a shooting star in wonder. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Stars shine very beautifully in the true heavens.","pronunciation":"Sari serma re ipil ko adi napay ko julug kana.","meaning_en":"Stars shine very beautifully in the true heavens.","meaning_bn":"তারারা সত্যিকারের আকাশে খুব সুন্দরভাবে জ্বলজ্বল করে।","meaning_hi":"सच्चे आकाश में तारे बहुत खूबसूरती से चमकते हैं।","meaning_or":"ତାରାମାନେ ପ୍ରକୃତ ଆକାଶରେ ଅତି ସୁନ୍ଦର ଭାବରେ ଉଜ୍ଜ୍ୱଳ |"}},{"id":"","order":10,"type":"text","markdown":"Kudum katha te atu haram do gidra ko geyan e ema kowa.","textOlChiki":"ᱠᱩᱫᱩᱢ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱦᱟᱲᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱜᱤᱫᱽᱨᱟᱹ ᱠᱚ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱮ ᱮᱢᱟ ᱠᱚᱣᱟ।","textLatin":"Kudum katha te atu haram do gidra ko geyan e ema kowa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"কুদুম কাথা তে আতু হাড়াম দ গিদরা ক গেয়ান এ এমা কওয়া।","textHindi":"कुदुम काथा ते आतु हाड़ाम द गिदरा क गेयान ए एमा कवा।","textOdia":"କୁଦୁମ କାଥା ତେ ଆତୁ ହାଡ଼ାମ ଦ ଗିଦରା କ ଗେୟାନ ଏ ଏମା କୱା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"The village elder gives knowledge to children through riddles.","pronunciation":"Kudum katha te atu haram do gidra ko geyan e ema kowa.","meaning_en":"The village elder gives knowledge to children through riddles.","meaning_bn":"গ্রামের প্রবীণ ধাঁধার মাধ্যমে শিশুদের জ্ঞান দেন।","meaning_hi":"गाँव के बुजुर्ग बच्चों को पहेलियों के माध्यम से ज्ञान देते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଗାଁ ପ୍ରାଚୀନ ପିଲାମାନଙ୍କୁ ଉପହାସ ମାଧ୍ୟମରେ ଜ୍ଞାନ ଦିଅନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":11,"type":"text","markdown":"Benta ror te amag katha do gahir te sodor me.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱮᱱᱛᱟ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱜᱟᱹᱦᱤᱨ ᱛᱮ ᱥᱚᱫᱚᱨ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Benta ror te amag katha do gahir te sodor me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বেনতা রড় তে আমাঃ কাথা দ গাহির তে সদর মে।","textHindi":"बेनता रड़ ते आमाग काथा द गाहिर ते सदर मे।","textOdia":"ବେନତା ରଡ଼ ତେ ଆମାଗ କାଥା ଦ ଗାହିର ତେ ସଦର ମେ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands proudly at a crossroads in the village, pointing toward a path of opportunity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Present your words deeply with idiomatic speech.","pronunciation":"Benta ror te amag katha do gahir te sodor me.","meaning_en":"Present your words deeply with idiomatic speech.","meaning_bn":"ইডিওম্যাটিক বক্তৃতা দিয়ে আপনার কথাগুলো গভীরভাবে উপস্থাপন করুন।","meaning_hi":"मुहावरेदार वाणी के साथ अपनी बात को गहराई से प्रस्तुत करें।","meaning_or":"ମୂର୍ଖ ବକ୍ତବ୍ୟ ସହିତ ତୁମର ଶବ୍ଦକୁ ଗଭୀର ଭାବରେ ଉପସ୍ଥାପନ କର |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Haram katha do abowaag jiwi re sari hor e udug aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱟᱲᱟᱢ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟᱜ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱦᱚᱨ ᱮ ᱩᱫᱩᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Haram katha do abowaag jiwi re sari hor e udug aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হাড়াম কাথা দ আবওয়াঃ জিওয়ি রে সারি হর এ উদুগ্ আ।","textHindi":"हाड़ाम काथा द आबवाग जिवि रे सारि हर ए उदुग आ।","textOdia":"ହାଡ଼ାମ କାଥା ଦ ଆବୱାଗ ଜିୱି ରେ ସାରି ହର ଏ ଉଦୁଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun standing tall on a hill overlooking the village, looking forward with strong resolution. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Ancestral wisdom shows the true path in our lives.","pronunciation":"Haram katha do abowaag jiwi re sari hor e udug aa.","meaning_en":"Ancestral wisdom shows the true path in our lives.","meaning_bn":"পূর্বপুরুষের জ্ঞান আমাদের জীবনে সত্য পথ দেখায়।","meaning_hi":"पैतृक ज्ञान हमारे जीवन में सच्चा मार्ग दिखाता है।","meaning_or":"ପିତୃପୁରୁଷ ଜ୍ଞାନ ଆମ ଜୀବନର ପ୍ରକୃତ ପଥ ଦେଖାଏ |"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Budhhi uyhar te orag reyag gharonj do napay te tahena.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱩᱫᱷᱤ ᱩᱭᱦᱟᱹᱨ ᱛᱮ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱜᱷᱟᱨᱚᱸᱡᱽ ᱫᱚ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Budhhi uyhar te orag reyag gharonj do napay te tahena.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বুধি উয়হার তে অড়াঃ রেয়াঃ ঘারঁজ দ নাপায় তে তাহেঁনা।","textHindi":"बुधि उयहार ते अड़ाग रेयाग घारँज द नापाय ते ताहेँना।","textOdia":"ବୁଧି ଉୟହାର ତେ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ରେୟାଗ ଘାରଁଜ ଦ ନାପାୟ ତେ ତାହେଁନା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"A gentle Santhal mother smiling warmly as she helps a young Santhal child classmate adjust a neat shoulder bag. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"If there is wisdom in thoughts, the family and home remain beautiful.","meaning_en":"If there is wisdom in thoughts, the family and home remain beautiful.","meaning_bn":"চিন্তাধারায় বুদ্ধিমত্তা থাকলে, ঘর-সংসার সুন্দর থাকে।","meaning_hi":"सोच में बुद्धि हो तो घर-परिवार सुन्दर बना रहता है।","meaning_or":"ଯଦି ଚିନ୍ତାଧାରାରେ ବୁଦ୍ଧି ଥାଏ, ତେବେ ପରିବାର ଓ ଘର ସୁନ୍ଦର ହୋଇ ରହେ।","pronunciation":"Budhhi uyhar te orag reyag gharonj do napay te tahena."}},{"id":"","order":14,"type":"text","markdown":"Atu ari lekate sanam porob le manawa.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱯᱚᱨᱚᱵ ᱞᱮ ᱢᱟᱱᱟᱣᱟ।","textLatin":"Atu ari lekate sanam porob le manawa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আতু আরি লেকাতে সানাম পরব লে মানাওয়া।","textHindi":"आतु आरि लेकाते सानाम परब ले मानावा।","textOdia":"ଆତୁ ଆରି ଲେକାତେ ସାନାମ ପରବ ଲେ ମାନାୱା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"We celebrate all festivals according to the village customs.","pronunciation":"Atu ari lekate sanam porob le manawa.","meaning_en":"We celebrate all festivals according to the village customs.","meaning_bn":"আমরা গ্রামের রীতি অনুযায়ী সব উৎসব পালন করি।","meaning_hi":"हम सभी त्योहार गांव के रीति-रिवाज के अनुसार मनाते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଗାଁ ରୀତିନୀତି ଅନୁଯାୟୀ ଆମେ ସମସ୍ତ ପର୍ବ ପାଳନ କରିଥାଉ |"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"Jumid dare ge Santal somaj reyag marang thay kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱡᱩᱢᱤᱫᱽ ᱫᱟᱲᱮ ᱜᱮ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲ ᱥᱚᱢᱟᱡᱽ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱛᱷᱟᱹᱭ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Jumid dare ge Santal somaj reyag marang thay kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"জুমিদ দাড়ে গে সানতাড় সমাজ রেয়াঃ মারাং থায় কানা।","textHindi":"जुमिद दाड़े गे सानताड़ समाज रेयाग माराङ थाय काना।","textOdia":"ଜୁମିଦ ଦାଡ଼େ ଗେ ସାନତାଡ଼ ସମାଜ ରେୟାଗ ମାରାଙ ଥାୟ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands proudly at a crossroads in the village, pointing toward a path of opportunity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Unity is the great pillar of the Santal society.","pronunciation":"Jumid dare ge Santal somaj reyag marang thay kana.","meaning_en":"Unity is the great pillar of the Santal society.","meaning_bn":"ঐক্য সাঁওতাল সমাজের মহান স্তম্ভ।","meaning_hi":"एकता संताल समाज का महान आधार है.","meaning_or":"ଏକତା ହେଉଛି ସାନ୍ତାଳ ସମାଜର ମହାନ ସ୍ତମ୍ଭ |"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Sohrae serenj anjom kate jiwi raska te perejog aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱚᱦᱨᱟᱭ ᱥᱮᱨᱮᱧ ᱟᱸᱡᱚᱢ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱟᱹᱥᱠᱟᱹ ᱛᱮ ᱯᱮᱨᱮᱡᱚᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Sohrae serenj anjom kate jiwi raska te perejog aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সহরায় সেরেঞ আঁজম কাতে জিওয়ি রাসকা তে পেরেজঃ আ।","textHindi":"सहराय सेरेञ आँजम काते जिवि रासका ते पेरेजग आ।","textOdia":"ସହରାୟ ସେରେଞ ଆଁଜମ କାତେ ଜିୱି ରାସକା ତେ ପେରେଜଗଆ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Listening to Sohrae songs fills the soul with joy.","pronunciation":"Sohrae serenj anjom kate jiwi raska te perejog aa.","meaning_en":"Listening to Sohrae songs fills the soul with joy.","meaning_bn":"সোহরায় গান শুনলে মন ভরে যায় আনন্দে।","meaning_hi":"सोहराए गीत सुनने से मन आनंद से भर जाता है।","meaning_or":"ସୋହର ଗୀତ ଶୁଣିବା ଦ୍ୱାରା ଆତ୍ମା ​​ଆନନ୍ଦରେ ପରିପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ହୁଏ |"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Jaher umul re ale do sanam hor napay te le tahena.","textOlChiki":"ᱡᱟᱦᱮᱨ ᱩᱢᱩᱞ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱞᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱞᱮ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Jaher umul re ale do sanam hor napay te le tahena.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"জাহের উমুল রে আলে দ সানাম হড় নাপায় তে লে তাহেঁনা।","textHindi":"जाहेर उमुल रे आले द सानाम हड़ नापाय ते ले ताहेँना।","textOdia":"ଜାହେର ଉମୁଲ ରେ ଆଲେ ଦ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ନାପାୟ ତେ ଲେ ତାହେଁନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun holds a ripe, bright red pomegranate, showing its rich color with a proud and happy smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Under the protection of the sacred Jaher, we all live peacefully.","pronunciation":"Jaher umul re ale do sanam hor napay te le tahena.","meaning_en":"Under the protection of the sacred Jaher, we all live peacefully.","meaning_bn":"পবিত্র জাহেরের আশ্রয়ে, আমরা সবাই শান্তিতে বাস করি।","meaning_hi":"पवित्र जाहेर की छाया में हम सब शांति से रहते हैं।","meaning_or":"ପବିତ୍ର ଜାହେରଙ୍କ ଛାୟାରେ ଆମେ ସମସ୍ତେ ଶାନ୍ତିରେ ବାସ କରୁ।"}},{"id":"","order":18,"type":"text","markdown":"Majhi bichar do sanam hor ko manaw batawa.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱟᱹᱡᱷᱤ ᱵᱤᱪᱟᱹᱨ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱟᱱᱟᱣ ᱵᱟᱛᱟᱣᱟ।","textLatin":"Majhi bichar do sanam hor ko manaw batawa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মাঝি বিচার দ সানাম হড় ক মানাওয় বাতাওয়া।","textHindi":"माझि बिचार द सानाम