speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Living life according to the Santal way is the true path.","pronunciation":"Santarh dhorom lekate jiwi khandaw ge sari hor kana.","meaning_en":"Living life according to the Santal way is the true path.","meaning_bn":"সাঁওতাল মতানুসারে জীবন যাপনই প্রকৃত পথ।","meaning_hi":"संताल पद्धति के अनुसार जीवन जीना ही सच्चा मार्ग है.","meaning_or":"ସାନ୍ତାଳ ମାର୍ଗ ଅନୁଯାୟୀ ଜୀବନଯାପନ ହେଉଛି ପ୍ରକୃତ ପଥ।"}},{"id":"","order":20,"type":"text","markdown":"Sirjon dular ge abo sanam hor jiwi re doho lakti kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱚᱱ ᱫᱩᱞᱟᱹᱲ ᱜᱮ ᱟᱵᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱚᱦᱚ ᱞᱟᱹᱠᱛᱤ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Sirjon dular ge abo sanam hor jiwi re doho lakti kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_1_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিরজন দুলাড় গে আব সানাম হড় জিওয়ি রে দহ লাকতি কানা।","textHindi":"सिरजन दुलाड़ गे आब सानाम हड़ जिवि रे दह लाकति काना।","textOdia":"ସିରଜନ ଦୁଲାଡ଼ ଗେ ଆବ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ଜିୱି ରେ ଦହ ଲାକତି କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"It is necessary for all of us to keep love for nature in our lives.","pronunciation":"Sirjon dular ge abo sanam hor jiwi re doho lakti kana.","meaning_en":"It is necessary for all of us to keep love for nature in our lives.","meaning_bn":"আমাদের জীবনে প্রকৃতির প্রতি ভালবাসা রাখা আমাদের সকলের প্রয়োজন।","meaning_hi":"हम सभी को अपने जीवन में प्रकृति के प्रति प्रेम रखना आवश्यक है।","meaning_or":"ଆମ ଜୀବନରେ ପ୍ରକୃତି ପ୍ରତି ପ୍ରେମ ରଖିବା ଆମ ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କ ପାଇଁ ଆବଶ୍ୟକ |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, category_id, title_ol_chiki, title_latin, lesson_type, order_index, raw_json) VALUES ('lesson_sentences_folk_2', 'cat_sentences_1778594024495', 'ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱵᱮᱱᱛᱟ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱒', 'Cultural Proverbs & Wisdom II', NULL, 0, '{"id":"lesson_sentences_folk_2","categoryId":"cat_sentences_1778594024495","titleOlChiki":"ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱵᱮᱱᱛᱟ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱒","titleLatin":"Cultural Proverbs & Wisdom II","level":"beginner","orderIndex":0,"isActive":true,"estimatedMinutes":5,"description":"","thumbnailUrl":null,"isPremium":false,"audioUrl":null,"blocks":[{"id":"","order":0,"type":"text","markdown":"Ot hasa do abowaag janam ayo kana, ona do sarhaw me.","textOlChiki":"ᱚᱛ ᱦᱟᱥᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟᱜ ᱡᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱟᱭᱳ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱚᱱᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱨᱦᱟᱣ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Ot hasa do abowaag janam ayo kana, ona do sarhaw me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"অত হাসা দ আবওয়াঃ  জানাম আয়ো কানা, অনা দ সারহাওয় মে।","textHindi":"अत हासा द आबवाग जानाम आयो काना, अना द सारहाव मे।","textOdia":"ଅତ ହାସା ଦ ଆବୱାଗ ଜାନାମ ଆୟୋ କାନା, ଅନା ଦ ସାରହାୱ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"A gentle Santhal mother smiling warmly as she helps Olitun adjust a neat shoulder bag. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Land and soil are our birth mother; appreciate them.","pronunciation":"Ot hasa do abowaag janam ayo kana, ona do sarhaw me.","meaning_en":"Land and soil are our birth mother; appreciate them.","meaning_bn":"মাটি ও জমি আমাদের জন্মদাত্রী মা; তাকে শ্রদ্ধা করো।","meaning_hi":"धरती और मिट्टी हमारी जन्मदात्री माँ हैं; उनका सम्मान करो।","meaning_or":"ମାଟି ଓ ଜମି ଆମର ଜନ୍ମଦାତ୍ରୀ ମାଆ; ତାଙ୍କୁ ସମ୍ମାନ କର।"}},{"id":"","order":1,"type":"text","markdown":"Bir jibjiyali ko banchaw do bir reyag sabha kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱤᱨ ᱡᱤᱵᱽᱡᱤᱭᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱠᱚ ᱵᱟᱧᱪᱟᱣ ᱫᱚ ᱵᱤᱨ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱥᱚᱵᱷᱟ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Bir jibjiyali ko banchaw do bir reyag sabha kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বির জানওয়ার ক বাঞচাওয় দ বির রেয়াঃ শোভা কানা।","textHindi":"बिर जिबजियालि क बाञचाव द बिर रेयाग सभा काना।","textOdia":"ବିର ଜିବଜିୟାଲି କ ବାଞଚାୱ ଦ ବିର ରେୟାଗ ସଭା କାନା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Protecting wild beasts is the beauty of the forest.","pronunciation":"Bir jibjiyali ko banchaw do bir reyag sabha kana.","meaning_en":"Protecting wild beasts is the beauty of the forest.","meaning_bn":"বন্যপ্রাণী রক্ষা করাই বনের শোভা।","meaning_hi":"वन्य जीवों की रक्षा करना जंगल की सुंदरता है।","meaning_or":"ବନ୍ୟଜନ୍ତୁଙ୍କୁ ରକ୍ଷା କରିବା ଜଙ୍ଗଲର ଶୋଭା।"}},{"id":"","order":2,"type":"text","markdown":"Sagun sakam te atu hor ko nawa sagun ko njama.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱥᱟᱠᱟᱢ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱱᱟᱶᱟ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱠᱚ ᱧᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Sagun sakam te atu hor ko nawa sagun ko njama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সাগুন সাকাম তে আতু হড় ক নাওয়া সাগুন ক ঞামা।","textHindi":"सागुन साकाम ते आतु हड़ क नावा सागुन क ञामा।","textOdia":"ସାଗୁନ ସାକାମ ତେ ଆତୁ ହଡ଼ କ ନାୱା ସାଗୁନ କ ଞାମା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun collecting fallen autumn leaves in a basket, helping to clean the yard with a smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Through the auspicious leaf, the villagers receive new good omens.","pronunciation":"Sagun sakam te atu hor ko nawa sagun ko njama.","meaning_en":"Through the auspicious leaf, the villagers receive new good omens.","meaning_bn":"মঙ্গল পত্রের মাধ্যমে গ্রামবাসীরা শুভ সূচনা লাভ করেন।","meaning_hi":"शुभ पत्ते के माध्यम से ग्रामीणों को नए शुभ संकेत मिलते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଶୁଭ ପତ୍ର ମାଧ୍ୟମରେ ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀ ନୂତନ ଶୁଭ ସଂକେତ ପାଆନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":3,"type":"text","markdown":"Manmi geyan te nowa dharti adi napay te chalag kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱟᱹᱱᱢᱤ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱛᱮ ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱫᱷᱟᱹᱨᱛᱤ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Manmi geyan te nowa dharti adi napay te chalag kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মানমি গেয়ান তে নোওয়া ধারতি আডি নাপায় তে চালাগ কানা।","textHindi":"मानमि गेयान ते नोवा धारति आडि नापाय ते चालाग काना।","textOdia":"ମାନମି ଗେୟାନ ତେ ନୋୱା ଧାରତି ଆଡି ନାପାୟ ତେ ଚାଲାଗ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate holding a handful of rich, dark soil, ready to plant seeds, looking hopeful and proud. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"With human wisdom, this earth functions very beautifully.","pronunciation":"Manmi geyan te nowa dharti adi napay te chalag kana.","meaning_en":"With human wisdom, this earth functions very beautifully.","meaning_bn":"মানুষের জ্ঞানে এই পৃথিবী খুব সুন্দরভাবে চলছে।","meaning_hi":"मानवीय बुद्धि से यह पृथ्वी बहुत सुन्दरता से कार्य करती है।","meaning_or":"ମାନବୀୟ ଜ୍ଞାନ ସହିତ, ଏହି ପୃଥିବୀ ଅତି ସୁନ୍ଦର ଭାବରେ କାର୍ଯ୍ୟ କରେ |"}},{"id":"","order":4,"type":"text","markdown":"Barij katha ar uihor ko do mone khon kota gidi kag me.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱟᱹᱲᱤᱡ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱟᱨ ᱩᱭᱦᱟᱹᱨ ᱠᱚ ᱫᱚ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱠᱚᱴᱟ ᱜᱤᱰᱤ ᱠᱟᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Barij katha ar uihor ko do mone khon kota gidi kag me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গজ গিডি লেকা বাড়িজ কাথা দ মনে খন গিডি কাঃ মে।","textHindi":"बाड़िज काथा आर उयहार क द मने खन कटा गिडि काग मे।","textOdia":"ବାଡ଼ିଜ କାଥା ଆର ଉୟହାର କ ଦ ମନେ ଖନ କଟା ଗିଡି କାଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Throw away bad words and bad thoughts from your mind.","pronunciation":"Barij katha ar uihor ko do mone khon kota gidi kag me.","meaning_en":"Throw away bad words and bad thoughts from your mind.","meaning_bn":"খারাপ কথা আর খারাপ চিন্তাগুলো মন থেকে ঝেড়ে ফেলে দাও।","meaning_hi":"बुरी बातों और बुरे विचारों को मन से निकाल फेंक दो।","meaning_or":"ଖରାପ କଥା ଓ ଖରାପ ଚିନ୍ତାଧାରାକୁ ମନରୁ ଫୋପାଡ଼ି ଦିଅ।"}},{"id":"","order":5,"type":"text","markdown":"Jiwi tol kate jahay kamiya, uni do jitkarog geyay.","textOlChiki":"ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱛᱚᱞ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱸᱭ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤᱭᱟ, ᱩᱱᱤ ᱫᱚ ᱡᱤᱛᱠᱟᱹᱨᱚᱜ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱭ।","textLatin":"Jiwi tol kate jahay kamiya, uni do jitkarog geyay.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"জিওয়ি তল কাতে জাহাঁয় কামিয়া, উনি দ জিতকারঃ গেয়ায়।","textHindi":"जिवि तल काते जाहाँय कामिया, उनि द जितकारग गेयाय।","textOdia":"ଜିୱି ତଲ କାତେ ଜାହାଁୟ କାମିୟା, ଉନି ଦ ଜିତକାରଗ ଗେୟାୟ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Whoever works with dedicated soul is victorious.","pronunciation":"Jiwi tol kate jahay kamiya, uni do jitkarog geyay.","meaning_en":"Whoever works with dedicated soul is victorious.","meaning_bn":"যে নিবেদিত প্রাণ নিয়ে কাজ করে সে বিজয়ী হবেই। ।","meaning_hi":"जो समर्पित भाव से कार्य करता है वह विजयी होता है।","meaning_or":"ଯିଏ ଉତ୍ସର୍ଗୀକୃତ ଆତ୍ମା ​​ସହିତ କାମ କରେ ସେ ବିଜୟୀ ହୁଏ |"}},{"id":"","order":6,"type":"text","markdown":"Mone thay kate amag geyan hor re lahag me.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱛᱷᱟᱹᱭ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱦᱚᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱞᱟᱦᱟᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Mone thay kate amag geyan hor re lahag me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মনে থায় কাতে আমাঃ গেয়ান হর রে লাহাঃ মে।","textHindi":"मने थाय काते आमाग गेयान हर रे लाहाग मे।","textOdia":"ମନେ ଥାୟ କାତେ ଆମାଗ ଗେୟାନ ହର ରେ ଲାହାଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Advance on your path of knowledge with a firm decision.","pronunciation":"Mone thay kate amag geyan hor re lahag me.","meaning_en":"Advance on your path of knowledge with a firm decision.","meaning_bn":"দৃঢ় সিদ্ধান্ত নিয়ে আপনার জ্ঞানের পথে অগ্রসর হোন।","meaning_hi":"दृढ़ निर्णय के साथ अपने ज्ञान पथ पर आगे बढ़ें।","meaning_or":"ଏକ ଦୃ firm ନିଷ୍ପତ୍ତି ସହିତ ତୁମର ଜ୍ଞାନ ପଥରେ ଅଗ୍ରଗତି |"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Michha katha hor alom ere kowa, sari katha ror me.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱤᱪᱷᱟᱹ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱛᱮ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱟᱞᱚᱢ ᱮᱲᱮ ᱠᱚᱭᱟ, ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱜᱮ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Michha katha hor alom ere kowa, sari katha ror me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মিছা কাথা তে হড় ক আলম এড়ে কয়া, সারি কাথা গে রড় মে।","textHindi":"मिछा काथा ते हड़ क आलम एड़े कया, सारि काथा गे रड़ मे।","textOdia":"ମିଛା କାଥା ତେ ହଡ଼ କ ଆଲମ ଏଡ଼େ କୟା, ସାରି କାଥା ଗେ ରଡ଼ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate standing tall on a hill overlooking the village, looking forward with strong resolution. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Do not deceive people with false promises; speak the truth.","pronunciation":"Michha katha hor alom ere kowa, sari katha ror me.","meaning_en":"Do not deceive people with false promises; speak the truth.","meaning_bn":"মিথ্যা প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়ে মানুষকে প্রতারিত করবেন না; সত্য কথা বল","meaning_hi":"झूठे वादों से लोगों को धोखा मत दो; सच्चाई बयां करो।","meaning_or":"ମିଥ୍ୟା ପ୍ରତିଜ୍ଞା ସହିତ ଲୋକଙ୍କୁ ପ୍ରତାରଣା କର ନାହିଁ; ସତ କୁହ।"}},{"id":"","order":8,"type":"text","markdown":"Mu te rakab leka rangaw do mone barijai, sant tahen me.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱩ ᱛᱮ ᱨᱟᱠᱟᱵ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱨᱟᱸᱜᱟᱣ ᱫᱚ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱵᱟᱹᱲᱤᱡᱟᱭ, ᱥᱟᱱᱛ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸᱱ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Mu te rakab leka rangaw do mone barijai, sant tahen me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মু তে রাকাব লেকা রাঁগাওয় দ মনে বাড়িজায়, সানত তাহেঁন মে।","textHindi":"मु ते राकाब लेका राँगाव द मने बाड़िजाय, सानत ताहेँन मे।","textOdia":"ମୁ ତେ ରାକାବ ଲେକା ରାଁଗାୱ ଦ ମନେ ବାଡ଼ିଜାୟ, ସାନତ ତାହେଁନ ମେ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Excessive anger is bad for the mind, stay calm.","pronunciation":"Mu te rakab leka rangaw do mone barijai, sant tahen me.","meaning_en":"Excessive anger is bad for the mind, stay calm.","meaning_bn":"অতিরিক্ত রাগ মনের জন্য খারাপ,  শান্ত থাকুন।","meaning_hi":"अत्यधिक गुस्सा मन के लिए हानिकारक है, शांत रहिए।","meaning_or":"ଅତ୍ୟଧିକ ରାଗ ମନ ପାଇଁ ଖରାପ, ଶାନ୍ତ ରୁହନ୍ତୁ।"}},{"id":"","order":9,"type":"text","markdown":"Dhiri leka mone do alom keteja, daya dohoy me.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱷᱤᱨᱤ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱞᱚᱢ ᱠᱮᱴᱮᱡᱟ, ᱫᱟᱭᱟ ᱫᱚᱦᱚᱭ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Dhiri leka mone do alom keteja, daya dohoy me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ধিরি লেকা মনে দ আলম কেটেজা, দায়া দহয় মে।","textHindi":"धिरि लेका मने द आलम केटेजा, दाया दहय मे।","textOdia":"ଧିରି ଲେକା ମନେ ଦ ଆଲମ କେଟେଜା, ଦାୟା ଦହୟ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Do not harden your heart like a stone; keep kindness.","pronunciation":"Dhiri leka mone do alom keteja, daya dohoy me.","meaning_en":"Do not harden your heart like a stone; keep kindness.","meaning_bn":"তোমার হৃদয়কে পাথরের মত শক্ত করো না; দয়া রাখো।","meaning_hi":"पत्थर की तरह मन को कठोर मत बनाओ, दया बनाए रखो।","meaning_or":"ପଥର ଭଳି ମନକୁ କଠୋର କରନ୍ତୁ ନାହିଁ, ଦୟା ରଖନ୍ତୁ।"}},{"id":"","order":10,"type":"text","markdown":"Bir dare leka abo sanam hor ketej tahen lakti kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱵᱤᱨ ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱟᱵᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱮᱴᱮᱡ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸᱱ ᱞᱟᱹᱠᱛᱤ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Bir dare leka abo sanam hor ketej tahen lakti kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"বির দারে লেকা আব সানাম হড় কেটেজ তাহেঁন লাকতি কানা।","textHindi":"बिर दारे लेका आब सानाम हड़ केटेज ताहेँन लाकति काना।","textOdia":"ବିର ଦାରେ ଲେକା ଆବ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ କେଟେଜ ତାହେଁନ ଲାକତି କାନା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Like forest trees, we all need to stand strong.","pronunciation":"Bir dare leka abo sanam hor ketej tahen lakti kana.","meaning_en":"Like forest trees, we all need to stand strong.","meaning_bn":"বনের গাছের মতো আমাদের সবাইকে শক্ত হয়ে দাঁড়াতে হবে।","meaning_hi":"जंगल के पेड़ों की तरह, हम सभी को मजबूत खड़े होने की जरूरत है।","meaning_or":"ଜଙ୍ଗଲ ଗଛ ପରି, ଆମ ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କୁ ଦୃ strong ଼ ଭାବରେ ଠିଆ ହେବା ଆବଶ୍ୟକ |"}},{"id":"","order":11,"type":"text","markdown":"Hasa orag re tahen rehon, mone do sona leka dohoy me.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱟᱥᱟ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱨᱮ ᱛᱟᱹᱦᱮᱱ ᱨᱮᱦᱚᱸ, ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱚᱱᱟ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱫᱚᱦᱚᱭ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Hasa orag re tahen rehon, mone do sona leka dohoy me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হাসা অড়াঃ রে তাহেন রেহঁ, মনে দ সনা লেকা দহয় মে।","textHindi":"हासा अड़ाग रे ताहेन रेहँ, मने द सना लेका दहय मे।","textOdia":"ହାସା ଅଡ଼ାଗ ରେ ତାହେନ ରେହଁ, ମନେ ଦ ସନା ଲେକା ଦହୟ ମେ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate works with rich brown clay, sculpting a small toy pot with focused, creative hands. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Even though living in a mud house, keep the heart like gold.","pronunciation":"Hasa orag re tahen rehon, mone do sona leka dohoy me.","meaning_en":"Even though living in a mud house, keep the heart like gold.","meaning_bn":"মাটির ঘরে বাস করেও মনটা সোনার মত রাখো।","meaning_hi":"मिट्टी के घर में रहते हुए भी, दिल को सोने जैसा रखो।","meaning_or":"କାଦୁଅ ଘରେ ରହୁଥିଲେ ମଧ୍ୟ ହୃଦୟକୁ ସୁନା ପରି ରଖ |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Serma ipil leka amag jiwi do sanam hor geyan e ema kowa.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱮᱨᱢᱟ ᱤᱯᱤᱞ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱮ ᱮᱢᱟ ᱠᱚᱣᱟ।","textLatin":"Serma ipil leka amag jiwi do sanam hor geyan e ema kowa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সেরমা ইপিল লেকা আমাগ জিওয়ি দ সানাম হড় গেয়ান এ এমা কওয়া।","textHindi":"सेरमा इपिल लेका आमाग जिवि द सानाम हड़ गेयान ए एमा कवा।","textOdia":"ସେରମା ଇପିଲ ଲେକା ଆମାଗ ଜିୱି ଦ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ଗେୟାନ ଏ ଏମା କୱା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun lying on a straw mat under a clear night sky, pointing at a shooting star in wonder. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Like stars, let your life give knowledge to everyone.","pronunciation":"Serma ipil leka amag jiwi do sanam hor geyan e ema kowa.","meaning_en":"Like stars, let your life give knowledge to everyone.","meaning_bn":"স্বর্গীয় নক্ষত্রের মতো, আপনার জীবন সবাইকে জ্ঞান দিতে দিন।","meaning_hi":"सितारों की तरह, आपका जीवन हर किसी को ज्ञान दे।","meaning_or":"ତାରା ପରି, ତୁମ ଜୀବନ ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କୁ ଜ୍ଞାନ ଦେଉ।"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Njida umul leka barij okto ho mid din paromog geya.","textOlChiki":"ᱧᱤᱫᱟᱹ ᱩᱢᱩᱞ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱵᱟᱹᱲᱤᱡ ᱚᱠᱛᱚ ᱦᱚᱸ ᱢᱤᱫ ᱫᱤᱱ ᱯᱟᱨᱚᱢᱚᱜ ᱜᱮᱭᱟ।","textLatin":"Njida umul leka barij okto ho mid din paromog geya.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"ঞিদা উমুল লেকা বাড়িজ অকত হঁ মিদ দিন পারমঃ গেয়া।","textHindi":"ञिदा उमुल लेका बाड़िज अकत हँ मिद दिन पारमग गेया।","textOdia":"ଞିଦା ଉମୁଲ ଲେକା ବାଡ଼ିଜ ଅକତ ହଁ ମିଦ ଦିନ ପାରମଗ ଗେୟା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Like the night shadow, bad times will also pass one day.","pronunciation":"Njida umul leka barij okto ho mid din paromog geya.","meaning_en":"Like the night shadow, bad times will also pass one day.","meaning_bn":"রাতের ছায়ার মতো খারাপ সময়ও একদিন কেটে যাবে।","meaning_hi":"रात के साये की तरह बुरा वक्त भी एक दिन गुजर जायेगा।","meaning_or":"ରାତିର ଛାୟା ପରି ଖରାପ ସମୟ ମଧ୍ୟ ଗୋଟିଏ ଦିନ ଅତିକ୍ରମ କରିବ |"}},{"id":"","order":14,"type":"text","markdown":"Singe situng re kami kate hon atu hor do ko landaya.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱸᱜᱮ ᱥᱤᱛᱩᱝ ᱨᱮ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱦᱚᱸ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱫᱚ ᱠᱚ ᱞᱟᱸᱫᱟᱭᱟ।","textLatin":"Singe situng re kami kate hon atu hor do ko landaya.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিঁগে সিতুং রে কামি কাতে হঁ আতু হড় দ ক লাঁদায়া।","textHindi":"सिँगे सितुङ रे कामि काते हँ आतु हड़ द क लाँदाया।","textOdia":"ସିଁଗେ ସିତୁଙ ରେ କାମି କାତେ ହଁ ଆତୁ ହଡ଼ ଦ କ ଲାଁଦାୟା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun looking up at the warm morning sun rising over the hills, eyes filled with hope. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Even working in the scorching sun, the villagers laugh.","pronunciation":"Singe situng re kami kate hon atu hor do ko landaya.","meaning_en":"Even working in the scorching sun, the villagers laugh.","meaning_bn":"প্রখর রোদে কাজ করেও গ্রামবাসীরা হাসে।","meaning_hi":"चिलचिलाती धूप में भी काम करते हुए ग्रामीण हंसते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଏପରିକି ଖରାଦିନେ କାମ କରି ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀ ହସନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"Rimil dag te ot hasa do adi napay te lohodog aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱨᱤᱢᱤᱞ ᱫᱟᱜ ᱛᱮ ᱚᱛ ᱦᱟᱥᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱞᱚᱦᱚᱫᱚᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Rimil dag te ot hasa do adi napay te lohodog aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"রিমিল দাঃ তে অত হাসা দ আডি নাপায় তে লহদগআ।","textHindi":"रिमिल दाग ते अत हासा द आडि नापाय ते लहदग आ।","textOdia":"ରିମିଲ ଦାଗ ତେ ଅତ ହାସା ଦ ଆଡି ନାପାୟ ତେ ଲହଦଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate standing under a shelter, watching fresh raindrops fall on green leaves, smiling with curiosity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"With  rain, the soil gets beautifully soaked.","pronunciation":"Rimil dag te ot hasa do adi napay te lohodog aa.","meaning_en":"With  rain, the soil gets beautifully soaked.","meaning_bn":"বৃষ্টিতে মাটি সুন্দরভাবে ভিজে যায়।","meaning_hi":"बारिश से ज़मीन बहुत अच्छे से गीली हो जाती है।","meaning_or":"ବର୍ଷା ଯୋଗୁଁ ମାଟି ବହୁତ ଭଲ ଭାବରେ ଓଦା ହୋଇଯାଏ।"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Hormo re sari mone doho ge sari manmiyag uprum.","textOlChiki":"ᱦᱚᱲᱢᱚ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱫᱚᱦᱚ ᱜᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱢᱟᱹᱱᱢᱤᱭᱟᱜ ᱩᱯᱨᱩᱢ।","textLatin":"Hormo re sari mone doho ge sari manmiyag uprum.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"হড়ম রে সারি মনে দহ গে সারি মানমিয়াঃ উপরুম।","textHindi":"हड़म रे सारि मने दह गे सारि मानमियाग उपरुम।","textOdia":"ହଡ଼ମ ରେ ସାରି ମନେ ଦହ ଗେ ସାରି ମାନମିୟାଗ ଉପରୁମ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Keeping a true heart within is the identity of a true human.","pronunciation":"Hormo re sari mone doho ge sari manmiyag uprum.","meaning_en":"Keeping a true heart within is the identity of a true human.","meaning_bn":"মানবদেহে সৎ হৃদয় রাখাই প্রকৃত মানুষের পরিচয়।","meaning_hi":"शरीर में सच्चा मन रखना ही सच्चे इंसान की पहचान है।","meaning_or":"ଶରୀରରେ ସତ୍ୟ ମନ ରଖିବା ହିଁ ସତ୍ୟ ମଣିଷର ପରିଚୟ।"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Sibil sagay te atu rin sanam hor jumid menag kowa.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱵᱤᱞ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱟᱹᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱤᱱ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱡᱩᱢᱤᱫᱽ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜ ᱠᱚᱣᱟ।","textLatin":"Sibil sagay te atu rin sanam hor jumid menag kowa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিবিল সাগায় তে আতু রিন সানাম হড় জুমিদ মেনাঃ কওয়া।","textHindi":"सिबिल सागाय ते आतु रिन सानाम हड़ जुमिद मेनाग कवा।","textOdia":"ସିବିଲ ସାଗାୟ ତେ ଆତୁ ରିନ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ଜୁମିଦ ମେନାଗ କୱା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"All the villagers are united with affectionate bonding.","pronunciation":"Sibil sagay te atu rin sanam hor jumid menag kowa.","meaning_en":"All the villagers are united with affectionate bonding.","meaning_bn":"সকল গ্রামবাসী স্নেহের বন্ধনে ঐক্যবদ্ধ।","meaning_hi":"सभी ग्रामवासी स्नेहपूर्ण बंधन में बंधे हुए हैं।","meaning_or":"ସମସ୍ତ ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀ ସ୍ନେହପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ବନ୍ଧନରେ ଏକତ୍ରିତ ହୋଇଛନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":18,"type":"text","markdown":"Mone ketej kate amag jiwi reyag larhay re jitkarog me.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱠᱮᱴᱮᱡ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱞᱟᱹᱲᱦᱟᱹᱭ ᱨᱮ ᱡᱤᱛᱠᱟᱹᱨᱚᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Mone ketej kate amag jiwi reyag larhay re jitkarog me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মনে কেটেজ কাতে আমাঃ জিওয়ি রেয়াঃ লাড়হায় রে জিতকারঃ মে।","textHindi":"मने केटेज काते आमाग जिवि रेयाग लाड़हाय रे जितकारग मे।","textOdia":"ମନେ କେଟେଜ କାତେ ଆମାଗ ଜିୱି ରେୟାଗ ଲାଡ଼ହାୟ ରେ ଜିତକାରଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Win the battle of your life with a strong mind.","pronunciation":"Mone ketej kate amag jiwi reyag larhay re jitkarog me.","meaning_en":"Win the battle of your life with a strong mind.","meaning_bn":"দৃঢ় মন নিয়ে জীবনের যুদ্ধে জয়ী হও।","meaning_hi":"दृढ़  मन से अपने जीवन की लड़ाई जीतें।","meaning_or":"ଏକ ଦୃ strong ମନ ସହିତ ତୁମର ଜୀବନର ଯୁଦ୍ଧରେ ଜିତ |"}},{"id":"","order":19,"type":"text","markdown":"Dular gadi leka amag jiwi do daya te perej kag me.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱩᱞᱟᱹᱲ ᱜᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱫᱚ ᱫᱟᱭᱟ ᱛᱮ ᱯᱮᱨᱮᱡ ᱠᱟᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Dular gadi leka amag jiwi do daya te perej kag me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দুলাড় গাডি লেকা আমাঃ জিওয়ি দ দায়া তে পেরেজ কাঃ মে।","textHindi":"दुलाड़ गाडि लेका आमाग जिवि द दाया ते पेरेज काग मे।","textOdia":"ଦୁଲାଡ଼ ଗାଡି ଲେକା ଆମାଗ ଜିୱି ଦ ଦାୟା ତେ ପେରେଜ କାଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Like a cart of love, fill your life with kindness.","pronunciation":"Dular gadi leka amag jiwi do daya te perej kag me.","meaning_en":"Like a cart of love, fill your life with kindness.","meaning_bn":"প্রেমের বাহনের মতো, আপনার জীবনকে দয়ায় পূর্ণ করুন।","meaning_hi":"प्रेम के वाहन की तरह, अपने जीवन को दयालुता से भरें।","meaning_or":"ପ୍ରେମର ଯାନ ପରି, ତୁମ ଜୀବନକୁ ଦୟା ରେ ପରିପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ କର |"}},{"id":"","order":20,"type":"text","markdown":"Sari guru waag geyan do abo sanam hor sari hor e udug abowa.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱜᱩᱨᱩ ᱟᱜ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱵᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱦᱚᱨ ᱮ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟ।","textLatin":"Sari guru waag geyan do abo sanam hor sari hor e udug abowa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সারি গুরু ওয়াঃ গেয়ান দ আব সানাম হড় সারি হর এ উদুঃ আবওয়া।","textHindi":"सारि गुरु वाग गेयान द आब सानाम हड़ सारि हर ए उदुग आबवा।","textOdia":"ସାରି ଗୁରୁ ୱାଗ ଗେୟାନ ଦ ଆବ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ସାରି ହର ଏ ଉଦୁଗ ଆବୱା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun standing tall on a hill overlooking the village, looking forward with strong resolution. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"The true teacher''s knowledge shows all of us the path of truth.","pronunciation":"Sari guru waag geyan do abo sanam hor sari hor e udug abowa.","meaning_en":"The true teacher''s knowledge shows all of us the path of truth.","meaning_bn":"প্রকৃত শিক্ষকের জ্ঞান আমাদের সকলকে সত্যের পথ দেখায়।","meaning_hi":"सच्चे शिक्षक का ज्ञान हम सभी को सत्य का मार्ग दिखाता है।","meaning_or":"ପ୍ରକୃତ ଶିକ୍ଷକଙ୍କ ଜ୍ଞାନ ଆମ ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କୁ ସତ୍ୟର ପଥ ଦେଖାଏ |"}},{"id":"","order":21,"type":"text","markdown":"Geyan dorya re dubuj kate sari manik em njam dareyag aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱫᱚᱨᱭᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱰᱩᱵᱩᱡ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱢᱟᱹᱱᱤᱠ ᱮᱢ ᱧᱟᱢ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Geyan dorya re dubuj kate sari manik em njam dareyag aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_2_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গেয়ান দরয়া রে ডুবুজ কাতে সারি মানিক এম ঞাম দাড়েয়াঃ আ।","textHindi":"गेयान दरया रे डुबुज काते सारि मानिक एम ञाम दाड़ेयाग आ।","textOdia":"ଗେୟାନ ଦରୟା ରେ ଡୁବୁଜ କାତେ ସାରି ମାନିକ ଏମ ଞାମ ଦାଡ଼େୟାଗଆ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"By diving into the ocean of knowledge, you can find the true pearl.","pronunciation":"Geyan dorya re dubuj kate sari manik em njam dareyag aa.","meaning_en":"By diving into the ocean of knowledge, you can find the true pearl.","meaning_bn":"জ্ঞানের সাগরে ডুব দিয়ে প্রকৃত মুক্তার সন্ধান পাওয়া যায়।","meaning_hi":"ज्ञान के सागर में गोता लगाकर ही सच्चा मोती पाया जा सकता है।","meaning_or":"ଜ୍ knowledge ାନର ସମୁଦ୍ରରେ ବୁଲିବା ଦ୍ୱାରା ଆପଣ ପ୍ରକୃତ ମୋତି ପାଇପାରିବେ |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, category_id, title_ol_chiki, title_latin, lesson_type, order_index, raw_json) VALUES ('lesson_sentences_folk_3', 'cat_sentences_1778594024495', 'ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱵᱮᱱᱛᱟ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱓', 'Cultural Proverbs & Wisdom III', NULL, 0, '{"id":"lesson_sentences_folk_3","categoryId":"cat_sentences_1778594024495","titleOlChiki":"ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱵᱮᱱᱛᱟ ᱣᱟᱠᱭ ᱓","titleLatin":"Cultural Proverbs & Wisdom III","level":"beginner","orderIndex":0,"isActive":true,"estimatedMinutes":5,"description":"","thumbnailUrl":null,"isPremium":false,"audioUrl":null,"blocks":[{"id":"","order":0,"type":"text","markdown":"Lakchar hor te chalag ge Santal hopon aag man kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱞᱟᱠᱪᱟᱨ ᱦᱚᱨ ᱛᱮ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱜ ᱜᱮ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲ ᱦᱚᱯᱚᱱ ᱟᱜ ᱢᱟᱹᱱ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Lakchar hor te chalag ge Santal hopon aag man kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_0/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"লাকচার হর তে চালাঃ গে সানতাড় হপনাঃ মান কানা।","textHindi":"लाकचार हर ते चालाग गे सानताड़ हपन आग मान काना।","textOdia":"ଲାକଚାର ହର ତେ ଚାଲାଗ ଗେ ସାନତାଡ଼ ହପନ ଆଗ ମାନ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Going on the cultural path is the honor of the Santal people.","pronunciation":"Lakchar hor te chalag ge Santal hoponag man kana.","meaning_en":"Going on the cultural path is the honor of the Santal people.","meaning_bn":"সংস্কৃতির পথে চলা সাঁওতাল জাতির গৌরব।","meaning_hi":"संस्कृति के मार्ग पर चलना संताल समाज का गौरव है।","meaning_or":"ସଂସ୍କୃତିର ବାଟରେ ଚାଲିବା ସାନ୍ତାଳ ଜାତିର ଗୌରବ।"}},{"id":"","order":1,"type":"text","markdown":"Ari sari te jiwi khandaw ge dhorom kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱛᱮ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱠᱷᱟᱸᱰᱟᱣ ᱜᱮ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Ari sari te jiwi khandaw ge dhorom kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_1/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আরি সারি তে জিওয়ি খাঁডাওয় গে ধরম কানা।","textHindi":"आरि सारि ते जिवि खाँडाव गे धरम काना।","textOdia":"ଆରି ସାରି ତେ ଜିୱି ଖାଁଡାୱ ଗେ ଧରମ କାନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate pointing toward a balanced, hand-carved wooden scale, indicating fairness and justice. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Living life with pure traditions is righteousness.","pronunciation":"Ari sari te jiwi khandaw ge dhorom kana.","meaning_en":"Living life with pure traditions is righteousness.","meaning_bn":"পবিত্র পরম্পরা অনুসারে জীবনযাপন করাই প্রকৃত ধর্ম।","meaning_hi":"पवित्र परंपराओं के अनुसार जीवन जीना ही धर्म है।","meaning_or":"ପବିତ୍ର ପରମ୍ପରା ଅନୁଯାୟୀ ଜୀବନ ବିତାଇବା ହିଁ ଧର୍ମ।"}},{"id":"","order":2,"type":"text","markdown":"Sawhed do jiwi kana, onate Santali sawhed do banchao dohoy me.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱶᱦᱮᱫ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱚᱱᱟᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱟᱲᱤ ᱥᱟᱶᱦᱮᱫ ᱫᱚ ᱵᱟᱧᱪᱟᱣ ᱫᱚᱦᱚᱭ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Sawhed do jiwi kana, onate Santali sawhed do banchao dohoy me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_2/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সাওয়হেদ দ জিওয়ি কানা, অনাতে সানতাড়ি সাওয়হেদ দ বাঞচাও দহয় মে।","textHindi":"सावहेद जिवि काना, अनाते सानताड़ि सावहेद द बाञचाव दहय मे।","textOdia":"ସାୱହେଦ ଜିୱି କାନା, ଅନାତେ ସାନତାଡ଼ି ସାୱହେଦ ଦ ବାଞଚାୱ ଦହୟ ମେ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Literature is the soul, therefore preserve Santali literature.","pronunciation":"Sawhed do jiwi kana, onate Santali sawhed do banchao dohoy me.","meaning_en":"Literature is the soul, therefore preserve Santali literature.","meaning_bn":"সাহিত্যই হলো আত্মা, তাই সাঁওতালি সাহিত্য রক্ষা করো।","meaning_hi":"साहित्य ही आत्मा है, इसलिए संताली साहित्य का संरक्षण करो।","meaning_or":"ସାହିତ୍ୟ ହିଁ ଆତ୍ମା, ତେଣୁ ସାନ୍ତାଳୀ ସାହିତ୍ୟର ସୁରକ୍ଷା କର।"}},{"id":"","order":3,"type":"text","markdown":"Sirjon dhorom lekate dare ar jibjiyali ko dular ko me.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱚᱱ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱫᱟᱨᱮ ᱟᱨ ᱡᱤᱵᱽᱡᱤᱭᱟᱹᱞᱤ ᱠᱚ ᱫᱩᱞᱟᱹᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Sirjon dhorom lekate dare ar jibjiyali ko dular ko me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_3/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিরজন ধরম লেকাতে দারে আর জিবজিয়ালি ক দুলাড় ক মে।","textHindi":"सिरजन धरम लेकाते दारे आर जिबजियालि क दुलाड़ क मे।","textOdia":"ସିରଜନ ଧରମ ଲେକାତେ ଦାରେ ଆର ଜିବଜିୟାଲି କ ଦୁଲାଡ଼ କ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"According to the religion of nature, love the trees and animals.","pronunciation":"Sirjon dhorom lekate dare ar jibjiyali ko dular ko me.","meaning_en":"According to the religion of nature, love the trees and animals.","meaning_bn":"প্রকৃতির ধর্ম অনুযায়ী বৃক্ষ ও প্রাণীকে ভালোবাসুন।","meaning_hi":"प्रकृति धर्म के अनुसार पेड़-पौधों और जानवरों से प्रेम करें।","meaning_or":"ପ୍ରକୃତିର ଧର୍ମ ଅନୁଯାୟୀ, ଗଛ ଏବଂ ପଶୁମାନଙ୍କୁ ଭଲ ପାଅ |"}},{"id":"","order":4,"type":"text","markdown":"Disom dare ge abowag marang dare kana, ona do manaw me.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱤᱥᱚᱢ ᱫᱟᱲᱮ ᱜᱮ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟᱜ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱫᱟᱲᱮ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱚᱱᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱢᱟᱱᱟᱣ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Disom dare ge abowag marang dare kana, ona do manaw me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_4/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দিসম দাড়ে গে আবওয়াঃ মারাং দাড়ে কানা, অনা দ মানাও মে।","textHindi":"दिसम दाड़े गे आबवाग माराङ दाड़े काना, अना द मानाव मे।","textOdia":"ଦିସମ ଦାଡ଼େ ଗେ ଆବୱାଗ ମାରାଙ ଦାଡ଼େ କାନା, ଅନା ଦ ମାନାୱ ମେ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"The power of the land is our great strength; respect it.","pronunciation":"Disom dare ge abowag marang dare kana, ona do manaw me.","meaning_en":"The power of the land is our great strength; respect it.","meaning_bn":"দেশের শক্তিই আমাদের বড় শক্তি; এটার সম্মান করো।","meaning_hi":"देश की शक्ति ही हमारी सबसे बड़ी शक्ति है, उसका सम्मान करो।","meaning_or":"ଦେଶର ଶକ୍ତି ହିଁ ଆମର ସବୁଠୁ ବଡ଼ ଶକ୍ତି, ତାକୁ ସମ୍ମାନ କର।"}},{"id":"","order":5,"type":"text","markdown":"Amag sagun nyutum te amag atu reyag nyutum Marshalog ma.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ ᱢᱟᱨᱥᱟᱞᱚᱜ ᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Amag sagun nyutum te amag atu reyag nyutum Marshalog ma.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_5/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ সাগুন ঞুতুম তে আমাঃ আতু রেয়াঃ ঞুতুম মারসালঃ মা।","textHindi":"आमाग सागुन ञुतुम ते आमाग आतु रेयाग ञुतुम मारसालग मा।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ସାଗୁନ ଞୁତୁମ ତେ ଆମାଗ ଆତୁ ରେୟାଗ ଞୁତୁମ ମାରସାଲଗ ମା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Let the name of your village shine with your good name.","pronunciation":"Amag sagun nyutum te amag atu reyag nyutum Marshalog ma.","meaning_en":"Let the name of your village shine with your good name.","meaning_bn":"আপনার সুনামের সাথে আপনার গ্রামের নাম উজ্জ্বল হোক।","meaning_hi":"आपके अच्छे नाम से आपके गांव का नाम रोशन हो।","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ଗାଁର ନାମ ତୁମର ଭଲ ନାମ ସହିତ ଉଜ୍ଜ୍ୱଳ ହେଉ |"}},{"id":"","order":6,"type":"text","markdown":"Manmi dhorom ge sanam khon marang dhorom kana, hor seba ko me.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱟᱹᱱᱢᱤ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱜᱮ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱦᱚᱲ ᱥᱮᱵᱟ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Manmi dhorom ge sanam khon marang dhorom kana, hor seba ko me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_6/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মানমি ধরম গে সানাম খন মারাং ধরম কানা, হড় সেবা ক মে।","textHindi":"मानमि धरम गे सानाम खन माराङ धरम काना, हड़ सेबा क मे।","textOdia":"ମାନମି ଧରମ ଗେ ସାନାମ ଖନ ମାରାଙ ଧରମ କାନା, ହଡ଼ ସେବା କ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Humanity is the greatest religion of all; serve the people.","pronunciation":"Manmi dhorom ge sanam khon marang dhorom kana, hor seba ko me.","meaning_en":"Humanity is the greatest religion of all; serve the people.","meaning_bn":"মানবতাই সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ ধর্ম; মানুষের সেবা করো।","meaning_hi":"मानवता ही सबसे बड़ा धर्म है; लोगों की सेवा करो.","meaning_or":"ମାନବିକତା ହେଉଛି ସର୍ବଶ୍ରେଷ୍ଠ ଧର୍ମ; ଲୋକଙ୍କ ସେବା କର |"}},{"id":"","order":7,"type":"text","markdown":"Amag sibil ror te atu rin sanam horag mone jitkar me.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱥᱤᱵᱤᱞ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱤᱱ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱡᱤᱛᱠᱟᱹᱨ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Amag sibil ror te atu rin sanam horag mone jitkar me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_7/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাগ সিবিল রড় তে আতু রিন সানাম হড়াঃ মনে জিতকার মে।","textHindi":"आमाग सिबिल रड़ ते आतु रिन सानाम हड़ाग मने जितकार मे।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ସିବିଲ ରଡ଼ ତେ ଆତୁ ରିନ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ାଗ ମନେ ଜିତକାର ମେ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands proudly at a crossroads in the village, pointing toward a path of opportunity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Win the hearts of all villagers with your sweet words.","pronunciation":"Amag sibil ror te atu rin sanam horag mone jitkar me.","meaning_en":"Win the hearts of all villagers with your sweet words.","meaning_bn":"আপনার মিষ্টি কথায় সমস্ত গ্রামবাসীর মন জয় করুন।","meaning_hi":"अपनी मधुर वाणी से सभी ग्रामवासियों का दिल जीतें।","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ମଧୁର ଶବ୍ଦ ସହିତ ସମସ୍ତ ଗ୍ରାମବାସୀଙ୍କ ହୃଦୟ ଜିତ |"}},{"id":"","order":8,"type":"text","markdown":"Sari mone te kami lekhan, sanam kami ge sagunog aa.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱛᱮ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱞᱮᱠᱷᱟᱱ, ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱜᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱᱚᱜ ᱼᱟ।","textLatin":"Sari mone te kami lekhan, sanam kami ge sagunog aa.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_8/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সারি মনে তে কামি লেখান, সানাম কামি গে সাগুনঃ আ।","textHindi":"सारि मने ते कामि लेखान, सानाम कामि गे सागुनग आ।","textOdia":"ସାରି ମନେ ତେ କାମି ଲେଖାନ, ସାନାମ କାମି ଗେ ସାଗୁନଗ ଆ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun looking forward toward a modern skyline in the distance, eyes filled with determination and hope. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"If worked with an honest heart, all work will be successful.","pronunciation":"Sari mone te kami lekhan, sanam kami ge sagunog aa.","meaning_en":"If worked with an honest heart, all work will be successful.","meaning_bn":"সৎ চিত্তে কাজ করলে সব কাজই সফল হবে।","meaning_hi":"सच्चे मन से काम किया जाए तो सभी काम सफल होंगे।","meaning_or":"ଯଦି ଏକ ସଚ୍ଚୋଟ ହୃଦୟ ସହିତ କାର୍ଯ୍ୟ କରାଯାଏ, ସମସ୍ତ କାର୍ଯ୍ୟ ସଫଳ ହେବ |"}},{"id":"","order":9,"type":"text","markdown":"Tehenj do ale orag re adi napay sibil jom le benaw akada.","textOlChiki":"ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱞᱮ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱥᱤᱵᱤᱞ ᱡᱚᱢ ᱞᱮ ᱵᱮᱱᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Tehenj do ale orag re adi napay sibil jom le benaw akada.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_9/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"তেহেঞ দ আলে অড়াঃ রে আডি নাপায় সিবিল জম লে বেনাও আকাদা।","textHindi":"तेहेञ द आले अड़ाग रे आडि नापाय सिबिल जम ले बेनाव आकादा।","textOdia":"ତେହେଞ ଦ ଆଲେ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ରେ ଆଡି ନାପାୟ ସିବିଲ ଜମ ଲେ ବେନାୱ ଆକାଦା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Today we have made very delicious food in our home.","pronunciation":"Tehenj do ale orag re adi napay sibil jom le benaw akada.","meaning_en":"Today we have made very delicious food in our home.","meaning_bn":"আজ আমরা আমাদের বাড়িতে খুব সুস্বাদু খাবার তৈরি করেছি।","meaning_hi":"आज हमने अपने घर में बहुत ही स्वादिष्ट खाना बनाया है.","meaning_or":"ଆଜି ଆମେ ଆମ ଘରେ ବହୁତ ସ୍ୱାଦିଷ୍ଟ ଖାଦ୍ୟ ପ୍ରସ୍ତୁତ କରିଛୁ |"}},{"id":"","order":10,"type":"text","markdown":"Amij gate kuri do itun asra re adi napay e parhaag kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱤᱡ ᱜᱟᱛᱮ ᱠᱩᱲᱤ ᱫᱚ ᱤᱛᱩᱱ ᱟᱥᱲᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱮ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Amij gate kuri do itun asra re adi napay e parhaag kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_10/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমিজ গাতে কুড়ি দ ইতুন আসড়া রে আডি নাপায় এ পাড়হাঃ কানা।","textHindi":"आमिज गाते कुड़ि द इतुन आसड़ा रे आडि नापाय ए पाड़हाग काना।","textOdia":"ଆମିଜ ଗାତେ କୁଡ଼ି ଦ ଇତୁନ ଆସଡ଼ା ରେ ଆଡି ନାପାୟ ଏ ପାଡ଼ହାଗ କାନା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun excitedly discovering knowledge inside a large, open picture book that glows with colorful patterns. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Your female friend is studying very well in school.","pronunciation":"Amij gate kuri do itun asra re adi napay e parhaag kana.","meaning_en":"Your female friend is studying very well in school.","meaning_bn":"তোমার বান্ধবীস্কুলে খুব ভালো পড়াশোনা করছে।","meaning_hi":"आपकी महिला मित्र स्कूल में बहुत अच्छी पढ़ाई कर रही है।","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ମହିଳା ବନ୍ଧୁ ବିଦ୍ୟାଳୟରେ ବହୁତ ଭଲ ଅଧ୍ୟୟନ କରୁଛନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":11,"type":"text","markdown":"Ale atu re do dinam kami kate hor ko raska te ko tahena.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱞᱮ ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱚ ᱫᱤᱱᱟᱹᱢ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱠᱚ ᱨᱟᱹᱥᱠᱟᱹ ᱛᱮ ᱠᱚ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Ale atu re do dinam kami kate hor ko raska te ko tahena.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আলে আতু রে দ দিনাম কামি কাতে হড় ক রাসকা তে ক তাহেঁনা।","textHindi":"आले आतु रे द दिनाम कामि काते हड़ क रासका ते क ताहेँना।","textOdia":"ଆଲେ ଆତୁ ରେ ଦ ଦିନାମ କାମି କାତେ ହଡ଼ କ ରାସକା ତେ କ ତାହେଁନା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands proudly at a crossroads in the village, pointing toward a path of opportunity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"In our village, people live with joy by doing daily chores.","pronunciation":"Ale atu re do dinam kami kate hor ko raska te ko tahena.","meaning_en":"In our village, people live with joy by doing daily chores.","meaning_bn":"আমাদের গ্রামে মানুষ দৈনন্দিন কাজকর্ম করে আনন্দে বসবাস করে।","meaning_hi":"हमारे गांव में लोग रोजमर्रा के काम करके आनंद से रहते हैं।","meaning_or":"ଆମ ଗାଁରେ ଲୋକମାନେ ଦ daily ନନ୍ଦିନ କାମ କରି ଆନନ୍ଦରେ ରୁହନ୍ତି |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Sagun din re am saw njapam kate in adinj raskayena.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱫᱤᱱ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱢ ᱥᱟᱶ ᱧᱟᱯᱟᱢ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱤᱧ ᱟᱹᱰᱤᱧ ᱨᱟᱹᱥᱠᱟᱹᱭᱮᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Sagun din re am saw njapam kate in adinj raskayena.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সাগুন দিন রে আম সাওয় ঞাপাম কাতে ইঞ আডিঞ রাসকায়েনা।","textHindi":"सागुन दिन रे आम साव ञापाम काते इञ आडिञ रासकायेना।","textOdia":"ସାଗୁନ ଦିନ ରେ ଆମ ସାୱ ଞାପାମ କାତେ ଇଞ ଆଡିଞ ରାସକାୟେନା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"I became very happy to meet you on this auspicious day.","pronunciation":"Sagun din re am saw njapam kate in adinj raskayena.","meaning_en":"I became very happy to meet you on this auspicious day.","meaning_bn":"এই শুভ দিনে আপনার সাথে দেখা করে আমি খুব খুশি হলাম।","meaning_hi":"इस शुभ दिन पर आपसे मिलकर मुझे बहुत खुशी हुई.","meaning_or":"ଏହି ଶୁଭ ଦିନରେ ମୁଁ ତୁମକୁ ଭେଟି ବହୁତ ଖୁସି ହେଲି |"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Amag mone rara kate sanam dukh do hirinj kag me.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱨᱟᱲᱟ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱫᱩᱠᱷ ᱫᱚ ᱦᱤᱲᱤᱧ ᱠᱟᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Amag mone rara kate sanam dukh do hirinj kag me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ মনে রাড়া কাতে সানাম দুখ দ হিড়িঞ কাঃ মে।","textHindi":"आमाग मने राड़ा काते सानाम दुख द हिड़िञ काग मे।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ମନେ ରାଡ଼ା କାତେ ସାନାମ ଦୁଖ ଦ ହିଡ଼ିଞ କାଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Relieving your heart, forget all the sorrows.","pronunciation":"Amag mone rara kate sanam dukh do hirinj kag me.","meaning_en":"Relieving your heart, forget all the sorrows.","meaning_bn":"মনকে শান্তি দিয়ে সব দুঃখ ভুলে যাও।","meaning_hi":"दिल को तसल्ली देकर सारे गम भूल जाओ.","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ହୃଦୟରୁ ମୁକ୍ତି, ସମସ୍ତ ଦୁ ows ଖ ଭୁଲିଯାଅ |"}},{"id":"","order":14,"type":"text","markdown":"Sibil sagay ge abo sanam hor jumid doho Bonai.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱤᱵᱤᱞ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱟᱹᱭ ᱜᱮ ᱟᱵᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱡᱩᱢᱤᱫᱽ ᱫᱚᱦᱚ ᱵᱚᱱᱟᱭ।","textLatin":"Sibil sagay ge abo sanam hor jumid doho Bonai.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_14/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সিবিল সাগায় গে আব সানাম হড় জুমিদ দহ বনায়।","textHindi":"सिबिल सागाय गे आब सानाम हड़ जुमिद दह बनाय।","textOdia":"ସିବିଲ ସାଗାୟ ଗେ ଆବ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ଜୁମିଦ ଦହ ବନାୟ।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"Olitun acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Affectionate bonding keeps all of us united.","pronunciation":"Sibil sagay ge abo sanam hor jumid doho Bonai.","meaning_en":"Affectionate bonding keeps all of us united.","meaning_bn":"স্নেহময় বন্ধন আমাদের সকলকে একতাবদ্ধ রাখে।","meaning_hi":"स्नेहपूर्ण बंधन हम सभी को एकजुट रखता है।","meaning_or":"ସ୍ନେହପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ବନ୍ଧନ ଆମ ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କୁ ଏକତ୍ର ରଖେ |"}},{"id":"","order":15,"type":"text","markdown":"Guputi katha do sanam hor samang re alom rora.","textOlChiki":"ᱜᱩᱯᱩᱛᱤ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱥᱟᱢᱟᱝ ᱨᱮ ᱟᱞᱚᱢ ᱨᱚᱲᱟ।","textLatin":"Guputi katha do sanam hor samang re alom rora.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"গুপুতি কাথা দ সানাম হড় সামাং রে আলম রড়া।","textHindi":"गुपुति काथा द सानाम हड़ सामाङ रे आलम रड़ा।","textOdia":"ଗୁପୁତି କାଥା ଦ ସାନାମ ହଡ଼ ସାମାଙ ରେ ଆଲମ ରଡ଼ା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands proudly at a crossroads in the village, pointing toward a path of opportunity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Do not speak secret talks in front of everyone.","pronunciation":"Guputi katha do sanam hor samang re alom rora.","meaning_en":"Do not speak secret talks in front of everyone.","meaning_bn":"সবার সামনে গোপন কথা বলবেন না।","meaning_hi":"गुप्त बातें सबके सामने न बोलें।","meaning_or":"ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କ ସାମ୍ନାରେ ଗୁପ୍ତ କଥାବାର୍ତ୍ତା କୁହନ୍ତୁ ନାହିଁ |"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Mone ol leka guru waag seched do jiwi re dohoy me.","textOlChiki":"ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱚᱞ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱜᱩᱨᱩ ᱟᱜ ᱥᱮᱪᱮᱫ ᱫᱚ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱫᱚᱦᱚᱭ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Mone ol leka guru waag seched do jiwi re dohoy me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"মনে অল লেকা গুরু আঃ সেচেদ দ জিওয়ি রে দহয় মে।","textHindi":"मने अल लेका गुरु वाग सेचेद द जिवि रे दहय मे।","textOdia":"ମନେ ଅଲ ଲେକା ଗୁରୁ ୱାଗ ସେଚେଦ ଦ ଜିୱି ରେ ଦହୟ ମେ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun stands with hands on hips, looking out over the village from a scenic hill, representing leadership. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Keep the teacher''s education in your soul like writing on the heart.","pronunciation":"Mone ol leka guru waag seched do jiwi re dohoy me.","meaning_en":"Keep the teacher''s education in your soul like writing on the heart.","meaning_bn":"শিক্ষকের শিক্ষা হৃদয়ে লেখার মতো আপনার আত্মায় রাখুন।","meaning_hi":"शिक्षक की शिक्षा को ह्रदय पर लेखन की भाँति अपनी आत्मा में धारण करो।","meaning_or":"ହୃଦୟରେ ଲେଖିବା ପରି ଶିକ୍ଷକଙ୍କ ଶିକ୍ଷାକୁ ତୁମର ପ୍ରାଣରେ ରଖ |"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Landa  goj leka tehenj do adi le landa keda.","textOlChiki":"ᱞᱟᱸᱫᱟ ᱜᱚᱡ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱛᱮᱦᱮᱧ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱞᱮ ᱞᱟᱸᱫᱟ ᱠᱮᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Landa  goj leka tehenj do adi le landa keda.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"লাঁদা গজ লেকা তেহেঞ দ আডি লে লাঁদা কেদা।","textHindi":"लाँदा गज लेका तेहेञ द आडि ले लाँदा केदा।","textOdia":"ଲାଁଦା ଗଜ ଲେକା ତେହେଞ ଦ ଆଡି ଲେ ଲାଁଦା କେଦା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate acknowledging and appreciating the kindness and efforts of others.","meaning":"Today we laughed so much as if dying of laughter.","pronunciation":"Landa  goj leka tehenj do adi le landa keda.","meaning_en":"Today we laughed so much as if dying of laughter.","meaning_bn":"আজ আমরা এত হাসলাম যেন হাসতে হাসতে মরেই যাব।","meaning_hi":"आज हम इतना हँसे मानो हँसते-हँसते मर रहे हों।","meaning_or":"ଆଜି ଆମେ ଏତେ ହସିଲୁ ଯେପରି ହସ ମରିବା |"}},{"id":"","order":18,"type":"text","markdown":"Kami ge dhorom  kana, onate amag kami do sari mone te kami me.","textOlChiki":"ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱜᱮ ᱫᱷᱚᱨᱚᱢ  ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱚᱱᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱢᱚᱱᱮ ᱛᱮ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Kami ge dhorom  kana, onate amag kami do sari mone te kami me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_18/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"কামি গে ধরম কামি কানা, অনাতে আমাঃ কামি দ সারি মনে তে কামি মে।","textHindi":"कामि गे धरम  काना, अनाते आमाग कामि द सारि मने ते कामि मे।","textOdia":"କାମି ଗେ ଧରମ  କାନା, ଅନାତେ ଆମାଗ କାମି ଦ ସାରି ମନେ ତେ କାମି ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Work is worship, therefore do your work with an honest heart.","pronunciation":"Kami ge dhorom  kana, onate amag kami do sari mone te kami me.","meaning_en":"Work is worship, therefore do your work with an honest heart.","meaning_bn":"কাজই ধর্ম, তাই সৎ চিত্তে কাজ কর।","meaning_hi":"कर्म ही पूजा है इसलिए सच्चे मन से कर्म करो।","meaning_or":"କାର୍ଯ୍ୟ ହେଉଛି ଉପାସନା, ତେଣୁ ତୁମର କାର୍ଯ୍ୟକୁ ଏକ ସଚ୍ଚୋଟ ହୃଦୟରେ କର |"}},{"id":"","order":19,"type":"text","markdown":"Disom dular ge sari hor hoponag man kana.","textOlChiki":"ᱫᱤᱥᱚᱢ ᱫᱩᱞᱟᱹᱲ ᱜᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱦᱚᱯᱚᱱ ᱟᱜ ᱢᱟᱹᱱ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ।","textLatin":"Disom dular ge sari hor hoponag man kana.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দিসম দুলাড় গে সারি হড় হপন আঃ মান কানা।","textHindi":"दिसम दुलाड़ गे सारि हड़ हपन आग मान काना।","textOdia":"ଦିସମ ଦୁଲାଡ଼ ଗେ ସାରି ହଡ଼ ହପନ ଆଗ ମାନ କାନା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate stands proudly at a crossroads in the village, pointing toward a path of opportunity. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Patriotism is the honor of a true Santal.","pronunciation":"Disom dular ge sari hor hoponag man kana.","meaning_en":"Patriotism is the honor of a true Santal.","meaning_bn":"দেশপ্রেম একজন প্রকৃত সাঁওতালের সম্মান।","meaning_hi":"देशभक्ति एक सच्चे संताल का सम्मान है.","meaning_or":"ଦେଶପ୍ରେମ ହେଉଛି ପ୍ରକୃତ ସାନ୍ତାଳର ସମ୍ମାନ |"}},{"id":"","order":20,"type":"text","markdown":"Sari katha ror te am do jiwi re sari santim njama.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱠᱟᱛᱷᱟ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱛᱮ ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱡᱤᱣᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱥᱟᱱᱛᱤᱢ ᱧᱟᱢᱟ।","textLatin":"Sari katha ror te am do jiwi re sari santim njama.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_20/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সারি কাথা রড় তে আম দ জিওয়ি রে সারি সানতিম ঞামা।","textHindi":"सारि काथा रड़ ते आम द जिवि रे सारि सानतिम ञामा।","textOdia":"ସାରି କାଥା ରଡ଼ ତେ ଆମ ଦ ଜିୱି ରେ ସାରି ସାନତିମ ଞାମା।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun standing tall on a hill overlooking the village, looking forward with strong resolution. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"By speaking the truth, you will find true peace in life.","pronunciation":"Sari katha ror te am do jiwi re sari santim njama.","meaning_en":"By speaking the truth, you will find true peace in life.","meaning_bn":"সত্য কথা বললে আপনি জীবনে প্রকৃত শান্তি পাবেন।","meaning_hi":"सत्य बोलने से आपको जीवन में सच्ची शांति मिलेगी।","meaning_or":"ସତ୍ୟ କହିବା ଦ୍ୱାରା ତୁମେ ଜୀବନରେ ପ୍ରକୃତ ଶାନ୍ତି ପାଇବ |"}},{"id":"","order":21,"type":"text","markdown":"Ale odag re sagun daram!  durub me gate.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱞᱮ ᱚᱲᱟᱜ ᱨᱮ  ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱫᱟᱨᱟᱢ!  ᱫᱩᱲᱩᱵ ᱢᱮ ᱜᱟᱛᱮ.","textLatin":"Ale odag re sagun daram!  durub me gate.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_21/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সাগুন দারাম!  আলে অড়াঃ রে দুড়ুব মে গাতে.","textHindi":"आले अड़ाग रे  सागुन दाराम!  दुड़ुब मे गाते.","textOdia":"ଆଲେ ଅଡ଼ାଗ ରେ  ସାଗୁନ ଦାରାମ!  ଦୁଡ଼ୁବ ମେ ଗାତେ.","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate smiling warmly while pointing happily toward the learner, conveying friendship and belonging. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Welcome to our home , have a seat friend.","pronunciation":"Ale odag re sagun daram!  durub me gate.","meaning_en":"Welcome to our home , have a seat friend.","meaning_bn":"আমাদের বাড়িতে স্বাগতম! বসো বন্ধু।","meaning_hi":"हमारे घर में स्वागत है! बैठो मेरे दोस्त।","meaning_or":"ଆମ ଘରକୁ ସ୍ୱାଗତ! ବସ ସାଙ୍ଗ।"}},{"id":"","order":22,"type":"text","markdown":"Napay te jiraw kate amag geyan hor re lahag me.","textOlChiki":"ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱛᱮ ᱡᱤᱨᱟᱹᱣ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱟᱢᱟᱜ ᱜᱮᱭᱟᱱ ᱦᱚᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱞᱟᱦᱟᱜ ᱢᱮ।","textLatin":"Napay te jiraw kate amag geyan hor re lahag me.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_22/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_folk_3_22/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"নাপায় তে জিরাওয় কাতে আমাঃ গেয়ান হর রে লাহাঃ মে।","textHindi":"नापाय ते जिराव काते आमाग गेयान हर रे लाहाग मे।","textOdia":"ନାପାୟ ତେ ଜିରାୱ କାତେ ଆମାଗ ଗେୟାନ ହର ରେ ଲାହାଗ ମେ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun sits in a circle with friends around a small fire, gesturing warmly while sharing a traditional story. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"Resting well, advance on your path of knowledge.","pronunciation":"Napay te jiraw kate amag geyan hor re lahag me.","meaning_en":"Resting well, advance on your path of knowledge.","meaning_bn":"ভালভাবে বিশ্রাম নিন, আপনার জ্ঞানের পথে এগিয়ে যান।","meaning_hi":"अच्छे से आराम करो, अपने ज्ञान पथ पर आगे बढ़ो।","meaning_or":"ଭଲ ଭାବରେ ବିଶ୍ରାମ କର, ତୁମର ଜ୍ଞାନ ପଥରେ ଅଗ୍ରଗତି କର |"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
