termed_11/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আমাঃ মনে আলম বাড়িজা, সারি কাথা রড় মে।","textHindi":"आमाग मने आलम बाड़िजा, सारि काथा रड़ मे।","textOdia":"ଆମାଗ ମନେ ଆଲମ ବାଡ଼ିଜା, ସାରି କାଥା ରଡ଼ ମେ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate standing tall on a hill overlooking the village, looking forward with strong resolution. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"Do not ruin your heart, speak the truth.","pronunciation":"Amaag mone alom barija, sari katha ror me.","meaning_en":"Do not ruin your heart, speak the truth.","meaning_bn":"মন খারাপ করবে না, সত্য কথা বল।","meaning_hi":"अपना दिल ख़राब मत करो, सच बोलो।","meaning_or":"ତୁମର ହୃଦୟକୁ ନଷ୍ଟ କର ନାହିଁ, ସତ କୁହ |"}},{"id":"","order":12,"type":"text","markdown":"Uni do kami lagid tandi te chalaw akana।","textOlChiki":"ᱩᱱᱤ ᱫᱚ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱴᱟᱺᱰᱤ ᱛᱮ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟᱭ।","textLatin":"Uni do kami lagid tandi te chalaw akana।","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_12/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"উনি দ কামি লাগিদ টাঁডি তে চালাও আকানায়।","textHindi":"उनि द कामि लागिद टाःडि ते चालाव आकानाय।","textOdia":"ଉନି ଦ କାମି ଲାଗିଦ ଟାଃଡି ତେ ଚାଲାୱ ଆକାନାୟ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"Olitun carefully carrying out a task, like neatly filing books or designing a wooden model. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"Olitun celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"He has gone to the field for work.","pronunciation":"Uni do kami lagid tandi te chalaw akanai.","meaning_en":"He has gone to the field for work.","meaning_bn":"সে কাজের জন্য মাঠে গিয়েছে।","meaning_hi":"वह काम के सिलसिले में खेत पर गया है.","meaning_or":"ସେ କାମ ପାଇଁ କ୍ଷେତକୁ ଯାଇଛନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":13,"type":"text","markdown":"Atu rin hor do adi sadhu ar napay geya ko.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱤᱱ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱹᱰᱤ ᱥᱟᱹᱫᱷᱩ ᱟᱨ ᱱᱟᱯᱟᱭ ᱜᱮᱭᱟ ᱠᱚ।","textLatin":"Atu rin hor do adi sadhu ar napay geya ko.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_13/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আতু রিন হড় দ আডি সাধু আর নাপায় গেয়া ক।","textHindi":"आतु रिन हड़ द आडि साधु आर नापाय गेया क।","textOdia":"ଆତୁ ରିନ ହଡ଼ ଦ ଆଡି ସାଧୁ ଆର ନାପାୟ ଗେୟା କ।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate gestures toward a village map drawn on a board, explaining a plan to classmates with confidence. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"The village people are very honest and kind.","pronunciation":"Atu rin hor do adi sadhu ar napay geya ko.","meaning_en":"The village people are very honest and kind.","meaning_bn":"গ্রামের মানুষ খুবই সৎ ও দয়ালু।","meaning_hi":"गाँव के लोग बहुत ई