intermed_15/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"দাগ রিতু রে দ গাডা দাগ তে পেরেজঃ আ।","textHindi":"दाग रितु रे द गाडा दाग ते पेरेजगआ।","textOdia":"ଦାଗ ରିତୁ ରେ ଦ ଗାଡା ଦାଗ ତେ ପେରେଜଗଆ।","emotion":"Pride","storyArc":"Working Together","growthValue":"Leadership","characterGoal":"Solve a problem","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate drinking cool, clean water from a traditional clay pot, looking refreshed and happy. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Standing proud and tall, head high, shoulders back, holding cultural artifacts or projects.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate celebrating cultural identity, heritage, and personal achievements.","meaning":"In the rainy season, the river overflows with water.","pronunciation":"Dag ritu re do gada dag te perejog aa.","meaning_en":"In the rainy season, the river overflows with water.","meaning_bn":"বর্ষায় নদীতে পানি উপচে পড়ে।","meaning_hi":"बरसात के मौसम में नदी पानी से लबालब भर जाती है।","meaning_or":"ବର୍ଷା In ତୁରେ ନଦୀ ଜଳ ପ୍ରବାହିତ ହୁଏ।"}},{"id":"","order":16,"type":"text","markdown":"Atu rin hor do Manjhi than re jawra kate bichareda ko.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱤᱱ ᱦᱚᱲ ᱫᱚ ᱢᱟᱹᱧᱡᱷᱤ ᱛᱷᱟᱱ ᱨᱮ ᱡᱟᱣᱨᱟ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱠᱚ ᱵᱤᱪᱟᱹᱨᱮᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Atu rin hor do Manjhi than re jawra kate bichareda ko.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_16/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আতু রিন হড় দ মাঞঝি থান রে জাওয়রা কাতে ক বিচারেদা।","textHindi":"आतु रिन हड़ द माञझि थान रे जावरा काते क बिचारेदा।","textOdia":"ଆତୁ ରିନ ହଡ଼ ଦ ମାଞଝି ଥାନ ରେ ଜାୱରା କାତେ କ ବିଚାରେଦା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"Olitun playing a traditional hand-drum (tumdak) with an energetic, rhythmic posture and a wide smile. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"Olitun enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"The villagers gather at the headman''s altar and are discussing.","pronunciation":"Atu rin hor do Manjhi than re jawra kate bichareda ko.","meaning_en":"The villagers gather at the headman''s altar and are discussing.","meaning_bn":"গ্রামের লোকেরা মাঝি থানে জড়ো হয়ে বিচার করছে।","meaning_hi":"गाँव के लोग माँझी थान में इकट्ठा होकर विचार-विमर्श कर रहे हैं।","meaning_or":"ଗାଁର ଲୋକମାନେ ମାଝି ଥାନ୍ ରେ ଏକାଠି ହୋଇ ବିଚାର କରୁଛନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":17,"type":"text","markdown":"Sohrae porob re kuri hopon ko hasa bhit re chitar ko sajaw eda.","textOlChiki":"ᱥᱚᱦᱨᱟᱭ ᱯᱚᱨᱚᱵ ᱨᱮ ᱠᱩᱲᱤ ᱦᱚᱯᱚᱱ ᱠᱚ ᱦᱟᱥᱟ ᱵᱷᱤᱛ ᱨᱮ ᱪᱤᱛᱟᱹᱨ ᱠᱚ ᱥᱟᱡᱟᱣ ᱮᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Sohrae porob re kuri hopon ko hasa bhit re chitar ko sajaw eda.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_17/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"সহরায় পরব রে কুড়ি হপন ক হাসা ভিত রে চিতার ক সাজাওয় এদা।","textHindi":"सहराय परब रे कुड़ि हपन क हासा भित रे चितार क साजाव एदा।","textOdia":"ସହରାୟ ପରବ ରେ କୁଡ଼ି ହପନ କ ହାସା ଭିତ ରେ ଚିତାର କ ସାଜାୱ ଏଦା।","emotion":"Gratitude","storyArc":"Dreaming Big","growthValue":"Problem Solving","characterGoal":"Create something useful","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate holding a handful of rich, dark soil, ready to plant seeds, looking hopeful and proud. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Slightly bowed head, hands held together or offering a token of appreciation, warm smile.","learningMoment":"