":"Tumdag ar tamak ru anjom kate kora ar kuri ko enej eda.","meaning_bn":"তোমার আর টামাকের বাজনা শুনে পুরুষ আর মহিলারা নাচ করছে।","meaning_hi":"तुमदा और टामाक की आवाज़ सुनकर लड़के लड़कियाँ नाच रहे हैं।","meaning_or":"ତୁମ୍ଦା ଏବଂ ଟାମାକ୍ ର ଆୱାଜ୍ ଶୁଣି ପୁଅ ଏବଂ ଝିଅମାନେ ନାଚୁଛନ୍ତି।"}},{"id":"","order":19,"type":"text","markdown":"Atu reyag kulhi do sagun sakam ar baha te ko sajaw akada.","textOlChiki":"ᱟᱹᱛᱩ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱠᱩᱞᱦᱤ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱹᱜᱩᱱ ᱥᱟᱠᱟᱢ ᱟᱨ ᱵᱟᱦᱟ ᱛᱮ ᱠᱚ ᱥᱟᱡᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱫᱟ।","textLatin":"Atu reyag kulhi do sagun sakam ar baha te ko sajaw akada.","audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","meta":{"audioUrl":"https://sgp.cloud.appwrite.io/v1/storage/buckets/audio/files/snd_sentences_complex_intermed_19/view?project=699495910038e39622c5","textBengali":"আতু রেয়াগ কুলহি দ সাগুন সাকাম আর বাহা তে ক সাজাওয় আকাদা।","textHindi":"आतु रेयाग कुलहि द सागुन साकाम आर बाहा ते क साजाव आकादा।","textOdia":"ଆତୁ ରେୟାଗ କୁଲହି ଦ ସାଗୁନ ସାକାମ ଆର ବାହା ତେ କ ସାଜାୱ ଆକାଦା।","emotion":"Achievement","storyArc":"Exploring Nature","growthValue":"Creativity","characterGoal":"Teach others","imageDirection":"a young Santhal child classmate planting a young green seedling in rich soil, showing care and responsibility for nature. Show only the speaking character, never show both speakers in the same frame.","bodyLanguage":"Cheerful smile, hands raised in a small celebration or showing a finished project.","learningMoment":"a young Santhal child classmate enjoying the reward of dedication, effort, and hard work.","meaning":"They have decorated the village street with auspicious leaves and flowers.","pronunciation":"Atu reyag kulhi do sagun sakam ar baha te ko sajaw akada.","meaning_en":"They have decorated the village street with auspicious leaves and flowers.","meaning_bn":"তারা শুভ পাতা ও ফুল দিয়ে গ্রামের রাস্তা সাজিয়েছে।","meaning_hi":"उन्होंने गाँव की सड़क को शुभ पत्तों और फूलों से सजाया है।","meaning_or":"ସେମାନେ ଶୁଭ ପତ୍ର ଏବଂ ଫୁଲରେ ଗାଁ ରାସ୍ତାକୁ ସଜାଇଛନ୍ତି।"}}],"order":0,"heroMediaUrl":null,"heroMediaType":null,"heroPosterUrl":null,"hero_media":null,"tracing":null,"isPreview":false}');
